king Leaders, Amaria, the Water Leader!"BHowever, Amaria seems to have disappeared somewhere else now."Where could she have gone?"HIs there something more important to her than the safety of Reborn?"�With the chaos in the Obsidia Ward finally settled, the dwindling city police force turns its attention once more to the Jasper and Beryl Wards."]Both equally ravaged by the barrage of floral witchcraft, the damage may be irreparable!">Nonetheless, brave Trainers venture forth into the wards!"LIs it perhaps to traverse the ruins for any leftover treasures to find?"$Perhaps they simply seek glory!"GThe only way to-- Wait, what's this? Something just flew overhead!" It's landed not far away..."!Excuse me there, young girl!";Would you be willing to answer a few questions for us?"???: Back off, I'm busy!")I'm going to stop this thing myself!"#Salamence, it's take-off time!""GARDEVOIR: ...And she's gone."$How rude for such a young girl!"'But just what DOES she plan to do?"`This just in! It seems a massive bomb was detonated in the heart of the North Obsidia Ward!"COfficials rush to the scene, escorting fleeing civilians away!"OIt seems the target of the destruction was Reborn's famous Grand Stairway!"HA massive case of stone steps leading to a now-abandoned city exit."'But how could this have happened?!"HWhy would anyone want to target such a seemingly simple structure?!"GOfficials continue to investigate the recent death in Reborn City!"~The subject has been identified as Corey, former Poison Leader of the Beryl Gym, but the circumstances remain largely unknown."kHowever! Rumor has it that the former Leader may have had some secret ties to the devious Team Meteor!"4More on this as we discover the shocking truth.";Could there be other Leaders with similar connections?"*Is there some dark plot engulfing us?"CCorey leaves behind a daughter, Heather-- rude little thing..."(But she has currently gone missing!"/What could have happened to the poor girl?"4Mysterious things are happening in Reborn City!"FIn recent news, the local Orphanage has recently had a break-out!"LWhat a shocker for Dr. Sigmund Connal, head caretaker and psychiatrist!"rMeanwhile, by some mystery, the old Power Plant across Beryl Bridge, inactive for years, happened to fire up!"�Residents of the Obsidia Ward looked on in awe as they saw the ruins of the old Yureyu building, former economic capital of Reborn, come to life!"/Could this spell a rebirth of the company?"KThe only thing for sure is that someone is in that building! But who?!"�Breaking news! The abandoned factory in the Peridot Ward, infamous for having continued running for years seemingly with no cause..."...Has suddenly shut down!"�I, your stealthy Gossip Gardevoir, went in depth and undercover to discover the truth behind this mechanical mayhem, and the results were shocking!"UIt turns out, the factory was secretly being run by none other than Team Meteor!"FAnd more, they were using it to deliberately poison Azurine Lake!"SWhat a terrible thing to do! But what could Team Meteor possibly gain from it?":Even now, the water doesn't seem to be clearing up..."#Is there more treachery afoot?"}This just in: Within days since the death of former Reborn Leader Corey, a second death has ravaged the famous Reborn League."qApophyll Sensei Kiki is reported to have been killed atop Pyrous Mountain, above her home on Apophyll Beach."mThe murderer is rumored to be the leader of the devious Team Meteor, who successfully escaped the scene."�Kiki, a revered teacher at her beach resort Apophyll Academy, which she herself built from the ground up, will be replaced by her apprentice."lBut what could Team Meteor hope to gain by killing her? Was it an accident, or something more sinister?"�New reports suggest that the old Yureyu building, the former economic capital of Reborn City, may have had a different fate than we had previously believed."�According to Reborn history, it was after a series of unfortunate earthquakes that the Yureyu HQ collapsed and the company went under."VAs it did, the Power Plant shut down, leaving the city dark, and soon, abandoned."LBut our latest report says these earthquakes were never a real problem.":Instead, behind it all was the dastardly Team Meteor!"TSo this means Team Meteor was responsible for shutting down the city years ago!"/But what could they hope to gain from it?!"HExcept this isn't the greatest news at all-- in fact it's terrible!"BThere's been a kidnapping, and you'll never guess the victim!"It's me!"LWaste your time not on questioning how this is aired. Somebody help me!"-But for those of you really wondering..."CRecently, an explosion has rocked the peak of Tanzan Mountain!"�Officials are still investigating the cause, but rumors trickling down the mountain as they come suggest this could be another one of Team Meteor's schemes!"�Allegedly, the dastardly team appears to have held a base up there, but if indeed it was their base that was destroyed, then why?"@Could they have terminated their own facility for security?"Were they attacked?"2Or did something go horribly, horribly wrong?"oIt has been drama ALL over the place here at the Vanhanen Castle! First I was kidnapped, and now Luna too!"Chaos, I tell you!"&This is hardly even a news story!"CIt would be more of one, but I'm off to search for my darling."Will I even find her!?"dWith things settling back down, it's nice to get to sit back and do a real news story for once!"5So much doom and gloom in the past few episodes!",Let's focus on something more positive!"aRecently, a mysterious person rescued from the depths of a secret ancient underground ruin--"DWow, that sounds like something out of a manga or video game!--"_...Has taken on the ambitious job of personally restoring Reborn City to its former glory!"�A recent meeting saw Reborn League manager Ame, along with League Leaders Julia and Florinia, join together to fix up this broken city once and for all!"IHowever, these sorts of efforts have been historically unsuccessful.")Could Reborn City finally be Reborn?"6Or will this be just another fleeting pipe dream?"fI'm here in Calcenon City with Dragon Leader Saphira where a sudden showdown has just taken form!"VAs most know, the cities of Calcenon and Labradorra sit right next to each other."tBut in a sudden uprising, the evil organization, Team Meteor, has completely seized control of Labradorra City!"TMost citizens were safely evacuated, but some are still being held as hostages!"oHowever, a resistance is taking shape in Calcenon City on the part of some of Reborn's strongest Trainers!"6Saphira, what are your thoughts on this scenario?":SAPHIRA: I'm not interested in negotiating with them."DWe'll find a way around the barrier and take back the hostages."+GARDEVOIR: The barrier-- that's right!"5Team Meteor is employing a special technology..."?My sources tell me the machine they use is called a PULSE!"]And they've hooked a Mr. Mime up to it, creating a massive forcefield around Labradorra!"&SAPHIRA: It isn't their only one."sWe know that they're preparing a second PULSE within the city, and they have two more in the surrounding area."zGARDEVOIR: With these mysterious machines amping up their Pokémon's powers, there's no telling what they'll do next!"9Can anything break the forcefield around Labradorra?"4What will happen to the resistance in Calcenon?"<The situation in Calcenon has gotten even MORE intense!"�Team Meteor has set up a second PULSE-Pokémon from Labradorra City, and is currently actively attempting to siege the city of Calcenon!"qWith their hyper-charged PULSE Clawitzer, those Mega-Launched blasts are wreaking havoc all around the city!"LWith the barrier still up, there seems to be no hope of counter-attack!"All is not lost though!"vDragon Leader Saphira continues to rebel against Team Meteor as she and her Dragonite try to deflect each attack!"'Will she be able to hang in there?".Or will Meteor's barrage prove too much?!"8We've got breaking news coming in from Reborn City."|We've received an anonymous tip suggesting to us that the dastardly Team Meteor, known for breaking the very region apart..."H...Has yet another base inside Reborn City, under everyone's noses!"�Although this is not a terrible surprise considering at least three of their previous hideouts within the city limits have already been routed..."�City officials are disturbed at the prospect of there being still another one, having believed Meteor to be purged from the city."8The battle between Reborn and Team Meteor rages on!"%Where could this secret base be?"Citizens of Reborn, keep an eye out for any suspicious or hidden places you find that might be exploitable by Team Meteor!"And as always..."DThe atmosphere here in Reborn City is absolutely unprecedented!"�Thanks to an outpouring of new policies by the city center and the inspiration of one of Reborn's Gym Leaders, Adrienn, the city is bursting with life!"iCitizens everywhere have undertaken a massive effort to rebuild and revitalize the ailed metropolis."�Here on the scene, we're just finishing up some of the structural repairs, and are moving on to make some aesthetic improvements!"6It's something like you would not believe, folks!"�I'm still waiting for the giant demon of despair to burst forth from the cracks below and ruin everything, since that seems to be how things go here!"=But could this really be a new chapter in Reborn's book?"!Reborn City needs YOUR help!")Do you have a passion for tinkering?"Making things?"Organization?"Helping others?";Or do you just want to make a difference in the world?"�Then stop by your local Grand Hall today to register with the City Reconstruction Project and find out how YOU can make a difference!"|With your help and our efforts combined, we can make Reborn the shining city it was always meant to be, one brick at a time!"...Eh? A demonstration?"8What do you mean, you want ME to move those bricks?"fI'm a Gardevoir, not a Machoke! Leave that kind of work to the Pokémon that are designed for it!")What do you mean, that's offensive?!">Look, you're the one who wanted me to do this commercial!"4Ughhh, you're still gonna pay me anyway, right?"-And here it is-- Reborn is CHAMPIONLESS!"You heard right!"�Reborn Champion and League Manager Ame has suddenly resigned from her position after an official address to the board of directors at the Grand Hall."3The full address has not yet been made public,"dBut sources say that Ame cited slight physical health concerns as the reason for her departure."�As the original force behind the reopening of the Reborn League and the subsequent repopulation of our fair region, Ame will be missed dearly."�Her time defending the Champion title was short-lived but fiercely guarded by the Reborn Leaders who collectively did not allow a single challenger through!"Talk about a challenge!"sBut rest assured, Trainers, the Reborn League is as open as ever, and there is no better time to take up arms!"EManagement of the Reborn League has passed to capable new hands:"KAdrienn Flores, Reborn League Fairy Gym Leader and RCRP Administrator,"lAnd Victoria Marlow, Reborn League Reserve Fighting Gym Leader and Head Instructor of Apophyll Academy!"�These two have been irreplaceable in Reborn City's rejuvenation, and the Reborn League shall surely fall safely back into order under their guidance."IAnd for all of you challengers wondering about that Champion spot..."Reborn's next Champion..."...could be you!"�The first Trainer who is able to collect all 18 Badges and navigate Victory Road to the Hall of Fame will become Reborn's Champion!"Do YOU have what it takes?"PSerial disappearances continue in the Carnelia Region as Agate slumbers on!"fMany people have been aware for quite some time that Agate City has been put to an enduring rest,"9But the less well known news comes just north of it!"|The anti-Meteor resistance in Calcenon has been losing steam for som