ertaken a huge number of renovation projects, which no doubt everyone within the city limits has noticed."vTell us, after being trapped in time for more than a decade, what inspired you to take on this enormous workload?"AADRIENN: When I grew up-- or rather, in the time I grew up--"5This whole time distortion thing is confusing..."eBack then, Reborn was a region renowned for its beauty, and the city matched that acre for acre."\Since I came back, I've seen so many ways how Reborn City is just not what it once was.""It's shocking-- painful even."KSo, it's only natural that I'm going to do everything I can to fix it."NGARDEVOIR: Well said! Aren't you cute, always playing the good samaritan!"#I will protect you, Gardevoir!"1ADRIENN: Ahaha, can't we let that go by now?"GARDEVOIR: Nope!"4I will restore the city! It's adorable, really!"KADRIENN: Do I really sound like that? You're starting to embarrass me.".GARDEVOIR: Good! That's my job, you know?".ADRIENN: No, I um, didn't know, actually."+I thought this was a formal interview?"&GARDEVOIR: It is! It's so formal!"It's the formal-est!"3There hasn't been a more formal interview yet!"BADRIENN: Based on the ones I've seen, I would believe that..."4GARDEVOIR: What? What's that supposed to mean?!"LNow listen here, before you go saying that, let me explain you a thing!"Wait, first... Cut, cut!"NToday we have a special report with Gym Leader Florinia of the Onyx Ward!"fMany Trainers are well-acquainted with Florinia as the headmistress of the Onyx Trainers' School."cTell us, Florinia, how exactly did you manage to secure a position so prestigious at your age?"lFLORINIA: Principality of the school was requested following the acceptance of the Gym Leader position."{The conversion of city-public property was acknowledged as necessary to be forfeit for the foundation of the Reborn League,"=Thus, what was once solely a school became solely a Gym."lUpon gaining control of the facility, and proper permissions following, the institution was hybridized."KGARDEVOIR: I see! So in other words, it was your idea to combine them!"WYou must have a real passion for education to be willing to take that on yourself!"/FLORINIA: Passion is an irrelevant factor."FThe operation is necessary, and I am able to function adequately."<GARDEVOIR: Oh? Does that mean you don't enjoy the work?")FLORINIA: Enjoyment is a triviality."Only function matters."GARDEVOIR: How boring!">Surely there must be something you enjoy doing, Florinia?"bFLORINIA: Personal emotion is too confounding of a condition to reach that assumption safely."DAnd misinterpretation of human emotion can lead to severe risk."iThis writer has already lost too much at its hand; thus, as logically directed, the risk is avoided."%GARDEVOIR: Oh my, this is juicy!"vSo you were hurt by someone in the past and that's why you ignore your emotions-- is that what I'm understanding?"1FLORINIA: That is a sufficent abstract, yes."/GARDEVOIR: Lovely! Do tell, what happened?"6FLORINIA: The conclusion will not be forthcoming.")The previous analysis is sufficient."Good bye."=GARDEVOIR: What? I say when the interview ends, not you!",Darn it! This was finally getting good!"CI'm here right now with someone very special to me personally."JSay hello to Reborn's Ice Gym Leader and former model, Serra Voclain!"4SERRA: Goodness, Gardevoir, this is a surprise."MI assumed you'd come back home to collect your belongings, not for this."@GARDEVOIR: What's the matter? You seem almost disappointed!"!SERRA: No, not in the least."DNeither by the interview nor by you not collecting your things."1Lord knows no one else is using those rooms."BIt's just been a long time since I've had a public interview."-It's not a feeling I'd expected to miss."dGARDEVOIR: That's right, you gave up your career for your son before. Do you regret doing that?"SERRA: It's hard to say."�I think the best way to put it is-- although I do feel remorse for what I've lost, I wouldn't change my decision even if I could."?There are more important things than passions and careers.";GARDEVOIR: You mean your son, of course. How touching!"But, tell me, how do you respond to the recent developments wherein he's fallen in with the terrorist organization Team Meteor?"SERRA: I'm sorry."He's what?"~GARDEVOIR: In his recent exploits, it seems likely he's been working under and assisting Team Meteor in destroying the region!"SERRA: He's--"&...Gardevoir, take me to Bennett."BGARDEVOIR: Ah, in time, but let's finish the interview first?"SERRA: Gardevoir."Take me to Bennett."GARDEVOIR: ...Yes, missus."mI'm here today at the homestead and gymstead of one of Reborn's most popular Trainers, Ms. Amaria Fiore!"�Unfortunately, and in a surprise twist for our Interview Intermission, Amaria is actually not available for comment right now..."9...seeing as she is currently setting up for battle!"�There's been quite a lot going on in this bubbly beauty's life, but luckily, your truest friend, Gossip Gardevoir, is here to catch up to speed."�See, after a recent accident of questionably self- inflicted causes, Ms. Fiore here has developed a sudden textbook case of retrograde amnesia,"�And as such has forgotten everything that's occured in recent events, including things that should have been precious to her and her loved ones."�The battle that's taking place today is not between her and a challenger, but between her and a representative of the Reborn League,"QTo assess if she is still able to retain her position despite her condition!"�Everything is on the line for Amaria today! If it proves that her battling ability went down the drain with her memory, she could find herself out of a job in a snap!">Let's cut to the battlefield now and see how she's doing!">Oh, there's nothing happening? Have they not started yet?"1...What do you mean, they already finished!?"AI was still giving the intro! What kind of battle was that?!"O-oh. I... I see."Well, folks,"PIn a turn of events that is at once altogether unsurprising yet unexpected,"}In the time it took me to preface the battle, Amaria has already beaten her opponent for a flawless six-zero shutout victory!"~Gotta hand it to the woman of the water, she sure knows how to cling onto her talent even when she loses everything else!"jAnd that, my dear viewers, is exactly proof as to why she is one of Reborn's most famous Gym Leaders!"RToday we're meeting Julia Wilde in a quaint cafe to get a bite-- and a scoop."Here she comes now--"XShe strolls through the door, swag in every step and saffron seifuku in full bloom,"_She rocks a pair of shades like it's nobody's business and they just have to deal with it."HThe girl's got style, the girl's got class, she's coming this way--"...And she crashed."$Julia, helloooo? I'm over here!"JULIA: Huh..."OGARDEVOIR: Just where were you looking?! You walked right into that table!"!JULIA: Oh... Good morning..."zGARDEVOIR: Wait, were you wearing those shades just to hide the fact that your eyes were closed as you were walking?!"OJULIA: Well, duh... How else am I gonna sleepwalk without anyone noticing?"JGARDEVOIR: I'm not so sure that's quite how sleepwalking works, dear."2JULIA: Hey, who's the expert here? You or me?"2I don't see you sleepwalking into any tables!"GARDEVOIR: As if I would!"ASo much for class... Go on, pick up that chair and sit down."TSo, Julia, I understand you have somewhat of a fixation with blowing things up."JULIA: It's just a hobby!"7GARDEVOIR: Could you tell us how that got started?"JULIA: Yeah!"�Okay, so, when I was younger, I dated this guy named Rod-- actually, was it Rod? Maybe that was Ringo... I always get them mixed up. Anyways--"�So, we were out at the park this one time and he keeps like, checking his phone, right? So, at one point he steps into the restroom and I check it too,"�To like, see what was so important that he was taking time away from me-- anyway, it turned out he was texting this other girl, and you know,"QThere's really only one logical thing to do in a situation like that, right?"�Which is to open up his phone and change around a couple wires and have a Pokémon jolt up the battery, just to make it glitch out, give a little spook, right?")I mean, that's what anyone would do."~So, he gets back from the bathroom and starts up the phone and he doesn't expect a thing, but I'm just sitting there like ":3""~And then, suddenly the whole device sparks and the screen melts and he screams and throws it away and it hits a wall and BOOM!")I hadn't felt that excited in years!"7Like, blowing things up is WAY more fun than guys."2But if you COMBINE the two, it's even better!"hNot that I'm trying to blow any guys up... But you know, the look on their faces is just priceless!""GARDEVOIR: I'm... sure it is."6Listen, have you considered professional therapy?"JULIA: Therapy? Me?"hOh, no, I'm not really good at giving advice and helping people. I'm flattered you think so though!"BAnyway, I thought the whole kaboom-thing might come up today,"#So I prepared a demonstration!"Do you wanna see?"GARDEVOIR: NO."-beep-"GARDEVOIR: Uh."qToday I'm here in Calcenon City to interview the smoldering beauty famed for the flames-- Charlotte Belrose!"?Charlotte, thanks for taking the time to talk to me today."ICHARLOTTE: Sure thing, Gardevoir. In fact, I should be thanking you."PWe're in ground zero and things are about as boring as they can be up here."^It's always a pleasure to take some time out of my day to embarrass someone on public TV."1GARDEVOIR: That's-- No, wait, that's my job.",CHARLOTTE: By 'someone' I meant myself."=GARDEVOIR: Oh! Well, no need to be embarrassed, darling."5I must admit, you didn't seem like the shy type."CHARLOTTE: I'm not."GARDEVOIR: Well-- okay."=Whatever the case, don't worry, I'm sure you'll do fine!"'CHARLOTTE: I'm not worried either."5I wasn't even serious about embarrassing myself."_But it's nice that you try and think of the comfort levels of your guests once in a while."nGARDEVOIR: Of course! That's just what a good hostess should-- Wait, what do you mean, "Once in a while"?"/CHARLOTTE: I've seen your past interviews."SYou normally just act all high and mighty while you put someone else on blast."Am I wrong?"'GARDEVOIR: Of course you're wrong!"gCHARLOTTE: That's funny, because I distinctly remember you tearing into Aya in a previous episode.":Threatening to tell the world about her relationship?",That doesn't seem very courteous to me."&GARDEVOIR: She called the police!"3CHARLOTTE: You're right, that was rude of her."AAlmost as rude as you being in her house without permission."EGARDEVOIR: And still not half as rude as you're being right now!"!CHARLOTTE: Oh, you're right."�My apologies, Gardevoir, I thought that you would be more supportive of your fans who've watched so many of your past TV appearances."9I guess this is just how much we mean to you though."0GARDEVOIR: That's not what I'm saying! Ugh!"fCHARLOTTE: You've got such a short fuse. Do you really get along well with the sponsors this way?"-GARDEVOIR: That's none of your business!"1CHARLOTTE: Do you want to know what I think?"I think you're lying."GARDEVOIR: Lying?""Okay, sure, this sounds good."'Tell me, almighty, wise Charlotte."What am I lying about?")CHARLOTTE: You're lying to yourself."6You know the truth about why this show is funded."%It's because you're a character."LGARDEVOIR: A character? Like in a game or something? That's ridiculous."^CHARLOTTE: You're sold to the public masses as a foolish, incompetent reporter character."CThe only value in these interviews comes from your buffoonery."(Why else wouldn't it be edited out?"GBut you have this egocentric streak that lashes back when prodded."JIf you were really playing a character, you wouldn't be so sensitive."YYou'd have an understanding that the you on TV is different than who you really are."But you don't."IBecause you're every bit as impulsive and incompetent as you appear."But the worst part is,".You won't admit it even when you know it."`Even if you're impulsive, you're not so stupid as to not have thought about your own shows."�You realized that you were just being used and made fun of, but you wanted to believe you were actually a famous person people cared about."OSo you've been playing make-believe with your own success this whole time.""GARDEVOIR: That's nonsense..."CHARLOTTE: Is it?"/Look me in the eyes and tell me I'm wrong."8We're here today with one of Reborn's Elite Four..."She's powerful..."She's ferocious..."AAnd she's four feet and three inches of pure battling skill!"'Let's hear it for Heather Molinar!"8Heather, thanks so much for joining us on the show!".HEATHER: Thanks for having me, Gardevoir!"KIt's a nice change for someone to recognize strength when they see it!"CGARDEVOIR: Those are some mighty words for such a tiny person!"GBut certainly your status threatens to back those words up nicely.">Can you tell us where you think your strength comes from?"9HEATHER: Well, obviously, it comes from my Pokémon."And..."I guess, my friends too."5GARDEVOIR: Your friends? Whoever could you mean?"fHEATHER: Well, there were a couple Trainers who wanted to help me out after I ran away from home.""Cain, even though he's weird."+And \PN keeps showing up everywhere..."HEven I know things wouldn't have worked out this well without them."But mostly..."I mean my friend, Shelly."IWe met after I got mad at my dad and took off for a few days before."FShe hid me in her Gym and we had a lot of fun playing together..."Well, I had fun, at least.".I guess we just always did what I wanted.";But she was there to help me after things got bad too."3I guess she liked me too, for whatever reason.""I don't really get it, but...",I wanna try and make it back up to her."1She was really nice to me and I was selfish."2So I gotta be a good friend from now on, too."HGARDEVOIR: Admirable words from someone who's been through so much!"KIt seems like this young Trainer has really found the resolve to grow!"GI wonder what that could mean for the future of this battler, too!"cAny certain Trainers out there looking to face the Elite Four soon may just want to watch out!"DHEATHER: Obviously! It's just cuz I'm the princess of the wind!">GARDEVOIR: The princess of the wind? However do you mean?"ZHEATHER: My Mom was a Flying-type Trainer too, so that's kind of like being the wind!"`I learned what I could from how she used to battle, and now I'm even stronger than she was!";GARDEVOIR: Oh my, even stronger? That's quite a claim!"WHEATHER: But it's true! Cuz she only used frilly Pokémon she thought were cute..."Like Salamence!"_Okay, so it's not exactly the usual "cute"-- but that shouldn't be the determining factor!"IAs a top tier battler, I'm not afraid to use the big, powerful ones!"XEveryone's always like "Whaaat? Why would a little girl want a Pokémon like that?""oAnd they try to pass me off with Buneary or Pikachu or some other crap Fairy trash just because it's pink.""Who cares about any of that?!"4I don't need to look cute, I need to kick butt!"*And that's exactly what I'm gonna do!"1GARDEVOIR: That's quite the fighting spirit!"uAnd there you have it, folks-- a girl who's not afraid to take on the whole world with the help of her Pokémon!"UI feel sorry for whatever stray challenger ends up opposite to her in the arena!"4That's all on today's Interview Intermission..."CThat's all on today's Interview Intermission. Until next time!"|Yo, Reborn City! What's up?! We're here with the Reborn Rundown, giving you a look at the Leaders of the Reborn League!",I'm your host, DJ Arclight, now on air!"5Let's talk about Julia, the Peridot Ward Leader."uJulia's a bombastic battling babe bursting onto the scene after having graduated from the Onyx Trainers' School."{With a history of leading Pokémon and cheerleading teams alike, any challenger is promised an exciting battle against her!"}Her Electric-types fall right in line with this, beating down her competitors with a barrage of her signature "boomies"."�Sonic Boom and Explosion attacks form the chorus of her routine, so any Trainers planning to take her on should be ready to take some hits!"~Take particular care with her Electrode, whose lightning-fast Speed and set damage takes the battle to a crescendo in a blink!"qLet's have a quick review of Head Instructor Florinia, Leader of the Onyx Trainers' School in the Onyx Ward."Take notes!"TLike any good principal, Florinia takes education and knowledge very seriously."�Her fighting style makes use of both weather and terrain to overwhelm her opponents in stall-tactics with residual damage effects."ONot only that, but her signature move, Nature Power, takes a brain to use."~Most Trainers know that the attack changes based on the environment, but can you match your moves to the field you're on?"VYou'll certainly need a tactical advantage to take on her star Pokémon, Cradily!"�Taking center stage in her 'desert rose' fighting style, a Mono-Grass Sandstorm hybrid, Cradily requires either pure strength or pure cunning to take out."bToday, we're going to be taking a break from our usual programming to dive into some history!"gSpecifically, we'll be looking at the now-retired Poison Gym Leader of an era past, Corey Molinar!"{An older man with more derision than a grandma at a metal show, this former star pours it on thick with the pessimism."�Not a whole lot is known about the man except that he appears to have some training as a pharmacist, and works in cooperation with Reborn City police supplying valuable forensic chemicals and advice."�Here's a scoop though-- some residents of the Beryl Ward, where he's known to live, report him frequently visiting and spending hours at the nearby cemetary!"But who could that before?"Even I'm not sure."=If you ask me, someone oughta go smack a smile into him.">Life's too short to be moping around all the time, yanno?"^Trainers, should you find yourself in a chance battle against the old Leader, be careful!"IHis Crobat is a speed demon, and its attacks are no laughing matter."eTake special care not to let it set up by keeping pressure on it with status moves or hard-hits."CPerseverance will always win the day in the face of pessimism!"7Let's talk about Shelly, Leader of the Lapis Ward!"AShe's a timid soul with a passion for reading and knowledge."`In fact, it's rare to see the girl without her nose in a book, but it's paid off in spades."lAll that studying means that she knows just what kind of tune to have her Bug-types play in any battle!"jShelly herself prefers Double Battles, using rain to cover her weaknesses and overwhelm the opponent."nHer signature Pokémon, Illumise and Volbeat, are the prelude and finale each to her tactical advantages,"USo if you find yourself facing the bookworm, focus down her supports right away!";We've got some sort of mystery for you today, viewers."2Let's talk about Shade, the Ghost Gym Leader."kMost people aren't all that sure if Shade is human, a ghost himself, or maybe something else entirely!"�Given that he rarely speaks, and that when he does, he seldom makes common sense, there's not a whole lot we can tell you about this entity."7In battle, look out for his ace Pokémon, Mimikyu!"�That Pokémon hides nearly as much as the Leader himself does, but rather than a sinister smile to top it all off, Mimikyu's Disguise makes it hard to hit."?Do your best not to let it get the jump on you... or else!"�Today, we're taking a hiatus from your regularly scheduled roster to visit another relic of Reborn's League History, Kiki Argall!"cNow the modest Sensei of Apophyll Academy, Kiki was once a Fighting Gym Leader of some renown!"yA devout teacher of zen philosophy, Kiki sings the melody that eases the mind and plays the beat to soothe the body."{Her special technique, honed even after her retirement, revolves around honing her Pokémons' power with mental focus,"oAnd believe me, a Pokémon's power-packed pure Focus Punch isn't something any brawler can just shrug off.")Take special care with her Medicham!"vIts Meditate attack will skyrocket its offensive capabilities, so make sure to take it down before it can set up!"LToday, we're looking at Reborn's newest Leader, the poison-packing Aya!"|A new star on the scene, Aya has recently replaced her own brother, Cain LaRue, who himself was a relatively recent arrival!"dIt seems between the two of them, they decided she's the better fit for the role of Gym Leader!"^My sources tell me that Aya, who lives in the Byxbysion Wasteland, favors Double Battles,"bAnd uses her signature move to throw all the putrid power of poison across the field at once."-Take care, or you really will be wasted!"DOf course, none carries this task out better than her Dragalge."FIts Adaptability skill makes any hit sting, so KO that 'Mon ASAP."6Today we're looking at the Ice Gym Leader, Serra!"iA former model, Miss Serra Voclain has made a career change and is now breaking up the battle scene."wFor Trainers daring to bear Serra's feral onslaught, beware and take care to prepare for this icy hell of a fight!"[Always one for keeping appearances, Serra's arena is covered top to bottom in mirrors."�Her stealthy Pokémon, notably Froslass, enjoy dancing in and out of the frames, both silver and glass, with a tinge of aurora for shine!"�Defensive and sneaky plays are the name of her Pokémons' game, so reliable attacks or those that can shatter her screens can be your go-to!"`Before going in, reflect on how you can see past her tactics and pin the pin-up model down!"Let's talk about Noel!"sOne of Reborn's youngest Leaders, this prodigy boy has an arena set up right below the Lapis Ward's Orphanage."HNoel's got a penchant for frustrating his unsuspecting challengers,"ZWho suppose either his youth or his Normal-type Pokémon will make for an easy match."\Not to be outdone so easily, Noel packs a medley of Pokémon that cover his weaknesses."6Including, to the surprise of many, his Clefable!"zThough Clefable is no longer a Normal-type Pokémon, Noel is one of the few Leaders to use a wildcard in his battles."�Don't let yourself get stuck on this brick wall of a Pokémon, and do whatever it takes to take it out before it gets cozy in its defensive capability!"�By the way, a few of our listeners have asked in the past about just how someone of Noel's age earned a position in the Reborn League."tLike any Leader, he was referred to the position and passed his qualifying tests-- with flying colors, no less!"5But just who would refer him to such a position?"AWe'll give you just a small hint! All right, listen closely:"HWe've got a report on Grandmaster Radomus, Reborn's Psychic Leader!"BRadomus is a cheery man with a fascination for assorted hats!"Ranging from fashionable to outright bizarre, his wardrobe and mannerisms toe the line between defying and defining logic!"COf course, as a Grandmaster of chess, his logic must be solid."{Having amassed a fortune from tournaments, he lives in his very own personal Castle, complete with a Chessboard Arena!"rIn battle, his Psychic abilities can shift the pieces around, including making them attack your own Pokémon."/Fight back by beating him at his own game!"His ace Pokémon is already well known herself, the one and only Gossip Gardevoir, who runs other segments on the network."�Her strength is matched only by her pep, so make sure you're ready when going into battle, otherwise you'll find yourself right in check by the two of them!"+Let's talk about the Gym Leader, Luna!"GLuna's a lovely lady with more than one way to make a man tremble."}If her beauty wasn't spell-binding alone, her Dark-type attacks will lock down and take out any opposition if unchecked."�And from being the Champion of Wonderland, to a regal lord's maid, Luna enjoys bringing infinity to reality by living out storybook tales."GEven her Pokémon are all named after characters from old fantasy!"AAs for what they are, we'll let you figure out the hard way."=After all, the Cheshire Cat himself was never too clear."$One-and-two, that's a knockout!"KYou'll hear this often when facing the Agate Circus Strongman, Samson!"qReborn's current Fighting Gym Leader, compared to the long past previous one, is all about matter over mind!"�His Pokémons' power is augmented by the Big Top's High Striker effect, an infamously rigged carnival game that triggers based on certain attacks!"]Here's a hook: It turns out, Samson may not have joined the League of his own according.";It seems he was strong-armed into it by another party."And who's that?"<None other than the Agate Circus' Ground Leader, Terra!"What could have gone down?"The world may never know."<But in order to take him out, beat him at his own game!"�Cripple his Pokémon to reduce their power-- even that from the High Striker-- or use the Big Top's Flying-type advantages for the super-effective kill!"�Either way, Pokémon like his ace, Conkeldurr, are sure not to go down easy as they tank hits and strike back double every time!"MToday, we're going over Charlotte, a young beauty as cool as she is hot!"�Taking over her mother's Gym after years of absence, Charlotte's Super-heated Field offers little advantage itself to her Fire-types."~However, when ignited by her wide-ranged Fire attacks, the inferno takes a new life, and often a few other lives with it!"nTrainers will need to keep the flames under wraps one way or another, or pack a team that can stand them!"HThe situation gets no more mild when her Ninetales enters the fray!"pIts Drought Ability amplifies her strength even further, but keep in mind, every strategy has its exploits!"HShe's hearty, she's hyper, and she's abso-freaking- lutely insane--"1Terra, the Ground Gym Leader, is up to play!"oWith a personality like an earthquake and a type to match, anyone who's met her-- is probably traumatized."rHowever, I wanted to find out what's really behind that energetic persona, so I did some digging to find out."{From the records I found, it looks like Terra was a fairly average girl at one point, having been raised in the Beryl Ward."qSchool reports say she was very shy, and seldom socialized, and took a natural interest in computer science."TOne day, however, she ran away from home for a reason perhaps she only knows..."b...and was next known applying for a job at the Agate Circus with her zany energetic persona!"aJust what happened to her between the time she left home and the time she joined the Circus?".Call me crazy-- Actually, call her crazy,")But I'm not sure I want to find out."1Let's talk about the aerial Agate Ace, Ciel!":If you haven't seen her in action, then imagine this:"'Two ribbons hang from the ceiling."�A dancer on the floor twirls herself betwixt them, over, under, and back again, spinning this way and that, pulling the ribbons ever tighter to her."Then--"She jumps."KThe ribbons unfurl around her body, lifting her up with their tension."eShe grabs onto them, subtly climbing higher as she flips over, her legs dancing towards the sky."pShe can walk, swing, float in mid air, all between these ribbons, moving like water through the atmosphere."TThe crowd gazes in silent awe as she moves against gravity and with the melody,"ZGracefully rolling herself into an angel's sleeve, and descending to the Earth again."AIt's undeniable-- nothing can match Ciel's grace and beauty!"@In fact, some day, I'd like to get her in for an interview."(Ciel, tell us-- What's your number?"LSorry, listeners, but I'm not broadcasting the answer to that question."QToday I'd like to talk about Reborn's Fairy-type Gym Leader, Adrienn Flores."IPersonally speaking, I've only gotten to know Adrienn very recently,"rBut I'd like to think that in our time working together around Reborn City, we've become pretty good friends."rAdrienn's that sort of person who knows how to sing xyr spirit into every syllable, and believe me, it shows."�In just the small amount of time xe's been around, xe's been able to attract more people to xyr life and xyr cause than anyone else I've ever met."$Hold up, that gives me an idea."UI've got a feeling that Adrienn would give some out-of-this-world dating advice."�Listeners, if you'd be interested in having Adrienn on the show for a segment, why don't you hit us up on Chatter and let us know what questions you'd have."~But back to the silver-haired silvertongue's day-to- day dealings, don't mistake xyr softness of heart for softness in battle."�Adrienn's battle style numbers in Doubles, and a Fairy pairing makes a very scary and fairly harrying team tearing into challengers left and right!"jIn particular, watch out for xyr Florges, Rhyannon-- a Pokémon that might as well run in xyr family."�With mixed moves to pack a pixie punch and more bulk than a beefed-up Blissey, it's gonna take a team effort to uproot this flower power."NBut I gotta be honest with you guys-- I haven't had the best time lately."Had a little accident--"EAnd let's just say it's a miracle I'm fit to go on TV right now."$Eye patches are stylish, right?"LI'll spare you all the details-- some of them are unclear to me anyway."4But for those who might be concerned-- no need."fWhat doesn't kill us makes us stronger, but probably needs to be pummeled into the ground anyway."HEnough about me-- we've got a Gym Leader profile to steal the show."PAnd who better to steal it than the Steel Leader herself, Titania Andersen."]Now Tania, as her friends call her, ain' the most friendly Leader on the chopping block."VShe's got a personality harder than her element and a temper on the cutting edge."UBut this smoldering beauty is forged of more than just a metal mettle and flare."cYou'd never know from looking, but this lass has a literary lineage and the interest to match."�I'm told that above all other subjects in her education at the Onyx Trainers' School-- even battling-- Miss Titania chose to prioritize classic literature."�Who knows what about turning pages turns her head, but maybe it's this archaic aesthetic that draws her to older arts like drawing blades."VFor a girl known to swing around her Aegislash as easily as if it were an épée,"VIt should be no surprise that the blade and buckle Pokémon also acts as her ace!"hThose who intend to take arms against her should take care not to lose their own during the battle!"rToday we'll be talking about an admirable allure in the astounding alacrity of the aqua artist, Amaria Fiore!"�Amaria is Reborn's most senior Leader-- not in age, mind you, as this maritime maiden is as fair on the eyes as she is on the heart--"�But despite her youth, she was the first Leader chosen by former Champion and Reborn League Manager Ame to take up a Gym Leader title."{Apparently, the two of them were somehow close friends and inspired each other to take steps to reopen the old League!"{So for all those Trainers out there enjoying Reborn and its challenges, remember-- you've got Amaria Fiore to thank for it!"iThe lass has also made quite a splash in Reborn City's development in the past even aside from that,"~Having been responsible for tracking down and shutting up some of Reborn City's most environmentally-damaging facilities."[Those who've seen her in action know that her star player, a Lapras named Deliverance,"TShould only be underestimated by those who want to themselves be dragged under."BAnd how does a Pokémon get a name like that, you may wonder."\From what Miss Amaria has said in the past, it seems like it earned its name firsthand."}She tells a story about a time when she was swimming far out from the coast, only to be caught in the middle of a storm!"eMake no mistake-- Amy is a stunning swimmer, but stormy seas can sink even the most stout ships."�So it was when Amaria thought she'd drawn her last breath that she found herself pulled first to the surface and second to safety by a Pokémon!"oThat Pokémon would be her lifelong companion, who she named Deliverance in thanks for it saving her life."�Turns out, Deliverance saves more than just lives though, with many of Amaria's past challengers having been staring it down as the face of defeat,"8In what otherwise seemed like a won match for them."DAs Amaria announces-- Deliverance always pulls through for her!"xWe've got a special program rolling out for you today on the Rock-type and rockin' roller renegade, Hardy Andersen!"wIf that last name sounds familiar to you, it should-- He's the younger brother of Steel Leader Titania Andersen..."FAnd in a sense, he's got her to thank for his stairway to heaven!"pYou see, nowadays there isn't a whole lotta love between them, but they weren't always in such bad company."tBack in the glory days, the two of them were thick as thieves, united in their interest for Rock-type Pokémon!"�But when Steel-types were discovered and were all the latest pride and joy of the Pokémon world, Titania jumped ship and went her own way!"WShe never looked back, but Hardy was determined to dream on with his classic type!"`And thus started an enduring rivalry between the siblings-- one that don't stop even today!"�Hardy's held that determination fast to take care of business and rise up in the ranks, raring to prove once and for all just which is the better type!"kAnd indeed, Hardy isn't just another brick in the cabal of Rock Leaders at the bottom of their totems."sAs the second highest-ranked Leader in Reborn, that boy promises to rock all his challengers like a hurricane!"^Challengers looking to face down Hardy should take extra care for his Dusk Form Lycanroc!"vThis beast of burden promises to send any challenger free-fallin' unless they escape just by the hair of the dog!")And that's more than just a feeling."lOn the chopping block today is the top-brass battler, gold medalist among the masters, Saphira Belrose!"�This Dragon Type dame is a destructive force not to be fought lightly, as she vouchsafes her type's reputation as the kings of old!"HAnd speaking of reputations, it'd seem that one runs in the family."}Saphira inherits her gym and power in two-step from her father, Montague Belrose, of the previous generation of Leaders."�Those who've remained in or returned to the region since old days might remember the fiery competition between he and Caroline Flambairn.">For those a little fresher to scene, so the story goes..."[The two Leaders met after being stationed adjacent to each other between their cities."�True to her type, little Caroline was as hot-headed as they come, and from the outset she resented any competition from her neighbor!"yAfter a spell of trying to outdo Monty in performance alone, she tried to prove herself by challenging him directly!"UBut chalk it up to a difference in rank, the type chart, or whatever you like..."No dice!".In a total sweep, Caroline hit the floor.".But the blazing broad up and tried again,"And again,"And again..."rMonths went by, and the sight of little Caroline fuming away from Monty's Gym was practically a daily ritual."�As all good stories must, though, this came to an end when she finally scored a win, proving her hard- earned strength once and for all!"�The victory was a blessing to the regulars, tired of hearing howls of anger and annoyance each day when the Fire Type femme flew off the scene."�...So, you can imagine their shock and disappointment when, the next day after winning, Caroline once again showed up on Monty's doorstep anyway!"�No one is quite sure what happened in the gym that day in particular, but rumor has it the two were quite inseparable after that!"hAnd that blustering legacy lives on even now with their children having taken over their positions!"TAs for Saphira, the modern challenger may want to take one note of this legacy."vHer arena was rebuilt in the recent reconstruction of Labradorra City, but one hold-over from her father remains:"DA certain game old Montague is said to have been quite fond of,"EThat he would make all his challengers play before fighting him."dChallengers, come stocked on potions and ready to fight to claim the title of king of the hill!"&The unprepared may yet regret it."GWhen fighting Saphira herself, watch out for her famous Dragonite!"�This multiscaled menace has hampered more than a few matches in its primetime, using its diamond defense out the door to set up a sweep!"$I'll give you a hint, Trainers!">In her arena, there's only one type it's truly weak to..."2Get in there and get ready to rock its world!"0That's all for now, but remember, Trainers,".Keep fighting with everything you've got!"GHold your spirits high, and even you can defeat the Reborn League!",And now, a public service announcement:"@Crime and pollution are at an all-time high in Reborn City."(But it doesn't have to be that way.";Do your part! Pick up where you can, and never litter!"<Together we can keep Reborn's streets and waters clean."For a better Reborn."Need Potions?"Poké Balls?"!Vitamins, Repels, Antidotes?"RBerries, TMs, Awakenings, Battle Items, Freeze Heals, Burn Heals, Full Heals,"3Every kind of heal you could possibly imagine!"oEvolution stones, evolution items, items for luck, items for unluck, items for having too many damn items!"You need it?"We got it."You don't need it?"We got that too.""The Obsidia Department Store,"LLocated in Central Obsidia at 11th and Saffron, sponsored by Silph Co.!"NGoing out soon? Or do you need to drop off your friend for some playtime?"LCome to the Obsidia Day Care on Goldenrod Street, now back in business!":We'll take care of your Pokémon just like you would."&The Obsidia Day Care is now open!"Give us your Pokémon!"<We will make them stronger than you could ever imagine!"CWe have no cap on the number of Pokémon we can raise for you!"ESo be sure and turn them all in to raise yourself a proper army!"<You can be the strongest Trainer if you just come here!"KThe Obsidia Day Care, located in Central Obsidia at Goldenrod and 9th."6How are you doing today? And how's your Pokémon?"RIf your day is anything less than perfect, come by the Central Obsidia Salon!"dOur first class services are provided by the top Pokémon breeders and caretakers in the world!"nA quick stay here is guaranteed to make you smile, and never fails to bring you and your Pokémon closer!"UCheck us out! Central Obsidia Salon, located on Main Street in the Obsidia Ward."'Trainers! Looking for a challenge?"6Think you have what it takes to rise to the top?!"4The Reborn League is now accepting challengers!"]Pit your Pokémon against our legion of 18 typed Gym Leaders-- the best in the business."}For the best of the best, 18 Badges earns you the right to challenge the famous Elite Four, and then the mysterious Champion!"Don't be shy!"3Stop by the Grand Hall in the Opal Ward today!"$Check out the Reborn Nightclub~"'Want some wild nights? Hot action?"JWe're talking raves! Dancing, battles, music, this is the night life!"XCheck us out in the North Obsidia Ward, on Castelia Street near the Grand Stairway!"Ride in style!"+Check out the Lapis Luxury Cycle Shop!"8We have better bikes than anyone else in the world!"/For the top, perfection knows no pricetag!"5Check us out in the Lapis Ward at Peony and 4th!"/Looking to become a top Trainer in Reborn?"1The Onyx Trainers' School has what YOU need.".We cater to students of all skill levels."}Headed by one of Reborn's own Gym Leaders, the Onyx Trainers' School promises a learning experience you'll never forget!"RThe Onyx Trainers' School is a franchise of the Pokémon Technical Institute."QThe Pokémon Technical Institute is pleased to offer its services to Reborn."<Enroll today in the Onyx Ward at 11th and Ivyline Road."-The Reborn Silph Co. Branch is now open."ASilph Co. is one of the oldest corporate names in the world."5Now we're here to offer you our finest services."&Silph Co.-- A name you can trust."Need a treat?"Aching for sweets?"0We've got the thing to beat the other eats!"+The Sweet Kiss Candy Shop is now open!"�We've got everything from Common Candy to Rare Candy-- and a whole host of delicious non-black licorice candy for both you AND your Pokémon!"qWe know you have a sweet tooth, and you should, as our products rival even major medicines in their effects!"RCheck out our upcoming competitions too, for a chance to win a rare Pokémon!"WRemember, there's no need to be confused-- Sweet Kiss is your one-stop candy shop.",Come in today, to 10th and Main Street!" Need a break from studying?"From work?"?Want the coolest place to hang out with the hottest games?"6Check out the Onyx Arcade on 11th and Easterling!"TWe've got great games and fabulous prizes for both the hardcore and the casual!"Ready, set... Game on!"SAre you tired of the bleak grey and black grimy get- up of the city spectacle?"Come visit Sweet Scent!"ZReborn's very own flower shop, located in the Lapis Ward at 3rd and Hydrangea Street!"HWe guarantee the perfect floral flourish for any apartment or home."1Check us out, and you won't be disappointed!"YRINGMASTER: Hello, hello, boys, girls, ladies, gentlemen, and everything in between!"]Agate Circus is open for business under a new owner, and boy, do we have a show for you!"�We have the greatest show in all of Reborn featuring a host of zany clowns, the strongest man you'll ever meet, and the alluring charm of an aerial ballet!"We have games!"Candy!"Pokémon!"2Our main show now includes 500% more Donphan!"BNo, seriously, we have so many Donphan here that it's stupid!"@So come on and do something! Anything! At the Agate Circus!"CRITICAL CAPTURE!"�Located on 9th and Main Street in the Central Obsidia Ward, Critical Capture has a unique variety of Poké Balls to suit any Trainer's needs."'Come on by and catch a great deal!"!Helllllo there, Reborn City."(We know that times have been tough."}And in these tough times, sometimes it's hard to find a minute-- or a place-- to sit down, relax, and have a cold drink."-Why don't you come on down to the Spyce?"BFeaturing good eats, smooth music, and the best beer in town,"The Spyce has it all."KFind us on 9th Street by Castelia. Come on in, and Spyce up your life.""Need to spice up your roster?"Looking for new Pokémon?"(Welcome to Reborn's Pokémon Watch!"\Today, we're looking for Pokémon in the Peridot and Opal Wards! What is there to find?"�Well, rumour has it that sometimes a cheery blue Pokémon can be seen dancing around the fountain in North Peridot when it rains."QToday, we're looking at the small reserve of wildlife around the Grand Hall."3Only a few species can be found here, however."Oh, my, is that a Combee?"#Where could it have come from?"9There certainly aren't any in the grass around here."How curious!".This morning, we visited a secret garden."rThe owner of the garden wishes to keep himself and its location anonymous, but there were some neat Pokémon!"fIn fact, we even saw a group of Cherubi! Fascinating how such things live right under our noses.."HUnfortunately, the Cherubi had made themselves scarce by afternoon."(Perhaps they like the morning cool?"RToday, we're looking for Pokémon in the South Obsidia, Coral and Onyx Wards!"|Rumour has it that deep in the Obsidia Slums, there's a secret room where a certain species of beefy Pokémon hang out!"�Normally on this show, we only talk about wild Pokémon, but I just saw this energetic Lillipup, and can't help but talk about it!"FThe feisty thing was dragging its poor Trainer all over the city!"#By the West Peridot Factory..."...to under Opal Bridge..."#...back up to North Peridot..."-...or in the back of the Obsidia Ward..."$...even down to the Coral Ward!"-Finally, they ended up in the Onyx Ward!"/There's no telling where that pup will go!"qToday, we were passing through the Coral Ward, down around the warehouses, and there was this awful banging.":It almost sounded like a Pokémon was trapped inside."#But I wonder what it could be?"EToday, we're looking for Pokémon in the Jasper and Beryl Wards!"�Actually, earlier today we came across a police officer who was looking for a certain Pokémon and had a rare Egg to offer in return!"?I smell an opportunity for one generous and lucky Trainer!"CIn fact, just last night we passed through the Beryl Cemetery."$It was a terrifying experience!"<I was afraid that a zombie would rise up and attack me!"%And to my fright, something did!"zWell, our cameraman turned tail and fled before we could catch the culprit on film, so as of yet, it is unidentified."aBut for all you brave Trainers out there, be warned that there could be something lurking..."&Ah, wait, what's this over here?!"!It's an Aipom! What a cutie!",Oh, hey, no, don't run away! Come back!"-Ah, it scampered back up into that tree."VNo matter, we still know that there are Aipom in this area now! What a rare find!"LToday, we're looking for Pokémon in the North Obsidia and Lapis Wards!"ZWe're chasing rumors of a rare Pokémon digging around behind the streets of Obsidia!"CThis howling black beast is said to be extremely elusive, but!"7We've been tracking it, and we think we've found--"0???: 'Ey, you trespassin' on our territory?"@HOST: Oh, um, hi, what? No, sir! We're just innocent news--"3???: Get outta here! Or I'll make you get out!"HOST: Okay!"�Following rumors of a rare Pokémon having been seen in the area, we've tracked it down to this location: A lavish house in the Lapis Ward.">Let's find out if we can meet the owner of this rare Po--"3CRAUDBURRY: What's all that racket out there?!",HOST: Ah, hello! Are you the owner of--"NCRAUDBURRY: I don't need your scandalous press loitering around my house!"RThis is MY property, and I can have you arrested for filming without consent!"#HOST: Miss, please calm down--"/CRAUDBURRY: What's your network? I'll sue!".Stand right there, I'm getting my lawyer!"JHOST: Yikes, and after everything we couldn't find any Pokémon. Bye!"/You will not BELIEVE what we've just seen!"0A legendary Pokémon, right here in Reborn!"CBefore our eyes, a beautiful Mew jumped right by and vanished!"FWe're on the hunt now! We know it ran this way, and-- Oh my word!"/That's a Victini! Two legends in one day?!"What is this?!"Quick, follow it!"Aw, where did it go?"Wait, back there! It's a--"Darkrai?!"*Wait, it just transformed into... Oh!"It's a Zorua!"But it ran off..."7Trainers, keep an eye out for this illusive catch!")It could take the shape of anything!"<Today, we're looking for Pokémon all over Reborn City!"�Following a beaten path off from the Beryl Cemetery, we come through a dark cave to a place somewhere deep in the Rhodochrine Jungle..."6What kind of mysterious Pokémon will we-- Aah!!!"=What? We seem to have been trapped in some sort of cage!")What Pokémon could have done this?!"*We've got a special report coming in!"mSean Slagle from the Peridot Ward writes to us about a strange Pokémon that appears only when it rains!"6You might expect that this would be a Water-type!"3But no! It's actually, of all things, a Numel!"_Sean tells us that the poor Pokémon wanders out in every storm looking lost and confused."mIt’s obviously suffering from the rain, but the strange thing can't figure out what to do with itself!"TToday we were checking out the alleys of the city when we found a certain pool."oTwo surprises awaited us-- the first being that the water in this place was miraculously not contaminated."BThe second being that it was teeming with dangerous Pokémon?"Which?"/We'll let our viewers find out themselves!"QToday, we're looking for Pokémon around Apophyll Beach and Pyrous Mountain!"5We're exploring a cave far out across the beach."-There's no telling what could be inside!"Hey, what's that!"!Moving there in the shadows!"(What kind of Pokémon could it be!?"It's a--"Oh, it's just a Stunfisk."That's not exciting."3Cut, cut. We'll have to look somewhere else..."iJust today we were walking down the beach, when suddenly one of the volcanic stones started shaking!"WAnxious to uncover the source of this tremor, we smashed open the rock in a hurry.""Inside was a unique Pokémon!"It's Shuckle!"How strange!"RBut it didn't seem like there would be very many. Could this be a rare find?!"PWe've been tracking a mysterious Pokémon in the depths of Pyrous Mountain!"}This lava-loving creature is elusive and lonesome, but after dedicated research, I think we've finally found its habits."And they're quite silly!"�It seems this Pokémon loves to eat molten stone and other minerals... but with the volatile lava flow in Pyrous Mountain, sometimes falls right into it!"OThus, we wound up finding this Pokémon stuck in some other cooling magma!"_It seems this Pokémon crawls off to brood on its own in a far off, but very heated place!"6We weren't able to get our attention ourselves...";But a clever Trainer could perhaps lure it to a catch!"YToday, we're looking for Pokémon around Azurine Island and the Byxbysion Wasteland!"4However, horror has struck us in the Wasteland!"aAfter being bafflingly lost inside the hallowed halls and walls of the mountainous tundra..."-An apparition has revealed itself to us!"{Needless to say, we high-tailed it out of there, but a braver Trainer may find a prize for themselves if they dare face it!"nThis morning, we were traveling through Azurine Island, and one of our cameramen leaned on a nearby tree."`Imagine his surprise when a spirited Psychic-type fell out of it, right on top of his head!"They were NOT happy!"}Today, we were relaxing in the Wasteland-- if one can 'relax' in such a chaotic place-- when we chanced upon an adorable duo."?Two young Nidoran were playing in the Wasteland's tunnels!"KNot ideal scenery, but the young Pokémon were a picture-perfect pair."fToo bad they scampered off, but there seem to be Nidoran out there waiting for a Trainer to find!"BToday, we're searching the Chrysolia Region for new Pokémon!"TThis morning, we found a hidden clearing in the middle of the Chrysolia Forest!"�Although we didn't find any Pokémon, we did find another little gem that could be useful to Trainers: A rock positively glowing with moss!"$Who might find this useful, hm?"%Could such a Pokémon be nearby?"&We've unveiled quite the mystery!"5Late last night, our group stumbled upon a cave."oThe inside of the cave was very confusing, winding in circles, almost like a riddle-- but never mind that!"/Let's talk about the rare Pokémon inside!"-By some luck, we encountered a Smeargle!"kWith its Sketch attack, it could be an invaluable tool for any breeder that can get their hands on it."aThis evening, we're searching the shore of a surprisingly pure lake in the Chrysolia Region!"^With all the pollution around the city, it's a marvel that a place like this could exist!"REven more marvelous, tons of Pokémon flock to its shore, and many cute ones!"^But one cutie especially caught our eye: A little Poliwag wagging its way along the lake!"HMaybe some Trainer might like to add this doll to their collection!"BToday, we're looking in the vast Aventurine Region of Reborn!"(Oh! Look at that! It's a Heracross!"%And not only that, but a Pinsir!"%The two are fighting each other!"2Perhaps they're after the honey on that tree!"[Yet, they're locked in a fierce combat. These two Pokémon are ignoring us completely!"�I would be surprised if there were any way a Trainer could get their attention long enough to even smack them with a Poké Ball!"BBut maybe there's some way to get them alone to capture them?"FWe've traveled deep into the woods and we've found a hidden cave."/What wonders might this cave hold for us!?"UOh, my! Ice crystals jet up from the floor to-and-fro, and in the middle-- look!"#Icy mist rolls off that stone!"-Could it be emitting some special power?">I can think of at least one species who would enjoy that!"rWe've been taking a peaceful stroll through the woods, following a lovely tune performed for us this evening."[What sort of Pokémon could be such a divine singer? It must be so cute, and innocent!"�We'll leave that question for you to answer, Trainers, because this is a Pokémon that doesn't appear to us walking around on the ground!"4Perhaps the answer is in the trees, or the sky!"MToday, we're searching for Pokémon around the Agate Circus and Route 2!"bWe're out on an early morning adventure to see what we can see on the peaks outside of Agate."6Oh! Look at that! It's a whole flock of Hawlucha!"qThese bizarre Pokémon seem to gravitate to this area in the mornings for their workout habits. Now we know!"?We're here at the Agate Circus and we were VERY surprised."VWe weren't promised a Pokémon as a prize, but it seems one snuck into the booth!"*Much to the game operator's surprise!"IWell, he wanted to get rid of it, so we're now the proud new owners." Maybe you can luck out too!"\So, here's a shout-out to and signal boost for a rather enigmatic man whom we just met."Somewhere near the Circus, this man offers a deal-- find which Pokémon to trade him in return for his rather rare Vulpix!"9Any interested Trainers should seek him out at once!"MToday, we're looking for Pokémon in the greater Ametrine Mountain area!"iWe're traveling through Celestinine Mountain right now, and we've got a rare Pokémon in our sights!"dIt appears to be training its strength using some of the boulders as punching bags! Impressive!"CPerhaps it might come to respect one who can prove its better?"tWe've been diving deep beneath Ametrine Mountain in search of rare Water Pokémon, and boy have we found one..."ZSplashing about in crested pools deep below Ametrine Mountain-- would you believe it?"It's a Totodile!"�Good luck catching the spirited little thing though, it weaves in and out of the water as easily as Ciel Featherstone swings in the skies!"�Today we're taking an underwater exploration, where we received an anonymous tip that a certain Pokémon appears only on a certain day of the week!"G...Unfortunately, we've had no luck finding the rare Lapras yet..."CIs it because this hollow underground area is so big and vast?")Or did we just get the day wrong...?"CI could've sworn there was some historical precedent for it..."qWell, we can't keep the equipment submerged for too long, so it looks like we'll be signing out of this one!"NToday, we're looking for Pokémon around the Ametrine Mountain peak area!"2Instead, we've heard a very concerning story!"wAmetrine is famous for its snow-capped peaks and frigid temperatures, and few Pokémon are able to withstand it..."\But according to one report, a foreign Pokémon has been abandoned among the icy peaks!" Will this Pokémon be okay?"�Trainers in the area, keep a lookout for any defenseless Pokémon that may have been abandoned, and make sure to keep them safe!"uWe were passing by a large building in Ametrine City this evening and were surprised to discover something rare!"IAn Old Amber was just laying half-buried in the snow in front of us!"\Unfortunately, a child came and claimed the item as 'his treasure' that he had dropped."6But could there be more Old Amber somewhere here?"YAs you might know, Ametrine City is somewhat renowned for its technological prowess."FOne of the few industries that can be maintained in such climate."ROccasionally, in sorting through the computers, you find some strange things!"YToday we've found a machine that can actually alter the form of a specific Pokémon!"]It requires a Data Chip to work, but if you have one, you can freely use it at any time!"qToday, we're back in Reborn City, peeping the Pokémon that are once again popping up all around the region!"�And let me tell you, Trainers, I've already had my Sawks Knocked Off by the sheer volume and strength that resurfacing wildlife has been showing."kJust the other night, we were traveling in the Jasper Ward and we came across-- you won't believe it--"zA huge, fully evolved Ampharos, nightlight tail-wagging like a pendulum as it lumbered around the quiet city streets."cSeeing something so peaceful return to this city after so long was a truly sublime experience."yNot only that, but reports of such powerful Pokémon peacefully returning to the area have been pouring in recently."YOnce upon a time, it was thought that the wildlife had fled the tainted Reborn City."EIt turns out, it was just waiting until the day it could return."sHere on Reborn's Pokémon Watch, we've been dipping our toes and our lures into a newly purified Azurine Lake."YReborn's Water Treatment Center seems to have bounced back with an unexpected vigor,"UWorking overtime to clear out every bit of muck from the once-sullied waterland."4Meanwhile, the Pokémon have responded in kind."lHow they survived the toxic onslaught of pollution past may remain a mystery to us humans for all time,"gBut there's no denying the numerous species fishers are rejoicing to see in their lake once again."GJust this morning, one of our crewmen fished up a whole Eelektrik!"vWe would've loved to show you the footage, but unfortunately the Pokémon's Electric attack fried our video feed."aStill, there's definitely more out there in the depths than we could have possibly expected."JWe've been chasing a rare specimen through the sewers under the city!"�When exploring the recently reactivated Water Treatment Center for any signs of life, we came across none other than the ultra-rare Goomy!"{Of course, when pursuing it, the Pokémon hopped into one of the pipes and slid its way out of grasp into a back room."^Perhaps some other Trainer will be able to plunge this purple Pokémon from the pipeline,"+But we here are hunters, not plumbers."$And it still smells down there."	Bad."VWe're out in full force in the Tourmaline Desert and its surrounding areas today!"EThe desert itself is, as many would expect, considerably empty--"fBut for Trainers willing to venture off the beaten path, who knows what may be in store for them?"iWe've been searching for a while now and have come to a very strange place indeed where the sky is--"What?!"Are you okay!?"Hey! Hey, answer me!"One second--"/Sorry, viewers, for the distorted footage!"kAs our cameraman was filming, something just fell out of the tree above him and knocked him clean out!"Hold on, let me--"4Gosh, how does he carry this thing everywhere--"There! You can see it!"It's a Ferroseed!"UWho knew that a Pokémon like that would be hiding in a tree here of all places!"NOkay, anyway, our crewman needs medical attention, so we'll be going now!"FFor instance, we may have just made the discovery of our careers!"`We're here among the sands right now, and we've discovered, in our very own Reborn Region--"Real--"
Live!"Legendary Pokémon!".In fact, this place is teeming with them!",Yet, say, how did we get here anyway..."VWe passed this very spot several times before and there was nothing here before--"HBut now the water is clear and this little thing is just adorable--":Say, if we couldn't see it before, maybe it chose us?"@In that case, perhaps it's disrespectful to broadcast it..."[Mmm... Sorry, Trainers, it seems this isn't a place you'll be able to get to normally!"Even so--"sIn fact, just last night we were camping up on Teknite Ridge, a span of mountains that towers over Tourmaline!"%What we saw was beyond stunning!"cI was woken up by my partner as he was filming the most marvelous meteor shower I'd ever seen!"zWe watched from the safety of a cave as sparkling stars dotting the skies fell and crashed into the peaks around us--"dBut imagine our surprise when we found that those lights weren't meteors at all-- but Pokémon!"HThat's right, it's Minior, come down from the heavens to say hello!"_Judging by the craters all over the ground, this may be a common location for them anyway!"3And yet, by morning they had all gone already."mStill, now you know-- Teknite Ridge is a place worth visiting at night if you want a Pokémon like this!"cToday we're exploring the northeast area of the Carnelia Region around Route 4 and Agate City!"IWhat kind of Pokémon might live up here? Let's see what we can see!"QAnd sure enough, there's certainly something worth seeing up here already..."It's a Scyther!"{This much sought-after Pokémon appears to appear only rarely up here, but rest assured, the beauty is alive and well!"kThat Scyther in particular has flown the coop, but it appears to be taking off for greener pastures..."8Perhaps they prefer a warmer environment after all?"|We were traversing down the route here... And don't you know, all of these cliffs and waterfalls make for a bumpy adventure!"cUnfortunately we had a little accident, and half of our equipment ended up washing downstream!"aBut we are well and safe and the other half has gotten some better work for it-- look there!"MOur little detour has led us straight into the heart of a nest of Snivy!"%Oh, and there's a Serperior too!"8Who knew what going off the beaten path could find!".Sometimes all you need is a little spill!"@I gotta tell you guys, we just had the fright of our lives!"�We came upon an abandoned building out here in the frosted hills, and so we thought we'd have a look inside to see if there were any Pokémon..."�That's not a question we can answer because we ended up turning tail and running for our hides after being accosted by a machine!"�This red-eyed machine seemed determined to put down anyone for just a little provocation, but could there be something behind it?"XWe tripped the power cable and shut it in as we left, so maybe there's no telling--":But for the brave, who knows what might be in store?!"DHappy hunting, Trainers! And may the RNG be ever in your favor!"0And now our local forecast for Reborn City!"|Coming out of the dry spell we've just had, we can expect these high temperatures to finish out in the next day or two."aThe scattered showers we've been seeing recently will be fading out over the next day or so."[The high winds and showers we've had over the last few days will be winding down soon."[Expect this rainstorm to fall off shortly, as easterly winds carry new horizons to us."LWe've finally got some weather coming in for us over the next few days!"DThis blizzard may finally be letting up over the next few days!"mThis sun has provided a respite from the rocky weather lately, but that may not continue to be the case."FHot weather is following, with high winds and temperatures alike."CScattered showers should be rolling in over the next few days."WHowever, count on high winds and mild rain storms filling in in the next few days."aBut, cold weather is rolling in for us, with temperatures staying low for the next few days."cBut, cold weather is rolling in for us, with light snowstorms and rain over the next few days."gNonetheless, clear weather is predicted to follow this bout, so look forward to the next few days!"^Not all will stay well though, as a blizzard seems to be headed straight for Reborn City!"PWe will be seeing some varied weather therefollowing though, so stay tuned!"bWe will be leading in with some light snow and erratic weather therefollowing, so stay tuned!"7We'll have updates for you over the next few days."�We'll be seeing a spike in temperature over the next few days with clear skies, high winds, and more sun than you can shake a Solar Beam at."DWe'll be kicking off with light rainstorms all across the city."^Don't fret though, because those storms will soon give way to clear skies and sunny days!"mTemperatures are dropping over the next few days as we come to the intersection between rainy and gusty."FExpect scattered showers on and off throughout the next few days!"EOver the next few days, we could be seeing an entourage of rain!"cThe incoming storm is expected to last just a few days, so grab those umbrellas and buckle in!"fReborn is seeing some snowfall right now, but this dusting is not going to last through the week."�Temperatures will begin to rise over the next few days, with snow turning into rain. Nonetheless, this downpour shows no signs of stopping!"{Temperatures are at a record low right now, but the skies are clear, so if you plan on heading out, make sure to bundle up!"tThere's no time like snow time in Reborn City! With how much it's coming down, you'd think we were in Ametrine!"tThough accumulation is negligible, this blizzard is expected to last consistently throughout the next few days."VEasterly winds will be coming in over the next few days, bringing rain with them!"gThe storm is not expected to last, however, and we should be back to sunny days in no time at all."gLight snowstorms start us off this week, with high winds coming in, followed by scattered showers."wThere is a silver lining after this tumultuous weather though: expect sunny days coming up just around the corner."(Stay warm and keep on, Reborn City!")Keep cool and carry on, Reborn City!"?The Powder spoiled from being shaken on the unstable rock!"fAYA: I know I'm not good for very much, but I'd appreciate if you didn't use me as a meat-shield.")AYA: The others will be okay, right?"&Uh, don't tell them that I asked.".AYA: It'll be a straight shot, they said."-It's right around the corner, they said."AYA: Hey."'Uh, thanks for putting up with me."HDon't get the wrong idea! I just felt like it was the thing to say."6And now for this week's forecast for Reborn City!"_We've got clear skies over the weekend, but we're looking at high temperatures on Tuesday."�Fortunately, this won't last long as strong winds on Wednesday are going to blow in a storm system which will take hold for a couple days."�We've got a storm system hitting us mid-week. Clearing up a couple days later, we risk intense sun mid-day Saturday, but that'll clear out from Sunday's high winds!"�We're in for a rainy week! Starting Wednesday, we're looking at a huge storm system coming in. Thunderstorms Thursday and lingering showers until strong winds clear it out for us on Saturday."KThis week is gonna be hot, hot, hot! We've got clearskies all week, but that stagnant air in the city is likely to weaken the local atmosphere resulting in spiking temperatures in the city over the weekend! Fortunately we expect some high winds on Sunday to come in and clean out the air, so we should be back to normal afterwards."xScattered showers this week! Look out for slight rainstorms on Monday and Friday, as well as high winds on Tuesday!"�We're looking at a pretty clear week here in Reborn! We've got high winds on Monday and Thursday, but otherwise this is an ideally calm week!"We've got quite the system coming our way! Clear skies Friday and Saturday, but some pretty intense heat coming in Sunday, followed by high winds on Monday and then from there out it is rain, rain, rain! The intense thunderstorm is expected to last two days, tailing off on Thursday."Take care, Reborn City!"Can't use that here."*\PN showed the Application to Mannie."$MANNIE: Whatcha got there, pal?"A construction job?"FIt's just like when we were helping out with the city on our own,"But it pays?!"Man, I can do that!"6That sounds dope! It'll be like that time, right?"+I'll fill this out right away. Thanks!"/This is way too complicated for me, buddy!"/There's no way I could do a job like this."cI always gotta be told what has to be done next, like it was when we were rebuilding the city."$Isn't there anything like that?"(\PN showed the Application to Kriz."KRIZ: Huh? That's..."$An application for The Spyce..."A line cook position?"6That's-- no good. I don't know how to cook lines.":Then again, I can cook other stuff. I cook every day!"XSo maybe, just maybe, there's a chance I can learn to cook up some tasty lines too!"Okay! I'll give it a go!"Don't wait for me!"#Just a job application, right?"FI already told you, I don't have any skills employers would want."CAll I do is make food and sleep. And roll with the Magma Gang."/Don't worry about someone useless like me."+\PN showed the Application to DeFacto."-DEFACTO: And what have you procured now?",An application for the Beryl Library..."*Since when was there a library there?"BI suppose I've already learned one good thing now, haven't I?"4All right, I acquiesce. This sounds intriguing."#I'll pay them a visit. See ya."6Some other kind of meaningless recruitment paper?"How blase."<There's nothing to be learned from something like that."HI'd much rather be somewhere I could engorge myself with knowledge.")\PN showed the Application to Break."BREAK: Oh?".You want me to work at a medicine market?"For a Meganium?"�Dealing substances of questionable validity to perfectly unsuspecting consumers who are more likely to believe in sigils than science?"
Well."1Then you found the right person for the job."#I won't waste a minute. Ta-ta!"How fascinating!"It's scrap paper!"Laced with ink!".I do love the smell of freshly laden ink."bEspecially after you smell too much of it and start getting loopy. It'll knock you right out!"(That's the best! Maybe not healthy!"YIf you want health, try valerian root. Guaranteed to KO-- plus some health benefits!"\Only problem with that one is, it smells like the south end of a north-facing Skuntank!"*\PN showed the Application to Pierce."PIERCE: ..."Apophyll Beach, huh?"Beats the city."I'll go."A library, huh?"$It's quiet, I'll give you that."'But people need help all the time."6Asking where books are, or for recommendations..."$I don't want to deal with that."So forget it."Too loud."Too many people."Forget it."(\PN showed the Application to Darm."DARM: Hmph!"A circus job!?"No way that's for me."MThen again, it could be fun to be show off in front of so many people..."Lemme see that."""Requirements: Arm-wrestle"?!"6You can get a job for arm-wrestling some shmuck?!"<Who cares about the job? This a personal CHALLENGE now!"I'm off!".A job like this is way below my strength!"SI should be dazzling people with muscles, not taking orders or selling things!"$That's what POWER is all about!"(Wonder and excitement! A true show!"4Find something like that, and then we can talk!")\PN showed the Application to Razzy."3RAZZY: What'd you find? Anything interesting?!"2What? A company job? That's totally boring..."-Connected to the Sweet Kiss Candy Shop?!"JYou think they sell rock candy? I haven't had that since I was a kid!"Oh! What about Red-Hots?!"ZMy grandma used to make a killer applesauce that she'd flavor using blended Red-Hots!"&This sounds awesome! Count me in!"Woah, a circus?!"That sounds radical!"#But it's out of Reborn City..."6There's no way I could work at a place like that."Is there anything else?"0Huh? This doesn't sound interesting at all!"?Isn't there something close by that's upbeat and exciting?"#Good food would be a plus too!""Wait, can you eat on the job?")\PN showed the Application to Nihil."NIHIL: Don't bother."The Nightclub's hiring.""All right, fuck you. You win."I'll go and check it out."And uh,"Thanks, I guess."0Weren't you listening? I said don't bother."=There's not a job in this whole city cool enough for me."Isn't that obvious?"TThere's not many places you'd expect to see someone as exclusive as me working."+So just drop it already. You heard it?"*\PN showed the Application to Archer."ARCHER: Hmm..."OSilph Co. requires at least two years of business management experience..."TWell, seems like the Aqua Gang's been quite the profitable business, hasn't it?"bAhh, that title won't do. I'll just quickly rebrand the now-empty group to Aqua Incorporated."bIt should make a fine qualification, and I'm more than capable of brushing aside the details."0This job will suit me perfectly, thank you.")You've been a true friend to us all.".Please take this as a final parting gift."AIt was one of the Pokémon we liberated from the Magma Gang."@The item it's holding is just a personal selection from me."ARCHER: Farewell, \PN."BOh, and don't mind if I list you as a professional reference."'Is this really the best out there?"mCompared to many of the other guys, I would hope I'd be able to get something a little more significant."VI've also managed to keep my record fairly clean, so that shouldn't be a problem."4Was there, by chance, anything more profitable?";ARCHER: Mm? Have you finished with the others already?"/They should be the top priority right now."�While it's true that I will be looking for employment myself shortly, I would rather ensure they all have positions first than risk taking one from them."+\PN showed the Application to Maxwell." MAXWELL: Let's take a look!".SOLICE? Never heard of this place before."PBut the work they do seems to be exactly the sort of thing I'm looking for."Nice catch, \PN!"!I knew I could count on you!"ALet's see... They require 2 years of social work experience?"UI'd say the Magma Gang's work has been pretty social. That should be no problem!"0Anyway, thanks for stickin' it out with us."oWhen you first showed up in our humble ol' alley, I had no idea you'd be the kind of person that you were."2But by now, I've heard the rumours about you."�It took me too long to even connect them to the person I knew, but you're the one who everyone says has been saving Reborn, right?"7And you don't care about the glory at all, do you?"Magnificent bastard."Take this with you."=It's a final "Thank you" gift we got from the Aqua Gang."8Oh, and the item is just a little bonus I threw in."MAXWELL: See you around!"<And don't you dare ever let your glory slip away, baby!"Hmm..."KI don't want to be rude, since you've gone through all this trouble..."#But where's the glory in this?"iIf it's just another normal job, I don't know whose life I can really make a difference in that way."cOf course, I'm willing to wait until a position where I can make a direct difference opens up."(Glory doesn't come overnight, baby."CHeh, though that does sound like a raunchy slogan, doesn't it?"MAXWELL: Woah, hey there."NYou know I was asking you to find applications for the other guys, right?"4Not me-- Well, maybe I'll think about it later."iTAKA: This would be a decent place to hide... if it weren't for the ton of Pokémon strolling about."PI may have many healing items, but I still only have so many healing items."8TAKA: Somehow everywhere we go looks amazing to me."<Maybe living for myself means finally seeing the world."WTAKA: Looking at a place like this, I get the feeling anything could be beyond it."Maybe this is where I run.":TAKA: Something is off in the energy of this place..."3I wonder what it is that makes it so unstable?"Then again, same."FTAKA: This place feels like a huge deja vu trip for me somehow..."OTAKA: How does something like this even keep from collapsing in on itself?"-Sorry, I wasn't talking about the cave--"I meant myself."ZTAKA: There has to be something more here... Or else why would I be remembering this?"uTAKA: I swear, one of these sand pits is gonna have a Trapinch at the bottom, and that's gonna be the end of us."?TAKA: By the way, do you have any idea where you're going?"I mean, if not, it's cool."AFrankly, I've never once in my life known where I was going."9TAKA: This place isn't so bad during the night, huh?"&If you can get past all the sand."And the...":Actually I guess that's about all there is here, huh."5TAKA: My heart's racing from escaping like this."(Well, either that or a heat stroke."(TAKA: Nobody's following us, right?"eTAKA: Listen, if you see anyone suspicious, just bury me in the sand and come back for me later."�TAKA: For somewhere that only half-exists and is tossed out in the middle of who knows how many miles of sand, this place is pretty tidy.";TAKA: If you ask me, this place is entirely too clean."YTAKA: I still don't really get that whole sliding block puzzle, but I'm glad you do."CI bet it would be a lot easier if you could see it from above."...Is that your secret?"ITAKA: This doesn't seem like it would be a bad place to hide, but..."3Maybe I just don't want to be alone after all."9TAKA: I relate to these trains on a spiritual level.":TAKA: You think there's food in some of these trains?"FTAKA: I always wanted to crash trains into a pile of scrap metal."9Being with you makes dreams come true, or something.":TAKA: Is there really anything out here in this mess?"?Like, I get there's supposed to be a Gym here, but... why."TTAKA: It feels wrong, traveling with someone who was supposed to be my enemy..."3But then again, my entire life has been wrong."#So this feels right after all."RTAKA: I wonder how long it'll take the others to realize I'm not coming back."'If they haven't already, anyway..."7TAKA: ZEL is gonna get chewed out because of me..."VFather had asked them to keep tabs on me when they weren't working on the PULSEs.":Then again, I heard Zero's not doing too well lately."DTAKA: I know Team Meteor's track record isn't exactly the best,"5But they're still the only family I've ever had."6TAKA: You know, Meteor wasn't always like this..."1Originally we just looked after the Citadel."MMy dad said that his parents were more like shrinekeepers than anything."9TAKA: \PN, I'm sorry for always being such a burden."DTAKA: None of this would have happened if not for that woman..."?She's corrupted Team Meteor-- both our ends and our means."STAKA: My father says none of this would have happened if not for that woman..."tThe Champion of Reborn, who created the League and advertised it across the world like some kind of fairground."CShe closed up the old city's wounds, hiding the Citadel again."bRegardless of anyone's ideals, why bother just building over a ruin instead of preserving it?")That sounds like something I'd pull."PTAKA: My father says that whatever happens to Reborn City is its own fault."pAfter my grandparents' death, the founders built Reborn City on top of the holy Citadel, trying to hide it."<It was the ultimate insult to our forebearers' culture.")Or whatever that's supposed to mean."ETAKA: Hey, in your travels, did you ever meet a girl named Luna?"/She was one of my only friends growing up."Then she ran away..."Just like me now, I guess."I think about her a lot."ITAKA: Hey, this is just a random question, but you know Luna, right?"%If you see her again, tell her--"...Actually, never mind."OI kind of think it's my fault that she's become as delusional as she is..."TAfter all, if I hadn't been born, she wouldn't have had to be in that position."0TAKA: Hey, \PN, what are your parents like?""You've seen how my father is."#And my mother-- was just that."<She was hired to have me, and then she went on her way."$But that's not normal... right?"[TAKA: I know he's done no shortage of destructive things, but my father isn't all bad."qHis dream for Reborn is what his childhood was like-- a small community in reverence to our world's creator."+The one who's really dangerous is Lin."/TAKA: Do you think my father will be okay?"6He's been harsh with me, but only out of concern."1I'm the one that just can't get it together."Not faithfully, anyway..."TAKA: ..."*Oh, sorry \PN, did you say something?"I totally spaced out."KTAKA: I hope my father doesn't take it too hard when he gets the news."=He never really got over losing his parents like he did."8He's always in fear of losing things from the past."7That's why he fights so hard for Reborn's history.")TAKA: Lin's not following us, right?"RThat woman never talks except when she's giving orders or spitting on others."DShe's more like a robot than a human, but even less empathetic."'TAKA: Everything is Lin's fault..."(That woman is chaos inside and out."$Did you know she's narcoleptic?"TI can't tell you how many times we've found her collapsed in some random place."CAnd no matter what we do, she won't wake up except on her own."!TAKA: Do you hate my father?"@TAKA: I know he's not exactly a shining beacon of morals..."1But he's always fighting for his own ideals.")That was something I never could do."Until now, I guess."!TAKA: Even after everything?"...Thank you."eTAKA: He may be subordinate to my father, but you should watch out more for Sirius than for him."{He's always had the "history is written by the winners" mindset, but since he's fallen in with Lin, it's gotten much worse."7TAKA: Elias will probably be looking for me too..."RI don't want to be found by anyone, but at least Elias is loyal to my father."PI can't imagine having someone act towards me the way he does to my father."!I deserve that least of all."STAKA: You had something to do with that doctor guy joining us recently, right?"$That guy creeps me out so much."HHe's almost stalking Lin, like he's obsessed with her or something.".TAKA: Everyone connected to Lin is crazy."Like that girl, Terra."FEveryone talks about her like her technical ability is unrivaled,"nBut she's almost never around the bases, and then when she is, we end up having to repair a ton of stuff."-But Lin always insists she stays anyway."LTAKA: You remember that guy who was with Ace, ZEL, and I in Rhodocrine?">Back then, some of the grunts were saying you killed him."#He wasn't the friendliest guy."oIn fact, he never stayed to talk, or did orders he didn't have to, and he argued with Sirius all the time."ABut even then... you wouldn't do something like that, right?"vTAKA: You know, I think there's someone in Team Meteor who really had it out for you-- more than normal, that is."|Elias brought in this new recruit, and for a while he was always saying how he was going to get back at you for something..."Then suddenly he changed."Maybe he just got over it?"�TAKA: I'm not sure if I'd even still be out here now if it weren't for you and that red-haired menace back at the Water Treatment Center.".Thanks for dealing with me all this time."+TAKA: So what's up with that Fern guy?"?He joined recently, but everyone just complains about him."Weren't you two friends?"JTAKA: I'm not the first one you've helped turn tail from Meteor, huh?"-I heard that Cal went off with you, too.">You really have a way of pulling people apart, don't you?")TAKA: So like... what's your secret?"'Is it why you hardly say anything?"nTAKA: Being out here is a lot more interesting than staying cooped up in Meteor's drama, that's for sure."=Most of the people around there are the opposite of fun."*Well, I guess Blake was pretty funny."[He's been with us for a while, and used to look after me when I was younger sometimes."GHe'd die before he'd admit it, but I think he actually likes kids."GTAKA: You've pretty much ransacked all of our bases by now, huh..."2Lin's been moving everything into Labradorra."^Before that, we mostly stuck around the Devon Building, the Workstation, and the Sanctum.";Most of my childhood memories are around those places."mTAKA: Listen, \PN... We have one more base up in the Carnelia Region-- besides Labradorra City, that is."GI feel like, even if I tell you not to go there, you won't listen." But, seriously... don't go."-They'll probably try and lure you there."LIt would be really bad if you went... and I don't mean for Team Meteor."'TAKA: I really hope Ace is okay..."NIt's not unlike them to disappear for a while, but never for this long..."JThey really livened the place up, and got along with almost everyone."1...Everyone except Terra and Lin, basically."GLACEON: Glayy~!"Glaceon used Heal Bell!"#Your team was cured of status!"GLACEON: Glayyy-ceon?"Pet Glaceon?"GLACEON: Glay~ceon!"GLACEON: ...ceon."What should Glaceon do?""Should Glaceon use Heal Bell?"ESPEON: Esp!"Espeon used Future Sight!"ESPEON: Esp! Espeon?"Pet Espeon?"ESPEON: Esp~!"ESPEON: Esp?"What should Espeon do?"$Should Espeon use Future Sight?"Captured a Z-Cell!"Electric Terrain!"Grassy Terrain!"Misty Terrain!"Dark Crystal Cavern!"Chess Board Arena!"Big Top Arena!"Burning Field!"Swamp Field!"Rainbow Field!"Corrosive Field!"Corrosive Mist Field!"Desert Field!"Icy Field!"Rocky Field!"Forest Field!"Super-heated Field!"Factory Field!"Short-circuit Field!"Wasteland!"Ashen Beach!"Water Surface!"Underwater!"
Cave!"Glitch Field!"Crystal Cavern!"Murkwater Surface!"Mountain!"Snowy Mountain!"Holy Field!"Mirror Arena!"Fairy Tale Field!"Dragon's Den!"Flower Garden Field!"Starlight Arena!"New World!"Inverse Field!"Psychic Terrain!"NOEL: What?"NOEL: ...Um."3...Did you walk through the wall or something?"3NOEL: How did we even get back past the vines?".NOEL: Here, the totals were 7 against 10."eTogetic was the entire 7, and we had to remove an Umbreon to progress, leaving only a Mismagius."�Because the Umbreon on the first floor faced evenly against Espeon, which Eve confirmed to have a value of 3, we know Umbreon also has 3 power."XEve also confirmed Chingling has a power of 2, and that Mightyena has a power of 5."PNOEL: The total for the light side is 7. The total for the dark side is 10."!Eve said Togetic is worth 7."\We also know from previous floors that Espeon is 3, Chingling is 2, and Mightyena is 5."2There was also an Umbreon on the first floor."/NOEL: Here, the totals were 12 against 14."TTogetic was confirmed 7, and Espeon was confirmed 3. There was also a Cleffa..."*They faced off against two Mismagius."7So Mismagius is easy to pin down the value of too."QNOEL: The total for the light side is 12. The total for the dark side is 14."vWe know Togetic was worth 7, and I think we can reasonably conclude by now that values carry over between floors."5Mismagius and Togetic were both 7. Espeon was 3."YIf you need to check what Pokémon were on previous floors, just ask me on each one.".NOEL: Here, the totals were 10 against 9."HIt was a Flabébé, a Floette, and a Florges against three Umbreon."xBased on this, we can reasonably assume that evolutionary lines have increasing powers consistent with their lines."~There is no guarantee that these power levels are proportional to their in-combat capabilities, so don't assume too much."@NOEL: The total for the light side is 10. For dark side, 9."9We know from the first floor Umbreon is valued at 3."9There are some obvious conclusions to be drawn here."9NOEL: This floor had 30 on light against 26 on dark."4On the dark side, there were only two Zweilous."%On the light side, there were..."ETwo Espeon, two Floette, a Florges, a Chingling, and a Granbull."Too much."2NOEL: 30 on the light side versus 26 on dark."That's a lot."gFrom what we know of previous floors, Espeon is 3, Floette is 3, Florges is 5, and Chingling is 2."6NOEL: This floor had 24 on light, and 21 on dark."�It's easy to figure out Zweilous' value from the previous floor, but even having opened the way, it's not clear from this floor alone what Murkrow or Houndour are worth."#NOEL: 24 on light, 21 on dark."5Everything is new except Zweilous, which was 13."6NOEL: This one was 18 on light versus 24 on dark."MGranbull and Togetic faced off against Houndour, Drifloon and Mandibuzz."1That seemed to be a very strong Mandibuzz..."#NOEL: 18 on light, 24 on dark."7On the light side, Granbull was 11, Togetic was 7."xOn the dark side, Houndour was on the previous floor but the numbers make it impossible to know its value for sure." It should be either 3 or 5.")NOEL: 20 on light versus 31 on dark."/I get the feeling that we're near the end."wAll of the values here are tecnically unknown, but we can infer relativistic properties based on their evolutions."KFor the sake of convenience, I'll list the evolutions we've confirmed:":For the light side, Cleffa and Chingling were both 2."zFor the dark side, Mismagius was 7, Mightyena was 5, Mandibuzz was a whopping 17, Umbreon was 3, and Zweilous was 13."ONOEL: In order to progress, we have to balance the power of the two sides."|Each Pokémon contributes a certain amount of power based on its species, expressed in a prime number between 1 and 20."9Also, neither side can reach a remaining power of 0."`There's no way to see what the immediate power of a side is; only what it is when we enter."6Ask me what the totals of each floor is whenever."UAlso, if you take me to previous floors, I'll probably remember their solutions."Just in case you forget."*NOEL: Sure, I can heal your Pokémon."7NOEL: This place looks so bland without any color."I guess it suits me.">NOEL: It's been a while since I saw a Cleffa like that..."INOEL: It's a good thing these levels don't consider type advantages."<I wonder if they're like Shadow type Pokémon that way."BNOEL: I think there are actually two solutions to this one..."uPrime numbers provide a lot of unique ways of creating sums, but a lot of unsolved problems have come from them."LFor instance, there's one... I think it's called the Golbat Conjecture?"ZThat states that every even number above two is the sum of at least two other primes."jI've been thinking about it as we do this, and every number I check, even through the billions, fits,"/But that still doesn't mean they all will."CI'm sorry I can't tell you the specific power values like Eve."NOEL: This is simple."Not easy."Just simple."ENOEL: The doctor never let us have Gym puzzles at the orphanage."JBut if I had been allowed to have one, maybe this would've been okay."&NOEL: I kind of miss Gym Battles."QThe calculations are imprecise, but that's what makes them more interesting."NTAKA: ...Father, Elena, Corey, Ame... They're all dead because of Meteor."[TAKA: Heather looks exactly like her mother. It's a shame she never got to meet her..."ZTAKA: Maybe it's the swords, but I have a pretty good idea who we're about to meet..."VTAKA: ...It was nice to meet Grandfather. He was nothing like I expected, though."BELIAS: Have I mentioned that I'm uncomfortable around swords?"/Particularly when people point them at me.",ELIAS: Amethyst, Elena... Even Phoenix."J...Would this all have gone differently if I let myself have friends?"2ELIAS: Heather looks so much like her mother."/...It's a shame she never got to meet her."FELIAS: If I had just tried to convince him Sirius was bad news..."+So many people would still be alive..."LIN: wait, hey"can i have a lemonade?"i haven't had one in"4well i was going to say 'since i was a kid' but"uh"'when i was a younger kid, i guess?"anyway can i have one?"LIN: wow. thanks!"(you're way too nice, you know that?"like, seriously"#i'm kind of worried about you."Fare you the type of person who has trouble saying 'no' to people?"Mbecause, like, you could just say 'no'-- others don't have a right to..."1...you know what, i'm not gonna question it."thanks for the lemonade!"LIN: it's, um..."'definitely the best i've ever had."by far."i might cry."JLIN: if i cry over a lemonade, you're not allowed to tell anyone, ok?"LIN: okay..."t-thanks."=LIN: ...okay, probably i deserve that just a little bit."fair play, \PN."fair play."(LIN: wait you don't even have one--"the stand is right there."0come on, aren't you gonna buy at least one?"xafter everything i've put us through, you don't just wanna have at least one cool glass of fresh-squeezed lemonade?"7...well, i'm not in any place to judge, i guess..."LIN: okay, that's fair"i won't ask again.":LIN: just try not to think about how awkward this is."5it's like, several dimensions' worth of awkward.",wait shoot no i was thinking about it--"GLIN: so... you offer unconditional mercy around these parts often?"#LIN: uh, for what it's worth--"3not that i really understand what's going on--" or who i'm even speaking to"but"i'm, uh,"sorry."for a few things."maybe more than a few."idk, i haven't counted."9LIN: you're totally taking me to prison, aren't you."0...well, it's not like i haven't been here.".SHELLY: We had a wonderful time in Agate."7Everyone was so excited to see you after 10 years!")So many people have changed so much."2...But even the best days can't last forever."3I know you need to head back to your own time."fI'm sure you could spend forever in Agate, talking to everyone and seeing what they're doing now."DSHELLY: ...But don't you think that's a story for another time?"MALAMAR: Marram!!"W-Whaaa? We lost? Aww..."BOh... It seems that we aren't strong enough yet... Oh well..."\PN won a bonus!"Yes"No"Heal Bell"Wait here"Never mind"Future Sight"This Floor"	Help"	Heal"	Chat[�":FERN: Ils se prennent pour qui ces abrutis, sérieux?")FERN: Arrête de me parler et bouge!"Finissons-en vite fait!"4FERN: Tu fais vraiment tache, à côté de moi."DTout seul, j'aurais déjà réglé leur compte à ces minables."FERN: Tu veux ma photo?">Il y a de la mire sur toutes les chaînes de la télé...":La silhouette d'un Neitram se dessine sur l'écran..."
...?!"EQuelle chaîne?\n\ch[62,-1,JT,Interviews,Profils,Chasse,Météo]"'Flash Info avec Gardevoir Glamour!"<Un reportage exclusif de notre Équipe d'Investigation!"/L'Entretien Entrevue de Gardevoir Glamour!"!Oh, c'est une rediffusion..."#Édition Spéciale: En Chasse!"(Un bulletin météo est diffusé..."Oh, c'est la pub..."VOLTORBE: Bzzt!".SHELLY: J'essaie de ne pas te ralentir..."4SHELLY: Heather... Je suis tellement désolée."CSHELLY: Est-ce que... les gens font vraiment attention à moi?"BSHELLY: Dépêchons-nous! Tiens bon encore un peu, Heather..." VICTORIA: Dépêchons-nous!"7VICTORIA: Je n'ai jamais vu Amina aussi diminuée."PElle a été comme une mère pour moi... C'est vraiment douloureux à voir."ZVICTORIA: Je ne comprends pas. Pourquoi la Team Meteor veut faire fuir tout le monde?"VICTORIA: Hé, \PN?"4Je suis contente que tu sois avec moi pour ça."-Veuillez retirer un Pokémon utilisable."9CAIN: Il y a quelque chose de vraiment étrange ici."CAIN: Faut les secourir!"3Qui sait de quoi le Dr. Schnock est capable..."CAIN: S-senpai..."Je rigole, hein?"$Haha, me regarde pas comme ça!"/CAIN: ~ Quand il faudra passer à l'action"Nos amis seront là ~"'~ Et tous ensemble, nous gagnerons"Le dernier des combats! ~"Tauros s'enfuit!";(En chevauchant Tauros, appuyer sur A pour descendre.)"5La chaîne info est bloquée sur une image fixe."2"Nous avons quelques problèmes techniques..."TSi vous avez des informations, veuillez contacter le centre de diffusion à...""Bonjour, tout le monde~"gC'est moi, votre Gardevoir préférée, toujours à l'affût des meilleurs scoops dans Flash Info!"�La croissance des plantes est de plus en plus incontrôlable dans le Quartier Obsidienne malgré les meilleurs efforts de la ville pour contenir ce phénomène hors du commun!"�Notre Championne de type Plante, Florinia, s'est rendue sur place pour débloquer la situation, sans amélioration notable pour l'instant!"IY a-t-il quoi que ce soit qui puisse pacifier cette sinistre scène?"yFlorinia retourne dans le feu de l'action à Obsidienne, faisant face aux plantes qui menacent de détruire la zone!"{Auparavant elle était accompagnée d'un des Champions les plus haut classés de Reborn, Amaria, la Championne du type Eau!";Cependant, Amaria semble avoir disparu pour l'instant." Où peut-elle être partie?"RY a-t-il quelque chose de plus important pour elle que la sûreté de Reborn?"�Maintenant que le calme est revenu sur Obsidienne, ce qui reste des forces de police de la ville se tourne vers les quartiers Jaspe et Béryl."lTous les deux ravagés par cette sorcellerie végétale, les dégâts pourraient être irrémédiables!"IDe courageux dresseurs s'aventurent malgré tous dans ces quartiers!"BEspèrent-ils dénicher quelque trésor parmi les décombres?"3Peut-être cherchent-ils simplement la gloire!"JLe seul moyen de... Minute, quoi? Quelque chose vient de me survoler!" Ça n'a pas atterri loin..."Excusez-moi, jeune fille!"3Pourriez-vous répondre à quelques questions?"#???: Dégage, j'suis occupée!""J'vais régler ça moi-même!"Drattak, décollage!"%GARDEVOIR: ... La voilà partie."/Quelle grossiéreté pour une jeune fille!""Mais qu'espère-t-elle faire?"UFlash spécial! Une bombe a explosé en plein coeur du Quartier Obsidienne Nord!"JLes forces de l'ordre se précipitent pour faire évacuer les civils!"VOn dirait que le but était la destruction du célèbre Grand Escalier de Reborn!"YUne série de marches de pierre menant à la sortie, aujourd'hui close, de la ville."'Mais comment cela est-il arrivé?!"AQui donc pourrait en vouloir à une structure si innocente?!"ELa police continue d'enquêter sur le récent décès à Reborn!"�L'individu a été identifié comme étant Corey, l'ancien Champion d'Arène de Béryl. Mais on ignore encore les circonstances exactes."xNéanmoins! Des rumeurs prétendent que l'ancien Champion avait peut-être des liens avec la sournoise Team Meteor!"BNous vous en dirons plus à mesure que la vérité éclatera."KSe pourrait-il que d'autres champions aient des connexions similaires?"3Sommes-nous au coeur d'une sombre machination?"ICorey laisse derrière lui sa fille, Heather. une petite malpolie...",Mais elle est actuellement introuvable!".Qu'a-t-il pu arriver à la pauvre enfant?"0Il se passe de drôles de choses à Reborn!"CDans l'actualité, la récente évasion de l'Orphelinat local!"QUn électrochoc pour le Dr. Sigmund Connal, infirmier en chef et psychiatre!"�Pendant ce temps, comme par magie, la vieille Centrale de l'autre côté du Pont Béryl, inactive depuis des années, s'est remise en route!"�Les habitants du Quartier Obsidienne, stupéfaits, ont pu contempler les vestiges de l'ancien bâtiment Yureyu, autrefois noyau économique de Reborn, reprendre vie!"6Serait-ce le signe d'une renaissance de la firme?"MCe qui est sûr, c'est qu'il y a quelqu'un dans le bâtiment! Mais qui?!"�Flash Info! L'usine abandonnée du Quartier Péridot, tristement célèbre pour avoir continué à tourner pendant des années à vide...",...A soudainement cessé son activité!"�Pour avoir le fin mot de cette sombre affaire industrielle, moi, votre Gardevoir Glamour, me suis infiltrée incognito, et quelle découverte!"KL'usine était en réalité dirigée par nul autre que la Team Meteor!"UQui plus est, ils l'utilisaient pour empoisonner le lac Azurine délibérément!";Quel affreuse besogne! Qu'y gagne donc la Team Meteor?"ACar après tout, l'eau ne semble toujours pas plus propre...""Y a-t-il d'autres manigances?"�Flash Info: Quelques jours seulement après la mort de l'ancien Champion Corey, un second décès a frappé la célèbre Ligue de Reborn."rLa Sensei d'Apophylle, Amina, a été assassinée au sommet du Mont Pyros qui surplombe la plage d'Apophylle."zOn raconte que le meurtrier n'est autre que le chef de la sinistre Team Meteor, lequel serait parvenu à s'échapper."�Amina, professeure respectée de l'Académie d'Apophylle, site balnéaire qu'elle avait fondé seule, sera remplacée par son apprentie."mMais que peut espérer retirer de sa mort la Team Meteor? Était-ce un accident, ou un acte malveillant?"�De récents rapports suggèrent que l'ancien bâtiment Yureyu, autrefois centre économique de Reborn, a subi un sort différent de ce que nous croyions."�Selon l'histoire de Reborn, le siège de Yureyu s'était effondré suite à une série de tremblements de terre, et la compagnie avait alors coulé."~En conséquence, la Centrale s'était arrêtée, plongeant la ville dans le noir, puis avait été laissée à l'abandon."_Mais notre derniere enquête indique que les séismes n'étaient pas la véritable cause ."7Derrière tout ça se cachait la vile Team Meteor!"]Cela signifie que la Team Meteor est responsable du Black-Out d'il y a quelques années!"%Mais qu'espèrent-ils y gagner?!"RSauf que ce ne sont pas de bonnes nouvelles du tout! En fait, c'est terrible!"HIl y a eu un enlèvement, et vous n'en devinerez jamais la victime!"C'est moi!"\Ne perdez pas de temps à vous demander comment je suis encore à l'antenne, aidez-moi!"7Mais pour ceux d'entre vous qui se le demandent..."KUne explosion a récemment retenti au sommet de la Montagne de Tanzan!"�Les autorités enquêtent toujours sur la cause, mais des rumeurs dévalant la montagne suggèrent que cela pourrait être une autre manoeuvre de la Team Meteor!"oLa vile organisation y aurait prétendument détenu une base, mais pourquoi dans ce cas l'avoir détruite?"FAuraient-ils démantelé leur propre installation par sécurité?"Étaient-ils attaqués?":Ou les événements ont-ils très, très mal tourné?"jDrame sur drame en ce moment au Château Vanhanen! D'abord j'ai été kidnappée, et maintenant Luna!"Le chaos, je vous dis!"%À peine de quoi faire un sujet!"KEnfin, je pourrais, mais je suis à la recherche de ma petite chérie."Vais-je la retrouver?!"vLes événements s'étant un peu calmés, je suis heureuse de pouvoir vous proposer une émission plus classique!"<Les épisodes précédents ont été un vrai tohu-bohu!"%Concentrons-nous sur du positif!"XUn individu récemment rescapé des profondeurs d'une ancienne ruine souterraine..."?Wow, on dirait que ça sort d'un manga ou d'un jeu vidéo!"]...S'est lancé dans l'ambitieux projet de restaurer la ville de Reborn personnellement!"�La manager de la Ligue de Reborn, Ame, ainsi que les deux Championnes Julia et Florinia se sont récemment réunies pour réparer cette ville une fois pour toutes!"LCependant, ce genre d'initiative a jusqu'à présent toujours échoué."*Reborn honorera-t-elle enfin son nom?"<Ou le projet s'avèrera-t-il être une énième fiasco?"oJe me trouve avec Saphira, la Championne du type Dragon, à Calcinéon, où une bataille vient d'éclater!"RComme vous le savez, les villes de Calcinéon et de Labradorra sont voisines."fMais la Team Meteor a complètement pris le contrôle de Labradorra suite à une attaque éclair!"bLa plupart des citoyens ont pu être évacués, mais certains sont toujours retenus en otage!"sPour parer à cela, quelques-uns des plus puissants Dresseurs de Reborn forment une résistance à Calcinéon!"2Saphira, votre point de vue sur la situation?"3SAPHIRA: La négociation n'est pas une option."VNous trouverons un moyen de contourner la barrière et de récupérer les otages.")GARDEVOIR: La barrière! C'est vrai!"<La Team Meteor utilise une technologie particulière..."LMes sources m'indiquent que la machine qu'ils utilisent se nomme SUPRA!"cIl y ont attaché un M. Mime, ce qui a créé un puissant champ de force autour de Labradorra!"#SAPHIRA: Ce n'est pas le seul."uNous savons qu'un second SUPRA est en préparation au sein de la ville, et ils en ont deux autres aux alentours."tGARDEVOIR: Avec ces mystérieuses machines qui amplifient les pouvoirs des Pokémon, les cartes sont rebattues!"BLe champ de force ceignant Labradorra peut-il être détruit?"7Qu'adviendra-t-il de la résistance à Calcinéon?":La situation à Calcinéon s'est ENCORE intensifiée!"vLa Team Meteor a installé un deuxième SUPRA-Pokémon à Labradorra et tente d'assiéger la ville de Calcinéon!"oLes attaques boostées au Méga Blaster de leur SUPRA-Gamblast sèment la destruction dans toute la ville!">Et avec le champ de force, impossible de contre-attaquer!"$Tout n'est cependant pas perdu!"�La Championne du type Dragon, Saphira, continue de lutter contre la Team Meteor en essayant de dévier les attaques avec son Dracolosse!"Pourra-t-elle tenir bon?"4Ou l'assault des Meteor sera-t-il trop intense?"=Flash info spécial en provenance de la ville de Reborn."nUne source anonyme nous a indiqué que la vile Team Meteor, connue pour semer le chaos dans la région..."R...Dispose d'une autre base à l'intérieur même de la ville, sous nos yeux!"�Bien que ce ne soit qu'une demi-surprise, puisqu'au moins trois de leurs précédentes bases avaient été localisées dans la ville..."�Les autorités sont déconcertées par l'idée qu'il y en ait encore une autre, croyant fermement que la ville était débarrassée pour de bon de la Team Meteor."ELe conflit entre Reborn et la Team Meteor ne fait que commencer!",Où pourrait être cette base secrète?"oCitoyens de Reborn, ouvrez l'œil et guettez le moindre endroit suspect et exploitable par la Team Meteor!"Et comme toujours..."9L'ambiance ici à Reborn est complètement inédite!"�Grâce à l'émergence d'une politique toute nouvelle et surtout l'initiative d'un des Champions de Reborn, Adrienn, la ville est désormais éclatante de vie!"|Des citoyens de tous les coins ont entamé un immense travail de reconstruction et de rétablissement de la métropole."�Ici, sur les lieux, nous venons de terminer quelques réparations structurelles, et nous passons à des améliorations esthétiques!">Vous n'en croiriez pas vos yeux, chers téléspectateurs!"�J'attends encore que le démon du désespoir surgisse des profondeurs pour tout gâcher, puisque c'est comme ça que ça se passe habituellement!"ESera-ce réellement un nouveau chapitre de l'histoire de Reborn?")La ville de Reborn a besoin de VOUS!"-Avez-vous un penchant pour le bricolage?"L'artisanat?"L'organisation?"Aider votre prochain?"COu voulez-vous simplement apporter votre pierre à l'édifice?"�Alors passez par votre Grand Hall local aujourd'hui pour vous inscrire au Projet de Reconstruction de la Ville, et voyez comment VOUS pouvez nous aider!"�Avec votre aide et nos efforts combinés, nous pouvons faire de Reborn la ville qu'elle a toujours rêvé d'être, une brique après l'autre!"!...Hein? Une démonstration?":Comment ça, vous voulez que JE déplace ces briques?"gJe suis un Gardevoir, pas un Machopeur! Confiez ce genre de tâche à des Pokémon faits pour ça!"0Comment ça, ce sont des propos déplacés?"DÉcoutez, c'est vous qui vouliez que je fasse cette publicité!"5Euuh, je serai quand même payée, rassurez-moi?"+Et voilà! Reborn n'a plus de Maître!"Vous avez bien entendu!"�Le Maître de Reborn et la Manager de la Ligue, notre chère Ame, a soudainement démissionné de son poste d'après un communiqué officiel du Grand Hall.">Le communiqué complet n'a pas encore été rendu public."eMais des sources suggèrent que le départ d'Ame serait dû à de récents problèmes de santé."�En tant que la figure de proue originelle de la réouverture la Ligue de Reborn et de la repopulation qui s'en est suivie, Ame nous manquera à tous grandement."�Elle n'aura pas longtemps défendu son titre, mais reconnaissons que les Champions de Reborn n'ont pas laissé passer un seul challenger pendant tout ce temps!"Le trône est bien gardé!"yMais soyez rassurés, chers Dresseurs, la Ligue de Reborn reste ouverte, et c'est le moment ou jamais de la défier!"fLa gestion de la Ligue de Reborn a été transférée à une personne on ne peut plus méritante:"QAdrienn Flores, Champion de type Fée et Chef d'Orchestre de la Rénovation."jAinsi que Victoria Marlow, spécialiste du type Combat et nouvelle Sensei de l'Académie d'Apophylle."�Ces deux-là ont été sur tous les fronts lors de la renaissance de la ville, et la Ligue de Reborn sera entre deux bonnes paires de mains."VEt pour vous tous, Dresseurs qui rêvent de s'asseoir sur le trône du Maître..."%Le prochain Maître de Reborn..." ...ça pourrait être vous!"�Le premier Dresseur qui collectionnera les 18 Badges et qui traversera la Route Victoire jusqu'au Panthéon deviendra le Maître de Reborn!"Êtes-VOUS à la hauteur?"oLes disparitions en série continuent dans la région de Carnélia, tandis qu'Agate est toujours endormie!"YLes gens sont bien au courant depuis le temps qu'Agate a été mise au repos forcé,"?Mais peu de gens savent ce qu'il se passe au Nord d'Agate!"xLa résistance anti-Meteor à Calcinéon perd peu à peu ses membres, à mesure que les disparitions se succèdent!"rIl s'agit toujours d'une ou deux personnes à la fois, comme si quelque chose les enlevait en un clin d'œil!"8Qu'est-ce ce qui pourrait être derrière tout ça?"|En tant que pionnière du journalisme d'investigation et du bottage de popotin, je suis déterminée à trouver la réponse!"|Nous nous dirigeons vers Carnélia en ce moment même, pour découvrir une bonne fois pour toute la cause de ce phénomène!""Et l'horrible vérité est..."GNe manquez pas la prochaine émission! \n~XOXO ~Gardevoir Glamour~"-L'image est bloquée sur un écran fixe."}Bonjour! Ici Gardevoir Glamour pour Entracte Entrevue, pour VOUS emmener au coeur des scoops sur les célébrités de Reborn!"�Aujourd'hui, un reportage spécial avec Bennett Voclain, un apprenti entomologiste studieux, un peu agaçant, et carrément bizarre!"*Bonjour, Bennett! Dites-nous, quel..."?BENNETT: Gardevoir, qu'est-ce que tu fais dans ma chambre?"1GARDEVOIR: C'est une interview, joue le jeu!"0BENNETT: C'est... attends, c'est en direct?"9GARDEVOIR: Bien sûr! Bennett, dites-nous comment..."8BENNETT: Ok non, sors de ma chambre s'il te plaît."4J'essaie d'étudier. Tu n'as rien à faire ici."4GARDEVOIR: Oh, tu étudies! Et qu'est-ce que..."(BENNETT: Va-t'en, va-t'en, va-t'en.")Je vais le dire à Maman, Gardevoir."KGARDEVOIR: Insolent! Comment oses-tu me menacer, moi la grande Gard..."*VLAN*"AGARDEVOIR: Est-ce qu'il vient de me claquer la porte au nez?"Bennett?! Bennett!!!"Ooooooh...",Dès que ça coupe, je vais te me le..."D'ailleurs..."RAujourd'hui, 