tion was hybridized."KGARDEVOIR: I see! So in other words, it was your idea to combine them!"WYou must have a real passion for education to be willing to take that on yourself!"/FLORINIA: Passion is an irrelevant factor."FThe operation is necessary, and I am able to function adequately."<GARDEVOIR: Oh? Does that mean you don't enjoy the work?")FLORINIA: Enjoyment is a triviality."Only function matters."GARDEVOIR: How boring!">Surely there must be something you enjoy doing, Florinia?"bFLORINIA: Personal emotion is too confounding of a condition to reach that assumption safely."DAnd misinterpretation of human emotion can lead to severe risk."iThis writer has already lost too much at its hand; thus, as logically directed, the risk is avoided."%GARDEVOIR: Oh my, this is juicy!"vSo you were hurt by someone in the past and that's why you ignore your emotions-- is that what I'm understanding?"1FLORINIA: That is a sufficent abstract, yes."/GARDEVOIR: Lovely! Do tell, what happened?"6FLORINIA: The conclusion will not be forthcoming.")The previous analysis is sufficient."Good bye."=GARDEVOIR: What? I say when the interview ends, not you!",Darn it! This was finally getting good!"CI'm here right now with someone very special to me personally."JSay hello to Reborn's Ice Gym Leader and former model, Serra Voclain!"4SERRA: Goodness, Gardevoir, this is a surprise."MI assumed you'd come back home to collect your belongings, not for this."@GARDEVOIR: What's the matter? You seem almost disappointed!"!SERRA: No, not in the least."DNeither by the interview nor by you not collecting your things."1Lord knows no one else is using those rooms."BIt's just been a long time since I've had a public interview."-It's not a feeling I'd expected to miss."dGARDEVOIR: That's right, you gave up your career for your son before. Do you regret doing that?"SERRA: It's hard to say."�I think the best way to put it is-- although I do feel remorse for what I've lost, I wouldn't change my decision even if