 a silver lining after this tumultuous weather though: expect sunny days coming up just around the corner."(Stay warm and keep on, Reborn City!")Keep cool and carry on, Reborn City!"?The Powder spoiled from being shaken on the unstable rock!"fAYA: I know I'm not good for very much, but I'd appreciate if you didn't use me as a meat-shield.")AYA: The others will be okay, right?"&Uh, don't tell them that I asked.".AYA: It'll be a straight shot, they said."-It's right around the corner, they said."AYA: Hey."'Uh, thanks for putting up with me."HDon't get the wrong idea! I just felt like it was the thing to say."6And now for this week's forecast for Reborn City!"_We've got clear skies over the weekend, but we're looking at high temperatures on Tuesday."�Fortunately, this won't last long as strong winds on Wednesday are going to blow in a storm system which will take hold for a couple days."�We've got a storm system hitting us mid-week. Clearing up a couple days later, we risk intense sun mid-day Saturday, but that'll clear out from Sunday's high winds!"�We're in for a rainy week! Starting Wednesday, we're looking at a huge storm system coming in. Thunderstorms Thursday and lingering showers until strong winds clear it out for us on Saturday."KThis week is gonna be hot, hot, hot! We've got clearskies all week, but that stagnant air in the city is likely to weaken the local atmosphere resulting in spiking temperatures in the city over the weekend! Fortunately we expect some high winds on Sunday to come in and clean out the air, so we should be back to normal afterwards."xScattered showers this week! Look out for slight rainstorms on Monday and Friday, as well as high winds on Tuesday!"�We're looking at a pretty clear week here in Reborn! We've got high winds on Monday and Thursday, but otherwise this is an ideally calm week!"We've got quite the system coming our way! Clear skies Friday and Saturday, but some pretty intense heat coming in Sunday, followed by high winds on Monday and then from there out it is rain, rain, rain! The intense thunderstorm is expected to last two days, tailing off on Thursday."Take care, Reborn City!"Can't use that here."*\PN showed the Application to Mannie."$MANNIE: Whatcha got there, pal?"A construction job?"FIt's just like when we were helping out with the city on our own,"But it pays?!"Man, I can do that!"6That sounds dope! It'll be like that time, right?"+I'll fill this out right away. Thanks!"/This is way too complicated for me, buddy!"/There's no way I could do a job like this."cI always gotta be told what has to be done next, like it was when we were rebuilding the city."$Isn't there anything like that?"(\PN showed the Application to Kriz."KRIZ: Huh? That's..."$An application for The Spyce..."A line cook position?"6That's-- no good. I don't know how to cook lines.":Then again, I can cook other stuff. I cook every day!"XSo maybe, just maybe, there's a chance I can learn to cook up some tasty lines too!"Okay! I'll give it a go!"Don't wait for me!"#Just a job application, right?"FI already told you, I don't have any skills employers would want."CAll I do is make food and sleep. And roll with the Magma Gang."/Don't worry about someone useless like me."+\PN showed the Application to DeFacto."-DEFACTO: And what have you procured now?",An application for the Beryl Library..."*Since when was there a library there?"BI suppose I've already learned one good thing now, haven't I?"4All right, I acquiesce. This sounds intriguing."#I'll pay them a visit. See ya."6Some other kind of meaningless recruitment paper?"How blase."<There's nothing to be learned from something like that."HI'd much rather be somewhere I could engorge myself with knowledge.")\PN showed the Application to Break."BREAK: Oh?".You want me to work at a medicine market?"For a Meganium?"�Dealing substances of questionable validity to perfectly unsuspecting consumers who are more likely to believe in sigils than science?"
