se by that's upbeat and exciting?"#Good food would be a plus too!""Wait, can you eat on the job?")\PN showed the Application to Nihil."NIHIL: Don't bother."The Nightclub's hiring.""All right, fuck you. You win."I'll go and check it out."And uh,"Thanks, I guess."0Weren't you listening? I said don't bother."=There's not a job in this whole city cool enough for me."Isn't that obvious?"TThere's not many places you'd expect to see someone as exclusive as me working."+So just drop it already. You heard it?"*\PN showed the Application to Archer."ARCHER: Hmm..."OSilph Co. requires at least two years of business management experience..."TWell, seems like the Aqua Gang's been quite the profitable business, hasn't it?"bAhh, that title won't do. I'll just quickly rebrand the now-empty group to Aqua Incorporated."bIt should make a fine qualification, and I'm more than capable of brushing aside the details."0This job will suit me perfectly, thank you.")You've been a true friend to us all.".Please take this as a final parting gift."AIt was one of the Pokémon we liberated from the Magma Gang."@The item it's holding is just a personal selection from me."ARCHER: Farewell, \PN."BOh, and don't mind if I list you as a professional reference."'Is this really the best out there?"mCompared to many of the other guys, I would hope I'd be able to get something a little more significant."VI've also managed to keep my record fairly clean, so that shouldn't be a problem."4Was there, by chance, anything more profitable?";ARCHER: Mm? Have you finished with the others already?"/They should be the top priority right now."�While it's true that I will be looking for employment myself shortly, I would rather ensure they all have positions first than risk taking one from them."+\PN showed the Application to Maxwell." MAXWELL: Let's take a look!".SOLICE? Never heard of this place before."PBut the work they do seems to be exactly the sort of thing I'm looking for."Nice catch, \PN!"!I knew I could count on you!"ALet's see... They require 2 years of social work experience?"UI'd say the Magma Gang's work has been pretty social. That should be no problem!"0Anyway, thanks for stickin' it out with us."oWhen you first showed up in our humble ol' alley, I had no idea you'd be the kind of person that you were."2But by now, I've heard the rumours about you."�It took me too long to even connect them to the person I knew, but you're the one who everyone says has been saving Reborn, right?"7And you don't care about the glory at all, do you?"Magnificent bastard."Take this with you."=It's a final "Thank you" gift we got from the Aqua Gang."8Oh, and the item is just a little bonus I threw in."MAXWELL: See you around!"<And don't you dare ever let your glory slip away, baby!"Hmm..."KI don't want to be rude, since you've gone through all this trouble..."#But where's the glory in this?"iIf it's just another normal job, I don't know whose life I can really make a difference in that way."cOf course, I'm willing to wait until a position where I can make a direct difference opens up."(Glory doesn't come overnight, baby."CHeh, though that does sound like a raunchy slogan, doesn't it?"MAXWELL: Woah, hey there."NYou know I was asking you to find applications for the other guys, right?"4Not me-- Well, maybe I'll think about it later."iTAKA: This would be a decent place to hide... if it weren't for the ton of Pokémon strolling about."PI may have many healing items, but I still only have so many healing items."8TAKA: Somehow everywhere we go looks amazing to me."<Maybe living for myself means finally seeing the world."WTAKA: Looking at a place like this, I get the feeling anything could be beyond it."Maybe this is where I run.":TAKA: Something is off in the energy of this place..."3I wonder what it is that makes it so unstable?"Then again, same."FTAKA: This place feels like a huge deja vu trip for me somehow..."OTAKA: How does something like this even keep from collapsing in on itself?"-Sorry, I wasn't talking about the cave--"I meant myself."ZTAKA: There has to be something more here... Or else why would I be remembering this?"uTAKA: I swear, one of these sand pits is gonna have a Trapinch at the bottom, and that's gonna be the end of us."?TAKA: By the way, do you have any idea where you're going?"I mean, if not, it's cool."AFrankly, I've never once in my life known where I was going."9TAKA: This place isn't so bad during the night, huh?"&If you can get past all the sand."And the...":Actually I guess that's about all there is here, huh."5TAKA: My heart's racing from escaping like this."(Well, either that or a heat stroke."(TAKA: Nobody's following us, right?"eTAKA: Listen, if you see anyone suspicious, just bury me in the sand and come back for me later."�TAKA: For somewhere that only half-exists and is tossed out in the middle of who knows how many miles of sand, this place is pretty tidy.";TAKA: If you ask me, this place is entirely too clean."YTAKA: I still don't really get that whole sliding block puzzle, but I'm glad you do."CI bet it would be a lot easier if you could see it from above."...Is that your secret?"ITAKA: This doesn't seem like it would be a bad place to hide, but..."3Maybe I just don't want to be alone after all."9TAKA: I relate to these trains on a spiritual level.":TAKA: You think there's food in some of these trains?"FTAKA: I always wanted to crash trains into a pile of scrap metal."9Being with you makes dreams come true, or something.":TAKA: Is there really anything out here in this mess?"?Like, I get there's supposed to be a Gym here, but... why."TTAKA: It feels wrong, traveling with someone who was supposed to be my enemy..."3But then again, my entire life has been wrong."#So this feels right after all."RTAKA: I wonder how long it'll take the others to realize I'm not coming back."'If they haven't already, anyway..."7TAKA: ZEL is gonna get chewed out because of me..."VFather had asked them to keep tabs on me when they weren't working on the PULSEs.":Then again, I heard Zero's not doing too well lately."DTAKA: I know Team Meteor's track record isn't exactly the best,"5But they're still the only family I've ever had."6TAKA: You know, Meteor wasn't always like this..."1Originally we just looked after the Citadel."MMy dad said that his parents were more like shrinekeepers than anything."9TAKA: \PN, I'm sorry for always being such a burden."DTAKA: None of this would have happened if not for that woman..."?She's corrupted Team Meteor-- both our ends and our means."STAKA: My father says none of this would have happened if not for that woman..."tThe Champion of Reborn, who created the League and advertised it across the world like some kind of fairground."CShe closed up the old city's wounds, hiding the Citadel again."bRegardless of anyone's ideals, why bother just building over a ruin instead of preserving it?")That sounds like something I'd pull."PTAKA: My father says that whatever happens to Reborn City is its own fault."pAfter my grandparents' death, the founders built Reborn City on top of the holy Citadel, trying to hide it."<It was the ultimate insult to our forebearers' culture.")Or whatever that's supposed to mean."ETAKA: Hey, in your travels, did you ever meet a girl named Luna?"/She was one of my only friends growing up."Then she ran away..."Just like me now, I guess."I think about her a lot."ITAKA: Hey, this is just a random question, but you know Luna, right?"%If you see her again, tell her--"...Actually, never mind."OI kind of think it's my fault that she's become as delusional as she is..."TAfter all, if I hadn't been born, she wouldn't have had to be in that position."0TAKA: Hey, \PN, what are your parents like?""You've seen how my father is."#And my mother-- was just that."<She was hired to have me, and then she went on her way."$But that's not normal... right?"[TAKA: I know he's done no shortage of destructive things, but my father isn't all bad."qHis dream for Reborn is what his childhood was like-- a small community in reverence to our world's creator."+The one who's really dangerous is Lin."/TAKA: Do you think my father will be okay?"6He's been harsh with me, but only out of concern."1I'm the one that just can't get it together."Not faithfully, anyway..."TAKA: ..."*Oh, sorry \PN, did you say something?"I totally spaced out."KTAKA: I hope my father doesn't take it too hard when he gets the news."=He never really got over losing his parents like he did."8He's always in fear of losing things from the past."7That's why he fights so hard for Reborn's history.")TAKA: Lin's not following us, right?"RThat woman never talks except when she's giving orders or spitting on others."DShe's more like a robot than a human, but even less empathetic."'TAKA: Everything is Lin's fault..."(That woman is chaos inside and out."$Did you know she's narcoleptic?"TI can't tell you how many times we've found her collapsed in some random place."CAnd no matter what we do, she won't wake up except on her own."!TAKA: Do you hate my father?"@TAKA: I know he's not exactly a shining beacon of morals..."1But he's always fighting for his own ideals.")That was something I never could do."Until now, I guess."!TAKA: Even after everything?"...Thank you."eTAKA: He may be subordinate to my father, but you should watch out more for Sirius than for him."{He's always had the "history is written by the winners" mindset, but since he's fallen in with Lin, it's gotten much worse."7TAKA: Elias will probably be looking for me too..."RI don't want to be found by anyone, but at least Elias is loyal to my father."PI can't imagine having someone act towards me the way he does to my father."!I deserve that least of all."STAKA: You had something to do with that doctor guy joining us recently, right?"$That guy creeps me out so much."HHe's almost stalking Lin, like he's obsessed with her or something.".TAKA: Everyone connected to Lin is crazy."Like that girl, Terra."FEveryone talks about her like her technical ability is unrivaled,"nBut she's almost never around the bases, and then when she is, we end up having to repair a ton of stuff."-But Lin always insists she stays anyway."LTAKA: You remember that guy who was with Ace, ZEL, and I in Rhodocrine?">Back then, some of the grunts were saying you killed him."#He wasn't the friendliest guy."oIn fact, he never stayed to talk, or did orders he didn't have to, and he argued with Sirius all the time."ABut even then... you wouldn't do something like that, right?"vTAKA: You know, I think there's someone in Team Meteor who really had it out for you-- more than normal, that is."|Elias brought in this new recruit, and for a while he was always saying how he was going to get back at you for something..."Then suddenly he changed."Maybe he just got over it?"�TAKA: I'm not sure if I'd even still be out here now if it weren't for you and that red-haired menace back at the Water Treatment Center.".Thanks for dealing with me all this time."+TAKA: So what's up with that Fern guy?"?He joined recently, but everyone just complains about him."Weren't you two friends?"JTAKA: I'm not the first one you've helped turn tail from Meteor, huh?"-I heard that Cal went off with you, too.">You really have a way of pulling people apart, don't you?")TAKA: So like... what's your secret?"'Is it why you hardly say anything?"nTAKA: Being out here is a lot more interesting than staying cooped up in Meteor's drama, that's for sure."=Most of the people around there are the opposite of fun."*Well, I guess Blake was pretty funny."[He's been with us for a while, and used to look after me when I was younger sometimes."GHe'd die before he'd admit it, but I think he actually likes kids."GTAKA: You've pretty much ransacked all of our bases by now, huh..."2Lin's been moving everything into Labradorra."^Before that, we mostly stuck around the Devon Building, the Workstation, and the Sanctum.";Most of my childhood memories are around those places."mTAKA: Listen, \PN... We have one more base up in the Carnelia Region-- besides Labradorra City, that is."GI feel like, even if I tell you not to go there, you won't listen." But, seriously... don't go."-They'll probably try and lure you there."LIt would be really bad if you went... and I don't mean for Team Meteor."'TAKA: I really hope Ace is okay..."NIt's not unlike them to disappear for a while, but never for this long..."JThey really livened the place up, and got along with almost everyone."1...Everyone except Terra and Lin, basically."GLACEON: Glayy~!"Glaceon used Heal Bell!"#Your team was cured of status!"GLACEON: Glayyy-ceon?"Pet Glaceon?"GLACEON: Glay~ceon!"GLACEON: ...ceon."What should Glaceon do?""Should Glaceon use Heal Bell?"ESPEON: Esp!"Espeon used Future Sight!"ESPEON: Esp! Espeon?"Pet Espeon?"ESPEON: Esp~!"ESPEON: Esp?"What should Espeon do?"$Should Espeon use Future Sight?"Captured a Z-Cell!"Electric Terrain!"Grassy Terrain!"Misty Terrain!"Dark Crystal Cavern!"Chess Board Arena!"Big Top Arena!"Burning Field!"Swamp Field!"Rainbow Field!"Corrosive Field!"Corrosive Mist Field!"Desert Field!"Icy Field!"Rocky Field!"Forest Field!"Super-heated Field!"Factory Field!"Short-circuit Field!"Wasteland!"Ashen Beach!"Water Surface!"Underwater!"
