nd I could have sworn not a wisp of it reached us."3The only thing we felt was precious lightning,"/Gently kissing our scars from head to toe."iSilken sand was our embrace, every bead like god- sent glitter, decorating her perfect, soft skin..."0I'll treasure every single memory with her."-AMARIA: U-um, sorry, nevermind all that!"/I just get a little lost in her sometimes."@\PN, thanks for all your help, from the bottom of my heart."Good luck in Apophyll."GRUNT: Uh, boss?")It looks like one of them escaped..."???: So it would seem."Stand aside."!I will deal with him myself."!I will deal with her myself.""I will deal with them myself."*zeL: Um, I know you didn't ask, but--"PIf you want my opinion, ah, you really probably shouldn't have come here..."R???: When we first met below the stairway, I assumed it was mere coincidence."KI understand that our meetings are not due to any semblance of chance."They are a pattern:"A pattern of disrespect."0I do not take kindly to being disrespected."FYou are fool enough to meddle in affairs well beyond your mettle,"qBut I will congratulate you and that Gym Leader both for having the strength to cut through my subordinates."SAs one final act of compassion, I will show you what you have fought to reach."Step forward."Z???: I am told you are already intimately acquainted with our most recent PULSE line."'PULSE Muk was our prior invention.",The work of the one beside me, in fact."zEl: ..."T???: Traditional pollutants would never have contaminated Azurine Lake as such."+A more forceful solution was required."TA toxin strong enough to chase humans away from an increasingly tainted land..."@Yet, it is designed to fall away the moment they have left."Nature always wins."+Sometimes it just needs a little help."And yet, this Muk..."gIt does not take a medical expert to understand, even at a glance, the extent to which it suffers."{Who knew that even a creature whose body was already little more than a pile of filth could deteriorat