o why don't you take one more just to be safe?"LETTIE: Good luck!"@I can't wait until the next class. Kiki is a great teacher!"*Who's going to teach the classes now?""And run the morning routines?"And the season festivals?"~And schedule the classes and write the books and order the courtyard and guide the students and and and and and and and--"...It's not fair."ZThis building is a perfect retreat in between long hikes. I couldn't live without it!"KSome people are saying that this place won't be the same without Kiki."Well, it won't."9But it's still going to be marvelous, as her legacy."GApophyll Academy is like an oasis in the desert of Reborn's chaos."bIt's like a protective aura keeps all the problems of the outside world away from this place."PI'm studying an old lecture: "The Value of Loss and the Danger of Victory"."Want to review with me?"�"For Trainers, many emotions can be attached to the outcome of a battle: Joy, disappointment, excitement, relief, embarrassment..."JTruly, the tumult of combat is a sculpted roller-coaster of emotions."VHowever, in that chaos, many people lose sight of what it is that really matters."IThe moment a battle concludes, it ceases to be meaningful in itself."=For combat itself, what is important is the coming wars."YAs such, the purposes of the previous fight's result are often distorted by emotion."OTo win many fights may be exciting, but it also spells the impending loss.".On the other hand, to lose is a blessing.".A loss becomes an opportunity for growth."mAnd of course, personal growth will propel you further and higher into life than you could ever imagine."-Remember, always learn from your losses."NIf you are able to do so, then you have secured an even greater victory.""3I must sharpen my mind to sharpen my strength."9"Balance of the Mind and Body". Come, learn with me!"8"The body and the mind are two very powerful tools."fYet, so often do many people focus so much on one or the other, they neglect to keep the balance."WRemember that everything in the internal world is reflected on the external world."DTo lose balance within yourself is to lose the balance of life.";The mind and the body are two halves of the same coin.";They must work together, and be strengthened together."]Too often do people flip the coin hoping that it may land on the side of their choosing."(However, this is a needless gamble."vWhen you strengthen both the body and mind, no matter which side the coin may land on, you will still be strong.""EI'm not sure if any book can be as interesting as TV these days."|Hello, stranger whom I have never met before and most certainly did not secretly conspire with to gain control of a TV."OHow are you doing on this day as I am meeting you for the very first time?"(Howdy, traveler! Need any supplies?"Yes"No[d"1Bienvenue! Voulez-vous soigner vos Pokémon?"+Ok, je prends vos Pokémon un instant."EIl semblerait que l'un de vos Pokémon ait attrapé le Pokérus."�Le Pokérus est encore trop méconnu, à part que ce sont des formes de vie microscopiques qui passent d'un Pokémon à l'autre."UQuand ils sont infectés, les Pokémon se développent beaucoup plus rapidement!"0Tenez. Nous espérons vous revoir bientôt!")Nous espérons vous revoir bientôt!"5Tout d'abord, vous devriez soigner vos Pokémon."1Vos Pokémon sont en super forme maintenant."&À une prochaine fois peut-être!"..."Prendre la télé?"0FILLE: Hé! Non mais qu'est-ce que tu fais?"?C'est la télé de la communauté. Tu peux pas la prendre!""Je ne te laisserai pas faire!".Noon!! Ma précieuse télé m'échappe..."EFILLE: Noon! Qu'est-ce que je vais faire si tu piques la télé?"BOSSER?!"Pourquoi tu me fais ça?!"IHein? Une autre fille t'a demandé de la lui amener dans sa chambre?"'Ça ressemble à ma colocataire..."E...Ce qui signifie que cette télé irait aussi dans MA chambre."#FILLE: On ne s'est jamais vus."On s'est jamais battus."T'es jamais venu ici."$Prends la télé et file! Vite!"DCe bâtiment n'est-il pas charmant? Amina s'occupe de 