nergy if you do not strike a target. What happens to it?"GIn answer, the energy still transfers even if no target is struck."XThe very action of punching itself carries a force which is understood universally."~Even if you do not punch someone so much as punch at them, some part of them will still feel the impact of the punch's energy."nIt may not manifest as physical pain or damage, but the energy will continue to flow, as always it does."";Okay, I need to get better at this: "How to Meditate"."$Do you wanna be my study buddy?"E"Meditation is simply the art of clearing your head of thoughts."OAlthough this sounds simple, it can be very difficult for the unpracticed."�To begin, play calming music, or find a quiet place, or place with some other natural rhythm (for instance, the rhythm of waves dancing on the beach)."=Find a comfortable seated position, and close your eyes."%Then simply think about nothing."dWhen you first try this, you will quickly realize how difficult it is for you to stop thinking."IThoughts will drift in and out despite your efforts. This is normal."_But each time you find yourself thinking again, force yourself to return to a blank slate."hFor beginners, it is also sometimes helpful to instead think only about the rhythm of one's breath."|Continue in this way to practice clearing your head and keeping it free of distraction for as long as you wish to meditate."",There's a guy who's come here recently."Pretty odd fellow."<He's quiet and keeps to himself, but really stands out."DI know he attends every lecture, but I've never seen him fight."-I think he went to train at the volcano?"&Victoria's been gone for a while."What's with her?"1...Unless it's something to do with him. Hm~"*Kiki gave her life to save all of us?"6...Let's make good use of our time and work hard."Have you met Cal?"&He's kinda weird, but kinda cool."#And by that I mean, kinda hot.")Oh, don't tell Victoria I said that!"'It feels really lonely here now..."�This is the main lecture hall, but we do a lot of classes outside, too. By the water, or on Pyrous Mountain, or in the Training Grounds.".It's like there's a field trip every day!"Is Kiki really gone?"!I mean, she can't be, right?"=She'll come back with some super-zen-ish power, somehow!"ALike, "One must transcend life in order to transcend death!""2That sounds like something she'd say, right?!"ZI mainly come here to hike, but I'd never miss a chance to listen to Kiki's lectures.""She's like a sage, that girl."AI didn't know her that well, but even I'm going to miss her."6This is Kiki's room. But she's out at the moment." Oh, you're looking for her?"FHm, well, she went down to teach a class in the Training Grounds."<You could probably try and catch her after the lecture."AThey're basically right out the front door; can't miss them."=Kiki went down to teach a class in the Training Grounds.":VICTORIA: Azurine Island is just a skip east of here."!You took a boat here, right?"+You should be able to reach it easily.":Whatever Team Meteor is up to, we've gotta stop them."7I'll keep everything steady here while you're out."AKiki is currently resting and has asked not to be disturbed.">Victoria just ran out of here though; didn't you see her?"(Kiki is currently amidst a lecture."*I cannot allow you to enter this way.":Please enter through the front to attend her lecture."VICTORIA: Deep breaths..."..."6\PN, I apologize to you on behalf of the academy."You've been wronged.",I've never seen her fall apart so fast."'All of this is... a lot of firsts."???: Victoria!"There's news."/VICTORIA: I'm kind of over news right now."ILETTIE: A couple of the students were hiking out at Azurine Island--"8Apparently there's some suspicious folk over there?">Like full black suit and heavy machinery type suspicious?"VICTORIA: That'll be it."Thanks, Lettie."/If anything else comes up, bring it to me."-Kiki is going to be resting for a while."$LETTIE: You got it, girlfriend!"#VICTORIA: I have to stay here."TThis school needs at least one person who can be honest and keep things moving."0And, although I'm furious at her right now,"So does Kiki."%Can you check on Azurine Island?"_If anything else happens, or if that Machine turns up, I'll let you know as soon as I can."7No one seems to be picking up at the Grand Hall..."AME: \PN?"3Hey there! So I see you've made it to the Gym."�This telecom system connects right to the Grand Hall, so no matter where you are, whenever you get to a Gym, you can call in for advice!"Anyway..."5AME: Oh, you're coming in from Apophyll Academy?">...It's true that that used to be a Gym, but not anymore."CKiki was forced to retire due to some ongoing health concerns."BAre you sure the stress of battling won't be too much on her?"C...Well, I suppose I can give you her old notes, just in case."eThanks to her school's focus on meditation, the mental energy around there is out of this world!"qWhen she uses Meditate, her Pokémon will be much, much stronger than normal, so don't give her that chance!"uBy the way, for beating the Fighting-type, although many people go for Flying-types, that could be a risky play."�With all the sand and ash down there, it's easy for it to get kicked up and vision to be lost. But Kiki's mentally focused Pokémon will often still land attacks!"xRather than Flying-types, try using the mental energy against her! Psychic-types can really do a number down there!"!Good luck, whatever happens."EI've been looking forward to coming here for so long, and yet..."nMany of the older students here say it's not what it used to be-- but it's still everything I'd imagined."CAL: \PN."CAL: I'm glad you're here."YThe truth is, I was the one who passed the report of this going on to the Nightclub."8I probably could've done a lot to stop this, but..."...Well, how is she?"1This was another Anomaly's doing, of course."?You just defeated it, and our star actor ran through here."*It's currently hiding in Kiki's room."8A Pokémon that can steal the feelings of others...".You can probably guess what it is, right?"RWith how much pressure she was putting on herself, when I found that thing..."DIt was willing to help, and I thought it might just do the job."(Show her that she's enough herself."8She doesn't have to keep trying to be someone else."1...It could've been a little nicer about it."Sorry about that."NI'll go patch things up with Victoria. Make sure she's on the right path."&The Pokémon is all yours though."BBest clean it up before she tries to punch it or something..."PSorry for springing this on you but your help is, as always, irreplaceable."'VICTORIA: Oh, you're done already?"#I was just... coming to check."JI can't say I'm really happy about Cal setting this whole thing up..."But it's over now."VThe students have dispersed, and no one seems to really remember what happened..."!...Which is just fine by me."<If you happened to forget it too, I can't say I'd mind."But... he was right."?Maybe I did need to acknowledge that part of myself still."*Maybe it was... a little bit helpful."(Even if he's stupid and I hate him."I don't hate him."1But I am mad at him, so don't tell him that!"�If I'm acknowledging my feelings, he can acknowledge that he really needs to stop going behind people's backs, even if it IS for the greater good or whatever!"%...Anyway, thanks for your help."=I'm going to... take some time and keep processing this."%I don't need to do it like Kiki.""I just need to do it like me."That would be enough."\'Ey kid! You want me to teach your Pokémon some special moves? Take a look what I got!"What suits your fancy?"6Gastro Acid is gonna run you a single Blue Shard.""Come back when you've got it."Perfect."0Recycle is gonna run you two Purple Shards."2Endeavor is gonna run you three Green Shards."2Pain Split is gonna run you three Red Shards."Any time, kid."Did you know?"kThe best place to train your Defense is by striking the Magcargo that bar Pyrous Mountain's lava flow!"Haaaaaah!"Yes"No"Gastro Acid"Recycle"Endeavor"Pain Split[�"IHm... "Une Brève Histoire de l'Énergie". Ça a l'air intéressant."\"L'énergie existe sous bien des formes, mais est rarement comprise à sa juste valeur."�Une forme d'énergie qui est souvent oubliée est qu'elle existe non en tant que pouvoir ou potentiel, mais en tant qu'esprit de l'être."TQuand vous serrez le poing et que vous frappez, il y a un transfert d'énergie."/L'énergie circule à travers votre corps."]Quand vous frappez votre cible, l'énergie y est transférée et lui cause des dommages." C'est une notion répandue."^Mais dans le cas où la cible n'est pas touchée, qu'arrive-t-il au transfert d'énergie?"KLa réponse est que le transfert d'énergie est quand même effectué."RLe coup de poing en lui-même est une force qui est universellement comprise."{Même si votre poing ne touche pas directement la personne, l'adversaire va quand même ressentir l'impact de son énergie."�Cela ne se traduira pas par des dommages physiques ou de la souffrance, mais l'énergie va continuer à circuler, comme elle le fait toujours.""8Ok, je dois m'améliorer sur ça: "La Méditation"."Tu veux réviser avec moi?"P"La méditation est simplement l'art de chasser les pensées de son esprit."\Même si cela paraît très simple, les néophytes peuvent vite avoir des difficultés."�Pour commencer, mettez de la musique douce, ou trouvez un endroit tranquille, ou un endroit avec un rythme naturel, par exemple le rythme des vagues sur la plage."ATrouvez une position assise confortable, et fermez les yeux.",Après, pensez tout simplement à rien."|Quand vous essayez pour la première, vous allez vite vous rendre compte à quel point c'est difficile d'arrêter de penser."OVos pensées vont surgir et dériver malgré vos efforts. Et c'est normal."nAlors à chaque fois que vous penserez à quelque chose, forcez-vous à retourner dans cet état de vide."ZPour les débutants, c'est parfois plus facile de penser au rythme de sa respiration."�Continuez sur cette voie pour vous entraîner à faire le vide dans votre tête et à chasser toute distraction aussi longtemps que vous souhaitez méditer.""0Il y a un type qui est venu ici récemment."Un drôle de bonhomme."IIl est calme et ne parle à personne, mais il dégage quelque chose."OJe sais qu'il assiste à tous les cours, mais je l'ai jamais vu combattre.":Je pense qu'il est allé s'entraîner dans le volcan."0Ça fait longtemps que Victoria est partie."Qu'est-ce qu'elle a?"/...Il y a peut-être un lien avec lui. Hm~"1Amina a donné sa vie pour nous sauver tous?"@...Profitons de notre vie pour accomplir de grandes choses."Tu as rencontré Cal?"6Il est plutôt bizarre, mais il est plutôt cool."Il est pas mal, quoi!",Oh, et ne répète pas ça à Victoria!"+C'est vraiment calme ici maintenant..."�C'est l'amphithéâtre principal, mais on fait aussi beaucoup de cours en extérieur. Dans l'eau, sur le Mont Pyros ou sur le Terrain d'Entraînement!".C'est un voyage initiaque tous les jours!"$Amina nous a vraiment quittés?"!Enfin, c'est pas vrai, hein?"IElle reviendra avec ses pouvoirs zen, d'une manière ou d'une autre!":Genre, "Transcender la vie pour transcender la mort!""2C'est le genre de truc qu'elle dirait, hein?!"cJe viens ici pour faire de l'escalade, mais je ne raterai un cours d'Amina pour rien au monde."*Elle est comme une sage, cette fille."KJe ne la connaissais pas si bien, mais elle va quand même me manquer."AC'est la demeure d'Amina. Mais elle est dehors en ce moment."Oh, tu la cherches?"NHum, elle est sortie pour donner un cours sur le Terrain d'Entraînement."=Tu pourras sûrement avoir une audience après le cours."QC'est tout droit en sortant de l'entrée principale. Tu peux pas te tromper."JAmina est sortie pour donner un cours sur le Terrain d'Entraînement."7VICTORIA: L'Île Azurine est juste à l'est d'ici.")Tu as pris un bateau jusqu'ici, non?",Tu devrais l'atteindre sans problèmes."?Quoi que mijote la Team Meteor, il faut qu'on les arrête."EJe garde les chose sous contrôle ici 