ddy?"E"Meditation is simply the art of clearing your head of thoughts."OAlthough this sounds simple, it can be very difficult for the unpracticed."�To begin, play calming music, or find a quiet place, or place with some other natural rhythm (for instance, the rhythm of waves dancing on the beach)."=Find a comfortable seated position, and close your eyes."%Then simply think about nothing."dWhen you first try this, you will quickly realize how difficult it is for you to stop thinking."IThoughts will drift in and out despite your efforts. This is normal."_But each time you find yourself thinking again, force yourself to return to a blank slate."hFor beginners, it is also sometimes helpful to instead think only about the rhythm of one's breath."|Continue in this way to practice clearing your head and keeping it free of distraction for as long as you wish to meditate."",There's a guy who's come here recently."Pretty odd fellow."<He's quiet and keeps to himself, but really stands out."DI know he attends every lecture, but I've never seen him fight."-I think he went to train at the volcano?"&Victoria's been gone for a while."What's with her?"1...Unless it's something to do with him. Hm~"*Kiki gave her life to save all of us?"6...Let's make good use of our time and work hard."Have you met Cal?"&He's kinda weird, but kinda cool."#And by that I mean, kinda hot.")Oh, don't tell Victoria I said that!"'It feels really lonely here now..."�This is the main lecture hall, but we do a lot of classes outside, too. By the water, or on Pyrous Mountain, or in the Training Grounds.".It's like there's a field trip every day!"Is Kiki really gone?"!I mean, she can't be, right?"=She'll come back with some super-zen-ish power, somehow!"ALike, "One must transcend life in order to transcend death!""2That sounds like something she'd say, right?!"ZI mainly come here to hike, but I'd never miss a chance to listen to Kiki's lectures.""She's like a sage, that girl."AI didn't know her that well, but even I'm going to miss her."6This is Kiki's room. But she's out at the moment." Oh, you're looking for her?"FHm, well, she went down to teach a class in the Training Grounds."<You could probably try and catch her after the lecture."AThey're basically right out the front door; can't miss them."=Kiki went down to teach a class in the Training Grounds.":VICTORIA: Azurine Island is just a skip east of here."!You took a boat here, right?"+You should be able to reach it easily.":Whatever Team Meteor is up to, we've gotta stop them."7I'll keep everything steady here while you're out."AKiki is currently resting and has asked not to be disturbed.">Victoria just ran out of here though; didn't you see her?"(Kiki is currently amidst a lecture."*I cannot allow you to enter this way.":Please enter through the front to attend her lecture."VICTORIA: Deep breaths..."..."6\PN, I apologize to you on behalf of the academy."You've been wronged.",I've never seen her fall apart so fast."'All of this is... a lot of firsts."???: Victoria!"There's news."/VICTORIA: I'm kind of over news right now."ILETTIE: A couple of the students were hiking out at Azurine Island--"8Apparently there's some suspicious folk over there?">Like full black suit and heavy machinery type suspicious?"VICTORIA: That'll be it."Thanks, Lettie."/If anything else comes up, bring it to me."-Kiki is going to be resting for a while."$LETTIE: You got it, girlfriend!"#VICTORIA: I have to stay here."TThis school needs at least one person who can be honest and keep things moving."0And, although I'm furious at her right now,"So does Kiki."%Can you check on Azurine Island?"_If anything else happens, or if that Machine turns up, I'll let you know as soon as I can."7No one seems to be picking up at the Grand Hall..."AME: \PN?"3Hey there! So I see you've made it to the Gym."�This telecom system connects right to the Grand Hall, so no matter where you are, whenever you get to a Gym, you can call in for advice!"Anyway.