his."LLook at everything you've done, all the people you've made happy, and--">KIKI: And for as strong as I've been, I'm still too weak." VICTORIA: Please calm down."KIKI: How can I?""Defeat the inner chaos?""<Did you think I was only talking about zen of the mind?"HI could be centered to dead-zero and I will still end up just that."_No amount of meditation is going to change the simple fact that my body is killing itself!"VICTORIA: That's enough!"CYou know what hurts even more than seeing this happen to you?!"$Watching you do it to yourself!"2Sometimes people get sick-- big fucking deal!"JEven then, they get through it with the people near and dear to them."�What they DON'T do is lie to everyone around them and go on pretending that everything is fine and dandy when it's clearly anything but!"hYou've put all this pressure on yourself to try and maintain perfect appearances and outward peace,"EBut really you're tearing yourself up inside as much as anyone!?"LDon't you see the irony you've committed yourself to being a victim of?"%KIKI: Of course, you're correct.".I am keenly aware of the folly of it all."XAnd despite my lectures, my practice, and my teaching, I've been unable to stop it."7That, too, has been a great source of shame to me."aHow can I advocate for mental and spiritual health when I can't even maintain it for myself?"QI have felt I was a sham for so long that lying about this was only natural."VICTORIA: Then come clean."ZBe honest about it, and we can all start figuring out how to get through it together."?Then there is one more matter I must be transparent about."VICTORIA: ...What?"KIKI: \PN." I cannot give you Strength."VICTORIA: What."BKIKI: The Machine went missing from my care not too long ago."I believe it was stolen.";VICTORIA: Then, all of these hoops about graduation..."*KIKI: The urgency has not escaped me."LI hoped I would be able to recover it before you completed these tasks."But, as you can imagine--"#VICTORIA: I can't believe you."KIKI: Victoria!"KIKI: Please leave me.""I wish to be alone right now."KIKI: I'm sorry."VICTORIA: So, that's it."Apophyll is safe,"And empty."-CAIN: Hey, we did everything we could..."EVICTORIA: Like that's some kind of justification or reassurance?"=We did everything we could-- and it still wasn't enough!"pLuckily we can take comfort in knowing it wasn't our negligence that ended her life, just our incompetence."*But maybe it was the first thing too.")I was the one who brought Cal here--"*I should've known he was one of them!"$CAIN: How could you have known?"eVICTORIA: Oh, I don't know, maybe a hair-trigger temper might have been something of a red flag."I was stupid."5CAIN: Hey, blaming yourself isn't going to help."VICTORIA: ..."
