t reviens vers moi quand tu auras fini!"ZAMÉ: Adrienn, Victoria et DJ Arclight sont occupés à différentes choses en ville."0AMÉ: Arclight nous rejoint là-bas, alors?"-S'il se fait discret, ça devrait aller."(VICTORIA: Désolée pour l'attente!"BAMÉ: Arclight nous rejoint après, mais il sait déjà tout."#VICTORIA: Il y a un problème?"AMÉ: Voilà le topo."{Nous avons été informés par une source anonyme que la Team Meteor avait toujours une base en ville, juste sous nos yeux."ADRIENN: Devon?"VICTORIA: Devon?"AMÉ: Devon."Comment vous avez deviné?"BADRIENN: Pour ma part, c'est le seul endroit logique restant."�J'ai visité de fond en comble tout le reste de la ville, mais Devon SARL est le seul endroit qui n'a pas voulu laisser des ouvriers travailler aux alentours."iVICTORIA: Même la devanture a l'air veillotte, et c'est censé être une entreprise internationale."�ADRIENN: Haribonbon a beaucoup investi dans la restauration, et même la Sylphe SARL a été assez généreuse pour donner des fonds."GDevon refuse toujours à ce jour et ça commence à être suspect."?AMÉ: Oui, et maintenant, ce n'est plus seulement suspect."dJ'ai pris la liberté d'appeler M. Rochard pour un partenariat avec la branche Reborn de Devon."FÉvidemment, il m'a répondu qu'une telle branche n'existait pas."GVICTORIA: Alors c'est acté! On peut les faire tomber pour de bon!"1AMÉ: Avant ça, il y a une dernière chose."{Nous avons également été informés que le membre le plus haut placé de la Team Meteor y était en ce moment-même."VICTORIA: Solaris..."Je ne me retiendrai pas!"!AMÉ: Non. Il s'agit de Lin."YD'après ce que Saphira m'a raconté, nous ne pouvons courir aucun risque avec elle."1C'est pour ça que j'ai besoin de vous tous.".Et c'est pour ça que je viens avec vous."?ADRIENN: Oh? Je pensais que tu voulais rester en arrière?"5AMÉ: C'est vrai qu'Anna m'avait demandé ça..."2AMÉ: Et c'était mon intention au départ...""Mais au vu des circonstances,")Si nous pouvons en finir maintenant," Je ferai tout mon possible."eEn plus, en tant que Maître de la Ligue, je ne peux pas rester les bras croisés, n'est-ce pas?"&Désolée, \PN, tu ne savais pas?"ICe n'est pas quelque chose que je dis comme ça ou dont je me vante."kMais j'ai bien relancé cette Ligue, et il fallait bien quelqu'un pour tester les Champions en combat.""Enfin, ce n'est pas le sujet."0Nous devons nous concentrer sur Devon SARL."AArclight connaît déjà les détails, alors voilà le plan."aLe rez-de-chaussée est probablement bien sécurisé, même s'ils ne veulent pas le montrer."Alors, nous allons les prendre en tenaille avec un groupe à l'entrée et un autre depuis le sous-sol avec l'entrée du Métro."IOn se retrouvera à mi-chemin, et on attaquera les étages ensemble."Des questions?"/ADRIENN: Comment décide-t-on des groupes?".AMÉ: Toi et moi, on passe par l'entrée."[On dira qu'on est là pour la rénovation de la ville pour ne pas attirer l'attention."9\PN, Victoria et Arclight passeront par le sous-sol."@ADRIENN: Tous ensemble, ils n'auront pas la moindre chance!"gVICTORIA: Je vais montrer à la Team Meteor la même clémence que celle qu'ils ont eu pour Amina."!AMÉ: Alors, c'est décidé."Ne perdons pas de temps!"@Il y a des férus de combats qui traînent ici, d'habitude."KUn différent chaque jour de la semaine, et un peu plus les week-ends.".Tu peux les combattre autant que tu veux."^Mais on leur demande de débarrasser le plancher quand de nouveaux Dresseurs débarquent."�On ne voudrait pas qu'un gosse de 10 ans un peu tête brûlée se jette avec son starter niveau 5 sur le premier type qu'il voit et se fasse rétamer."QMais ces dresseurs à combat libre seront de retour bientôt, t'en fais pas."Q...As-tu oublié ce que je t'ai expliqué sur les dresseurs à combat libre?"<Ou est-ce que tu me parles pour que je les fasse venir?""Eh bien... Je peux faire ça."PLeurs équipes sont un peu au-dessus du niveau 10, ce n'est pas trop mal..."'Veux-tu que je leur dise de venir?"...D'accord. Si tu le dis."IMaisil ne faudra pas venir se plaindre après, on est bien d'accord?"Ok. Attends un peu."Oui, je comprends."KUn peu de patience. Ils se montreront quand tu atteindras leur niveau."Oh."FYou must be wondering what happened to the rebattleable Trainers."That's fair."-They all perished in the version update."Terrible incident, really."JIt's okay though, let me just use some necromancy to bring them back."Au revoir."TJeune Dresseur, je doit te dire de rester loin des ruelles sombres de la ville."CBeaucoup trop de nos jeunes se sont retrouvés dans des gangs."/Alors, sois raisonnable et reste intègre!">Nous pouvons redonner à cette ville sa grandeur d'antan!"Jeune Dresseur!"BEst-ce que tu participes au Projet de Restauration de Reborn?"DBeaucoup a été fait, c'est vrai, mais il reste tant à faire!"<Demande aux habitants de la ville si tu peux les aider!"4Hi! You have the pulse dex and field notes now."De rien."*Le PNJ va maintenant s'autodétruire."Doucement."k bai~"JHé, viens voir par là! Je peux te demander un petit truc vite fait?"&\PN ramasse le paquet d'Aromates!"1Oh? On dirait que tu t'en sors plutôt bien!"7Mais est-ce que ton équipe te satisfait vraiment?"HBeaucoup de Dresseurs élèvent de nombreux Pokémon, plus que six!"AAinsi, ils adaptent leur équipe en fonction des situations."$Ne néglige jamais tes options."�J'ai entendu que les Pokémon Chromatiques apparaissent bien plus fréquemment qu'ailleurs, et ils n'ont pas la même teinte que les autres Chromatiques."7Qui veut parier que c'est à cause des radiations?"XADRIENN: Pendant qu'on attend les autres, il y a quelque chose que je me demandais."TAprès avoir disparu si longtemps, pourquoi tu n'as pas trouvé de remplaçant?"vJe me doute que si la Ligue étais toujours d'actualité, tu aurais eu besoin d'un nouveau Champion de Type Fée."AMÉ: Hum, à vrai dire..."J'avais trouvé quelqu'un."WADRIENN: Oh? J'aimerais bien rencontrer ce nouveau-- ou plutôt ancien-- Champion!"AMÉ: Oui, à ce propos..."\Personne ne l'a vu ou a entendu parler de lui depuis les évenements du Quartier Jaspe."2C'est presque certain qu'il n'a pas survécu."GEt tu es réapparu avant je ne finisse d'arranger un remplacement."Bon timing, d'ailleurs."?ADRIENN: Ah, c'est un peu cocasse de t'avoir demandé ça.";ADRIENN: Les autres devraient être là bientôt, non?">LYKOS: Oh, tu as enfin battu tous les Champions d'Arène?"Félicitations!"2Est-ce que c'est l'heure de la Célébration?"9LYKOS: J'espère que tu passeras une bonne journée!"'AMÉ: Ah, vous êtes là. Parfait."ONous n'avons pas encore de suspect, mais les policiers râtissent la zone."3VICTORIA: Suspect? Pour l'attentat à la gare?"IAMÉ: Oui. Si le coupable est dans les environs, nous le trouverons."`Mais en attendant, il faudra restreindre et contrôler le passage d'un quartier à l'autre."WEnfin, les nouveaux dresseurs n'ont pas à se soucier de tout ça; on s'en occupe." Finissons vos inscriptions."?Et bien sûr, il vous faut choisir un Pokémon de départ."BVICTORIA: \PN peut passer en premier, ça ne me dérange pas."AMÉ: Par ici, alors."1Ooh, chouette! Un autre combat contre nous~?"Allons-y, mon chéri!"Oooooh."Hé, t'as un problème?"ZMeeeeec, avec la bande, on traînait tout le temps ici quand on jouait dans les rues."YMais mes potes sont partis dans leur délire "d'améliorer la ville" et sont partis."Fais chier, putain."8Je vais me débrouiller tout seul ici s'il le faut."cNous sommes toujours en train de terminer la réparation du Mur Béryl, ce sera pour bientôt!"ILes dons et les reconstruction seront relancés très prochainement."iNous apprécions grandement votre aide à la ville de Reborn, nous espérons vous revoir très vite!"\Bonjour! Je collecte les dons pour les projets de restauration pour la ville de Reborn."<Souhaitez-vous donner à un de nos projets aujourd'hui?"pourquoi t'es là, mdr."MPas de soucis. Nous espérons que vous changerez d'avis ultérieurement!"b\GPour le développement d'Obsidienne Sud, le coût restant des réparations est de \v[334]$."#Combien souhaitez-vous donner?"Cela financera le projet!"�Je vais faire savoir aux concernés que les financements du projet sont atteints, et nous allons poser la première pierre dès que possible!"J'ai hâte!"bMerci infiniment, la ville de Reborn sera un endroit meilleure grâce à votre générosité!"	Hum."lNous apprécions votre générosité pour aider la ville, mais vous ne semblez pas détenir cet argent."[\GPour la Reconstruction du Métro, le coût restant des réparations est de \v[335]$."MPas de soucis. Nous espérons que vous changerez d'avis ultérieurement!"g\GPour la Réserve Naturelle de l'Île Azurine, le coût restant des réparations est de \v[336]$."�Par ailleurs, comme vous êtes l'investisseur principal pour au moins un projet, nous vous adressons nos remerciements les plus chaleureux!"�Nous vous invitons également à rencontrer le personnel qui a travaillé si dur avec votre argent pour rendre cette ville plus attractive!"Les bureaux du personnel sont dans le sous-sol juste par ici. Et en tant qu'investisseur principal, vous y aurez l'accès."TTout ce que nous demandons est le strict respect des employés travaillant ici."JMerci à vous encore d'avoir toujours veillé sur la ville de Reborn!"dNous sommes toujours en train terminer les projets précédents, nous vous tiendrons informés!"KMerci pour vos dons généreux et ininterrompus à la ville de Reborn!"NNotre prochain projet, le Quartier Byxbysion, prendra bien plus de temps."�Nous sommes toujours en phase de programmation pendant nous dégageons tous les déchets. Cela prendra beaucoup de temps avant que nous passions à la phase suivante."�Même si je ne peux pas vous promettre que le projet naîtra bientôt, j'espère que vous travaillerez de nouveau avec nous pour rendre la ville encore plus belle et attractive!"PBien sûr, je reconnais que vous avez été indispensable pour nos projets."XEn tant que remercient 'supplémentaire', pourquoi ne prenez-vous pas cette pierre?"Elle appartenait à Ame--"CEt, eh bien... Je pense qu'elle aurait voulu que vous l'aviez."Alors, s'il vous plaît."oJ'espère que vous travaillerez de nouveau avec nous pour rendre la ville encore plus belle et attractive!":Ah, c'est toi qui a beaucoup investi dans la ville..."!Oh, tu es \PN, n'est-ce pas?"..."sVu les circonstances, Adrienn avais demandé à ce que tu aies l'accès aux zones des employés du Grand Hall."$Nos excuses pour le malentendu!"IEn dessous, tu trouveras la zone des employés. Vas-y quand tu veux!"�C'est un avertissement pour tous les Dresseurs. Évitez de descendre les cascades de la région sans un permis d'utilisation de la CS!"nBeaucoup de cascades sont très grandes et les remonter sans la capacité peut s'avérer très dangereux!"La santé avant tout!"3Restez prudent tant que vous n'avez pas la CS!"7Contactez le personnel municipal en cas de besoin!"Merci!"Citoyens, bonjour!"dLe Projet de Restauration de la Ville avance bon train, mais il reste encore beaucoup à faire!"�Si vous souhaitez proposer voter aide, veuillez contacter une personne de l'administration pour que nous vous assignons à un manager de projet."Oui"Non"$Logements sociaux à Obsidienne"Reconstruction du Métro""Réserve Naturelle à Azurine"Une autre fois;[�">CAIN: Heyy, Ame is waiting for you guys when you're done!"4I'm all set, so I'm gonna hit the road. See ya~"3VICTORIA: Oh? Was there more to do? Let's see.",VICTORIA: Sorry if we kept you waiting!"\AME: No worries. I already took care of the documentation while you two were finishing."3So, then all that's left is to give you these:"2Firstly, a Pokédex. You know the drill here."\PN received a Pokédex!"!You already have a Pokédex.""AME: Secondly, the Pokégear."XThis device allows you to check the map, listen to music, and use online functions." \PN received the Pokégear!"ZAME: Finally, as a promotional bonus from Silph Co., please take these Running Shoes.":As much as I hate advertising, they are convenient..."XWith these, you can hold the Space Bar, or toggle the auto-run in the Options Menu."5And don't worry, nobody cares if you run inside."$\PN received the Running Shoes!"$AME: With that, you're all set!"SI've got more damage control to run, so I'm afraid I have to leave you be now."2VICTORIA: We'll be fine! Thanks for the help!"AME: Good luck out there."�And maybe send a tip to your local officer if you happen to see anyone who looks like they might want to blow up a train station."Julia doesn't count."Until next time!"@VICTORIA: All right, I'll get going and check in with Kiki."&Oh, who's Kiki? She's my teacher!"JI'm an apprentice at Apophyll Academy, across the lake from the city."EIf you're ever in the area, I'm sure they'd love you to drop by."4Anyway, here! These might help you get started." \PN received 5 Poké Balls!"OVICTORIA: I know a lot of people say that Pokémon are rare in the city..."!But you can find them still."DSometimes they like to stay hidden, but just look around a bit!"I'm sure you'll manage."$For now, just explore the city!"I'll see you around!"/Care for a battle? Talk to the lady if so."zHello there! I'm here to answer any questions you might have about the future of the Reborn City Restoration Project!"5We've come a long way in a short period of time."OFor this, we are endlessly thankful for the help of all of our volunteers!"ZThat said, there's still much to do! Would you like to hear about our upcoming plans?"LHere's some of the things we'll be looking at doing in the near future!"DWe have several potential short-term projects awaiting funding."{First, we have some final renovations to finish up on Beryl Wall. Then, we can finally prepare to reopen Grandview Station!"PAfter that, we have several potential short-term projects awaiting funding."HWe'd like to focus on rebuilding the slums area from the ground up."�Our plan is to convert this area into a low-income housing district and resource center with community gardening and job-finding resources."sSecond, we'll look at reinforcing underground structures and rebuilding an efficient inter-city subway system."�Finally, we'll be restarting the Reborn Pokémon Reintroduction Project with a brand-new fully furnished facility on Azurine Island."aIf you wish to donate to the city restoration, please talk to the construction manager here."6We are ecstatic to receive any amount of support."IThank you very much for generously supporting us through everything!"*Of course, there's always more to do!"wWe're now beginning a long-term project to purify the Byxbysion Wasteland, and restart efforts to expand the city."RWe hope to be developing the new Byxbysion Ward within the next couple years!"SAround this time we also hope to reestablish rail access with the Orre Region."<All of this could not be possible without your support.".From myself and all of Reborn, thank you."Did you know?"EThe best way to train your HP stat is by fishing in dirty water!"MThe best way to train your HP stat is by surfing in a hidden hot spring!"Not sure where to head?"BI hear there's a rendezvous happening around Labradorra City!"(Agate City will be the place to be!"You're nearly to the top!"^According to your current records... your next Gym Battle will be with Miss Amaria Fiore!"PHer Gym is up at the top of the Celestinine Cascade. Surely you've seen it?"~I hear Adrienn has granted you personal free access to the Tourmaline Desert. It would be a shame to pass that opportunity up!"WWhy not take a look around the other wards and explore how everything has changed?"xSince Agate City is currently out of commission, next up you should face the Agate Ace Triumvirate at Agate Circus!"wYour next Gym Leader? Hm... It seems she has indicated she'll battle in the Iolia Valley in the Aventurine Region."SThe next closest Gym is located in the Aventurine Region- the Vanhanen Castle!"QThe next Gym Leader-- has fled his own assigned location. Where could he be?"EThe next closest Gym is in Spinel Town, in the Chrysolia Region!"MA new Gym has opened! Located in the Wasteland, be sure to check it out!"9Why not check out Apophyll Academy, across the lake?"3I hear it's a nice break away from everything!"gThe next Gym is across Beryl Bridge! However, it's usually locked. I wonder how to get it open...?"cYour next Gym will be found in the Lapis Ward! It's just north of here, and a bit to the west!"5Since the Northern Obsidia Ward is locked out..."@Why not take a detour up to the Beryl Ward, through Jasper?"PThe next closest Gym is in the Onyx Ward, accessible through South Obsidia."?The closest Gym is in the Peridot Ward, just west of here.":Trainer! Can I interest you in some delicious treats?"kCommon Candies are cheap and delicious-- never mind the side effect of lowering your Pokémons' level!"&Buy up! They're on sale now only!"Hello there!".I see you have the Field Effect Note app!"EPlease allow me to upgrade it with some recently recovered data!"+\PN obtained Field Effect Read-Out 09!")Info on Rainbow Field now available!"hIn order to research Field Effects more thoroughly, it's important to have all the help we can get."|By spreading the public version of our data, we're more likely to receive feedback and corrections for future versions!"!Thank you for using the app!";Why doesn't anywhere sell Great Balls?! It's not fair!"XI mean, the Obsidia Department Store does, but you need a lot of Stickers for that!"PMaybe I should just learn to use the specialty balls from Critical Capture."gShit, man. This stupid City Restoration Project went an' blasted the place I was using as shelter."AHow the fuck they gonna do that? Who the fuck they helpin'?!"|They think just cuz the damn roof's caving in and the walls got holes in 'em that that place ain't important to people?"JThey think we can afford their refurbished high-class estate housing?"Hell fuckin' nawh I can't!"kThey open up some full-on cheap-housing sector in Peridot, sayin' it's better quality than what I got."DI ain't about that bullshit! I want what I got! I want it back!"MSo Imma camp out here 'til I get my old lot back. We rebel in this shit."Howdy, champ."Having a rough time?"aIf you'd like your life to be a little easier in the future, I can let you in on a secret..."LNext time someone asks you for a password, try telling them "litemode"."cSpecifically, this'll just cut out all the extra stats from your opponents' IV and EV spreads."ZNothing too special, but you might be surprised the difference a few digits can make."+VICTORIA: Which one did you pick, \PN?"BOh, don't worry, I won't pick just to beat you; that's silly.",I already know which one I want anyway."Wait, you got Litten?"...Well, shoot."-That was the one I was going to get too."AME: That's not a problem."hWe're equipped to handle multiple new Trainers, so naturally we have replacements for each starter."uGiven the condition of Grandview Station, it's not like we'll be getting many new Trainers for a while anyway..."5I'll just get a Litten from the reserve for you." Let's go on ahead upstairs."AME: Well then, shall we?"+VICTORIA: Okay. Wait here for me, \PN?"???: Heyyy, you're cute."+What? Haha, no, I didn't say anything!"Hey, was Ame just here?"-Ohhhh, so she's with someone else. 'Kay~"%My name's Cain, how about yours?"\PN ... Pretty name."=So by the looks of it, you just got your first Pokémon."(Are you gonna challenge the League?"+I was just coming here to resi-- er..."To start over."3Figured I'd try taking on this League instead."*Sooo, \PN... whaddya say to a battle?"-If it's your first time, I'll be gentle~"Cute AND talented~"CAIN: Very nice!"4CAIN: Just got unlucky~ Don't take it too hard."%I mean, unless you're into that."-C'mon, let's get our Pokémon healed up."4There's a PokéCenter built in right over here."-Welcome! Allow me to heal your Pokémon!"/Your Pokémon may be infected by PokéRus."lLittle is known about the PokéRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon."BWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."+Here you go. We hope to see you again!"VICTORIA: There you are!"$CAIN: Sorry~ I kinda stole \PN."9AME: Oh, Cain... Right, I forgot you were coming by."HCAIN: It's okayyyy, when you were gone, I met \PN and had some fun~"VICTORIA: "Had some fun"?"+So that's the kind of person \PN is..."%CAIN: Nah, we just had a battle."'VICTORIA: Oh! That does sound fun!"*I wanna try out my new Pokémon, too.""\PN, are you up for one more?"YAME: Cain, I'll get you registered as a challenger while they do that. Come with me."CAIN: Ooh, yes, master~"AME: "Master"?"CAIN: Nothing~"AME: Uh... huh. Come on." VICTORIA: Then let's begin."�My sensei said that learning to work and train together with Pokémon would be an invaluable step on my journey of personal growth."0\PN, let's take these first steps together!"Oh, it's over already?"5VICTORIA: You're no ordinary Trainer, are you..."VICTORIA: Yay, I won!")There's no need to feel down though."2As Kiki said, every loss is a lesson learned."Come at me, bro."
Weak."=You wanna know something, buddy? I'll tell you a secret."_The lake water's too toxic to fish in, but my buddy's got this swimmin' pool in his house."yWhen the Pokémon in Azurine Lake started gettin' sick, he rescued a few of them and kept them in his swimming pool."3Now the place is practically like an aquarium!"BI heard there's a whole secret area under the Grand Stairway."But how could that be?"rMy buddy used to keep a private aquarium. He was super guarded about it, only letting certain people through."`But now that the water's clean again, he released all of those Pokémon back into the lake!"gWhat's more, I managed to convince him to turn his tank into a public pool! How sweet is that, eh?"MHuh? Did they just catch a ghost on camera at Beryl? I could've sworn..."mI heard there's a network of secret tunnels under the Byxbysion Wasteland. Doesn't that sound exciting?!"Yo, back off, punk."BVenturing outside the city is actually a nice change of pace."=Isn't it hard to keep track of stat stages all the time?"WBut you can press Control in battle to toggle a view of everyone's current stages!"Nifty, huh?"eThey say you're at your best in your youth, but I feel like I'm at my best now! Try me, young'n!"What a shame. Anyone?!"2REBORN POKÉMON REINTRODUCTION PROJECT (RPRP)"�In an effort to revitalize wildlife and natural surroundings, a large number of Pokémon have recently been imported into the region."sWe hope that they will successfully repopulate the region-- provided, of course, Trainers do not capture them."�The Reintroduction Project has been chugging onward, but without a proper functioning base of operations on Azurine Island, it's difficult to progress."FStill, the species levels are at least stable for the time being."xNow that a proper base of operations has been established in Azurine, the RPRP is reaching newer heights than ever."^However, I hear they've put out a request for a couple species they've struggled to find."~If you have some time to spare, please report to the Azurine Island Nature Center and ask what else they need for the project!",The RPRP has been doing splendidly now!"�It may be years before all of the new Pokémon we've supported appear in the wild, but their future in Reborn is all but ascertained, thanks to you!"Stand off, yo."hI've heard Silph Co. is working on a way to make Pokémon that evolve by trade use a Stone instead."!Technology is truly amazing!"eThe city has had to spend an unprecedented amount of money in order to patch everything back up."lTrue, the vast majority of the work was done by volunteers who, thanks to Adrienn, showed up in droves."@But resources cost money, and we are well into debt by now."]Although I think we could have been a bit more frugal in our spending, I have no qualms."�One of the best ways Reborn can make money is by investing in our tourist industry. In order to do that, our city must be beautiful."%And soon, it certainly shall be."5There's an old Abandoned Power Plant up north...">I hear kids disappear when it's windy, and show up there."Weird, right?"2So many strange things have been happening..."7I'm gonna rock, and you're gonna roll! Sound fair?"!Then you roll on outta here."3Welcome! Would you like to rest your Pokémon?"3OK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."kLittle is known about the PokéRus except that they are microscopic lifeforms that attach to Pokémon."We hope to see you again!"<First, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."6Your Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."We hope you excel!"1Hey there! You wanna check out... The TMNS?!"4You can't hide in your shell forever, you know!"YUnlike most other regions, the Reborn League has a total of 18 Leaders! Cool, right?""Or did you already know that?"YUnlike most other regions, the Reborn League has a total of 18 leaders! Cool, right?",Oh, you've already beaten most of them!"Well then."!Oh, you've already beaten..."...All of them?"7Oh, hi there, Champion! I didn't see you at first!".I'm just here for the new kids, carry on!"Keep outta our ways.")And the alleyways, too. They's ours."Howdy, Trainer."%You ain't come at the best time."9Once upon a time, Reborn was an oasis in the desert."ABut then, alla this city sprung up, and the waste from it...")And then what ya see is what ya got."4You take care travelin' around here, all right?"lRumor has it that there was once an old region on the edge of Reborn, but now it's fallen into decay..."'Boy howdy, I'll tell you what for."uI said once this place was an oasis in a desert, and I'm mighty glad that it's startin' to feel like that again."FShow me the true power of the bond between you and your Pokémon."When you are ready."What? You wanna go?"Didn't think so."9Team Meteor? That's just a stupid conspiracy theory."CEven if they exist, it doesn't mean they're behind everything."@Oh hello! It's a pleasure to meet you! Let's have a battle!"Maybe some other time!"RI came here because I heard there was a League, but it's so poorly organized."uI've been trying to contact a certain Gym Leader for weeks, but his caretaker won't let him battle apparently..."/You don't know who I am. Care to find out?"#That's okay. No one here does."(I'm telling you, man, they're real.":Team Meteor, man... They control everything, I swear."Curses..."4I dropped my Remote PC somewhere around here..."ZIt was one of the newer models, too-- the kind that doesn't require Cell Batteries..."]Argh, if only I could tell someone "freeremotepc" and just have already found it by now!"Alas..."~I hear Pokémon with Hidden Abilities have been showing up in the wild lately. Man, I'd like to get my hands on some of those.",This place is kind of a miracle lately.")And you know who it's all thanks to?"Adrienn."That fellow's a peach."Got a problem, pal?"`\GSALESMAN: You're back! So, are you ready to claim this fantastic Pokémon for only $500?!"bSALESMAN: Looking for more Pokémon? Of course you are! Well, then have I got a deal for you!"IHow would you like to be the proud new owner of one fantastic beast?"fThis Pokémon is so powerful, so utterly BAD-ASS, it's been heralded among dragons for centuries!"QFor you, I'll make a special discount, bringing the price down to only $500!"\GWhat do you say?!"Aha! Thank you! Thank you!"!GOON: Heh. Bad-ass, you say?"3Not a bad deal. I think I'll just help myself."The Pokémon was stolen!"GOON: See ya, nerds!"@SALESMAN: ...Well, I got my money. That's your problem now!"JERK: See ya, nerds!"mSALESMAN: Buuuut, if you really wanted to get that ultra-rare Pokémon, you could try and find that guy."UThugs like him hang out at the end of the tracks in the Peridot Ward. Good luck!"\Hm? You don't have the money, my friend! Come back when you've got it! I'll be waiting!""Hey, you're missing out here!"zMan, I was hoping to go study at Apophyll Academy, but there's no way I can cross the lake with Coral Pier shut down."Bang! FIRE!"Squelch! POISON!"Swish! ICE!"nNo matter what Field you change it from or to, any attack that alters the environment gets a power boost!"?According to my calculations, it's about 130% AWESOMENESS!"6I'm going to play a little song. Can you keep up?"Very well..."=AME: Oh, \PN. So Julia and Florinia found you after all."=I'm glad, though I'm kind of in the middle of something."^If there's anything you need to do since getting back, now would be a good time to do it."Or are you waiting on me?"!AME: Already? You move fast."!Okay, just a second, please."MAME: Sorry, as I was about to say, please inform Bennett that we accept."fHe certainly did famously during the trial battle, but something feels weird about the situation."3Maybe I'm just hung up on Laura's resignation."PBut the letter she sent was handwritten, signed, and unquestionably hers..."Well, whatever."HYou can take care of the rest for me, right? Did you get his types?"2SECRETARY: Yes. I'll register and notify him."AME: Thank you."]All right. I've got a couple of other things to take care of, but I could use your help."#The most important thing is...":Well, before I explain, I should bring everyone here."This might take all of us."ZAdrienn, Victoria, and DJ Arclight are taking care of various things around the city."3I'm not exactly sure where they are right now,"EBut you know them, right? You can probably guess where to start."JJust tell them to come back here when you find them. I'll be waiting."]AME: Great, you take care of whatever you need to, and come back to me once you're done!"_AME: Adrienn, Victoria, and DJ Arclight are taking care of various things around the city."*AME: So Arclight is meeting us there?"=Assuming he takes the low way, that should be all right.".VICTORIA: Sorry if I kept anyone waiting!"PAME: Arclight's not coming here, but he already knows, so this is everyone."%VICTORIA: Is something going on?"AME: Here's the situation."gWe received an anonymous tip that Team Meteor still has a base in the city, right under our noses."ADRIENN: Devon?"VICTORIA: Devon?"AME: Devon."How did you know?"<ADRIENN: For my part, it's the only logical place left."�I've been all over the rest of the city pretty intimately, but Devon Corp. is the one place that's always restricted anyone from working around."hVICTORIA: Even the storefront just looks shifty for what's supposed to be an international company."tADRIENN: Sweet Co. invested heavily in the restoration, and even Silph Co. was generous enough to donate funds."JThe fact that Devon still refused after that also made me suspicious."FAME: Yes, well it's no longer just a suspicion or anonymous lead."eI took the liberty of calling Mr. Stone with a business inquiry regarding Devon's Reborn branch."=And of course, he informed me that no such thing exists."?VICTORIA: Then it's settled! We can shut it down for good!".AME: Before that, there's one more thing."YOur informant also told us that the leader of Team Meteor is hidden there right now."VICTORIA: Solaris..."I won't hold back!"AME: No. It's Lin."GFrom what Saphira has told me, we can't take any chances with her.""That's why I need all of you.""And that's why I'm going too."KADRIENN: Oh? I thought you said you intended to stay on the sidelines?"?AME: It's true that Anna asked me to do that originally..."<AME: It's true that I intended to do that originally..."But at this point,"#If we can end all of this now,"I'll do whatever it takes.">Besides, as the Champion, I can't just do nothing, right?"!Sorry, \PN, didn't you know?"<It's not something I like to toss around or brag about."gBut I did restart this League after all, and who did you think runs the trial battles for Leaders?"'Anyway, it's really not important."/Right now, we need to focus on Devon Corp."LI've already talked over the details with Arclight, so here's the plan:"UThe main level is probably fairly secure, even if they don't want it to be seen."�So, we're going to take a pincer movement with one group in the front, and another approaching from the basement level which connects to the Railnet."JWe'll rendezvous in the middle, and tackle the upper floors together."Any questions?")ADRIENN: How are the groups decided?"-AME: You and I will take the storefront."TIf we pretend to be there on city restoration business, it won't be suspicious."C\PN, Victoria and Arclight will come up under and behind them."AADRIENN: If we all work together, they don't stand a chance!"EVICTORIA: I'll show Team Meteor the same mercy they showed Kiki."AME: Then we're set."Let's not waste any time!"9We sometimes have some battle enthusiasts over here."RDifferent one every day of the week, and we get an extra turnout on weekends.",You can battle 'em as much as you want."<But we ask them to clear out when new Trainers come by."�We don't want some over-zealous 10 year old rocking up with their level 5 starter, nothing else, and proceeding to conk out on the first guy they see."LThe free battle trainers will be back in a bit though; don't you worry."Z...What, did you forget what I said about the free battle trainers being cleared out?"IOr are you talking to me because you want me to bring them in early?"1I mean... I can do that, if you really want."STheir teams are only a little bit above level 10 or so, so it's not too bad...")Should I tell them they can come in?"#...Well, okay. If you're sure."NBut don't blame us if you charge in there without being ready, all right?"All right. You hang tight."#That's probably a fair choice."\Just wait a little bit. They'll show up around the time you're hitting over that level."Oh."FYou must be wondering what happened to the rebattleable Trainers."That's fair."-They all perished in the version update."Terrible incident, really."JIt's okay though, let me just use some necromancy to bring them back."Good bye."LYoung Trainer, I must advise to stay out of the alleyways in this city."@Too many of our youth have fallen into gang activity as is!""Stay vigilant and stay clean!"3We can make this city as great as it once was!"Young Trainer!"IHave you gotten involved in the Reborn City Restoration Project yet?"@Much has been done, true, but yet there's still much to do!"XAsking people all around the city how you can help may yield some fruitful results!"4Hi! You have the pulse dex and field notes now."You're welcome."%This NPC will now self-destruct."But like, gently."k bai~"CHey, c'mere for a sec! Can I ask you something really quickly?"(\PN picked up the package of Mints!")Oh? You seem to be doing quite well!">But are you really satisfied with just your current team?"AMany Trainers raise multiple Pokémon-- more than six even--"AAnd swap them out in rotation for their upcoming challenges.".Never consider your doors closed, friend."~I hear Shiny Pokémon appear much more frequently in Reborn than other places, and they look different from most Shinies, too."/Who wants to bet it's 'cause of radiation?"XADRIENN: While we're waiting for the others, there's something I was curious about.":If I was gone for so long, why didn't you replace me?"TSurely if the League was still going, you would have needed a new Fairy Leader."AME: Um, the thing is..." I actually did replace you."EADRIENN: Oh? I'd love to meet the new-- or rather, old-- Leader!"AME: Yeah, about that..."GNobody's seen or heard from him since the incident in Jasper Ward."3It seems pretty likely that he didn't make it."CThen, you came back before I finished arranging a replacement." Nice timing in that regard."CADRIENN: Ah, I'm sorry to have brought up something like that."4ADRIENN: The others should be here soon, right?"2LYKOS: Ah, you finally beat every Gym Leader?"Congratulations!"!Would you like to Celebrate?"2LYKOS: I hope that you will have a great day!"(AME: Oh, you're here already. Good."^There's no sign of any suspect yet, but I've got several officers out searching the area."/VICTORIA: Suspect? In the station bombing?"_AME: That's right. If anyone responsible for the incident is in the area, we'll find them."NBut until then, we'll probably have to restrict travel between the wards."UAnyway, new trainers don't need to worry about all that; it'll be taken care of."%Let's finish your registrations."3Obviously the main event is picking a starter."4VICTORIA: \PN can go ahead of me; I don't mind."AME: Right this way, then."5Ooh, yay! Another person who wants to fight us~?"Let's go, dear!"Awwwwwwh."'Ey. You got a problem?"`Maaan, the squad and I used to hang out here all the time when we were playin' the streets."EBut they all got on this "city betterment" bullshit and ditched."Fuck that shit, bruh.".Imma kick it right here my own damn self."^We're still finishing up some loose ends on the Beryl Wall repair project, so hang tight!"?Donations and reconstruction will be available again soon."YWe value your interest in helping Reborn City, so we hope you'll check back shortly!"QHello! I accept donations for restoration projects on behalf of Reborn City.";Would you like to