 buildings total are in Ametrine City?"=DANIELLE: Glad that those didn't escape your keen sight."Question three!"MThere's a man who lives in the Aventurine Woods with a bunch of Pikachu."3How many Pikachu are usually inside his house?"lDANIELLE: I'll give you points for that one; it's harder to keep track when they're all running around."But this isn't over yet!"?How many satellite dishes are there in all of Spinel Town?"DANIELLE: That's right!" Trick question! You got me."&Okay, okay. A real one this time!"?How many bookshelves are there in all of Apophyll Academy?",DANIELLE: All right! You're doing well!"IToo well, in fact, so I'm going to throw everything I've got at you!"1Final question! This is for all the cookies!":How many trees are there in all of Chrysolia Forest?!"DANIELLE: ..."......"........."Just kidding!" Even I don't know that one."But I'll let you have it."~Even if you did just go specifically look for the answers, think about what I said about learning to observe and not just see."You're pretty good."Too good, really."2Did you already know what I was going to ask?"1Regardless, that ended up being kind of fun.">So in return for letting me tease you, you can have this."+\PN obtained Field Effect Read-Out 31!",Info on Fairy Tale Field now available!"4DANIELLE: I'd like to travel the world someday."|People always talk about seeing it, but they never mention how each place has different sounds, scents and atmospheres."That's what I live on."rWhen that happens, and I finally go visit everywhere, I'll be sure to get more questions to pick on you with!"DANIELLE: Realllllly?"+Are you really really realllllly sure?"$I think you should check again!"?After all, that seems to be the only way you'll do things."!DANIELLE: Pi-pi, pikachuuuu!"IBy the way, that's Pikachu-eese for "You're wrong and also a loser.""DANIELLE: Ahaha..."No."kYou really didn't learn anything, did you? You can't even remember buildings? Did you not notice them?"$DANIELLE: Out 