Just,"!Unless it's about Kecleon..."2Sorry-- that might seem strange. It's just..."�We keep getting complaints from residents of the Beryl Ward that Kecleon have been running out from Rhodochrine Jungle and getting in their way.":Something seems to be chasing them out of the jungle."DWhatever that is... is probably not something we can deal with."sNevertheless, these startled Kecleon panic, so they hide themselves around Beryl, and then it's a real bother."_Our competitors should have the Devon Scope, which allows invisible Pokémon to be seen...":But it seems Devon has suddenly completely shut down."ZBut call it bad business sense or something else-- they don't seem to be selling any!"HTheir customer service just keeps telling people to look elsewhere."3Remembering the Silph Scope, people come here.""You're not the same, are you?"...Ah."So you are."BTo tell the truth, I don't know how to handle this situation.";Is there any chance I could ask for your help on this?"#ATTENDENT: Oh, thank goodness."NI don't know how to handle this situation. Hey-- maybe you could help me?"7What I'm going to say, isn't... technically legal."MBut given the situation with Devon, maybe we can make an exception here."�I'd like you to scope out that building and see if you can find some kind of old model of their Devon Scope, and bring it back to me."oWe should be able to create a hybrid scope with it. That way both the company and the people will benefit!"ROf course, if you get caught, please don't mention you're affiliated with us!"�ATTENDANT: I'd like you to scope out that building and see if you can find some kind of old model of their Devon Scope, and bring it back to me.".ATTENDANT: That's-- you actually got it?!"Amazing..."Ah, may I see that?"+\PN handed over the Devon Scope Model."ATTENDANT: ...Oh.""This is just a display model."It's really all they had?"%All right, I can work with this."VI didn't get to this position just by shooting the breeze with consumers all day!"...