r? They're all the rage, lately."fThey say a young Trainer named \PN has been sweeping through Reborn, solving problems everywhere!"ISupposedly they're handsome like a prince, but elegant like a queen!";And they have five hundred Pokémon, all at max level!"4And some even say they have telekinetic powers!"/I'd sure like to meet that person someday."dFlorinia may not have the best social skills, but she knows how to get things done around here."cI'll tell you what, this school has been like three times better just from Fern alone leaving."�Now that he and his cronies aren't pushing everyone around with their stupid popularity gimmick, the atmosphere is SO much better."So you're the brat, huh?"SUCH a brat."Do whatever."$You're the one the boss wanted!"...Boss."3So we're just not gonna talk about this, okay?"/"All about Huntail, the Deep Sea Pokémon""
Read?"U"National Dex Number 367, Huntail is a unique species in terms of its evolution."�Its pre-evolution, Clamperl, may become either Huntail or its sister species, Gorebyss, depending on what item is held when it is traded."�Huntail retains different strengths than Gorebyss however, such as a more physically-based movepool to compliment its boosted Attack stat."�Additionally, whereas Gorebyss' natural movepool takes on a Psychic pseudo-type, Huntail's could be said to follow that of a Dark-type."zRegardless, Huntail remains a fascinating contrast from a scientific standpoint on the impact of items on evolution.""""Pokémon by Base Stat Total""�"Total: 300: Bagon, Baltoy, Beldum, Bellsprout, Bronzor, Croagunk, Deino, Dratini, Geodude, Gible, Klink, Larvitar, Minccino, Pikachu, Poliwag, Remoraid,""Sandshrew, Snorunt, Snubbull."Total: 302: Gulpin"Total: 303: Golett, Yamask"�Total: 305: Carvanha, Cubchoo, Ducklett, Ferroseed, Machop, Mankey, Numel, Shellder, Shelmet, Smoochum, Timburr, Vanillite, Venonat.""+...the rest of the pages are torn out.""Discharge vs Lava Plume""k"Discharge and Lava Plume, both attacks discovered during the Gen IV era, possess very similar traits."�Each one has 100% Accuracy, 80 Base Power, and affect all adjacent opponents on the field. They also both have a 30% chance to inflict status."�However, whereas Discharge is Electric-type, Lava Plume is Fire. Accordingly, they inflict different statuses- Paralysis and Burn, respectively."{Also notable, whereas Discharge is learned by a wide variety of Pokémon, only fifteen Pokémon can learn Lava Plume."""Calculating Total Power""H"There are three factors in determining the end power of an attack."qFirstly, the Base Power of the move. Let's take the move Confusion for example. Confusion has 50 Base Power."�Next, apply the multiplier based on type effectiveness. If Confusion is used on a Mankey, a Fighting-type, it will be Super Effective."�Therefore, the power is doubled to 100. If it were used on a Croagunk, for instance, it would be effective twice, and would double again to 200."�Finally, factor in the Same Type Attack Bonus, or STAB for short. This is a bonus for if a Pokémon uses an attack of its own type."�In other words, a Confusion attack from a Kadabra will be stronger than the same attack from Venonat, because Kadabra is Psychic."�It will be 1.5 times more effective. So if Venonat uses Confusion on Croagunk, the total power is 200. If Kadabra uses it, then the total power is 300."!And it's as simple as that!""IYou should check out the books in this school! They're a great read!"DHey, wow, you're that Trainer who swept Fern out before, right?"PAnd fought to save the city, but let's be honest, Fern's more of a problem."1Hey! You're challenging Ms. Florinia, right?"oI got something you can't get anywhere else around here, I think it might help you out. Wanna take a look?"4Headmistress Florinia should be back soon, yes?"|Although her administrative duties at the school have been covered, the city council is waiting on several updates from her."�She volunteered to undertake the lion's share of resource management and accounting to make sure everyone working in the city had what they needed."^Between that and leading students in community service, she has been an invaluable asset."tBut without those reports, many of our work groups won't know how far we can proceed within the current budget.",Hmm. Nothing to do but wait, I suppose."WI've been studying up on the Field Seeds that have been growing around the region."]I read that in Alola, there's four types of Seeds for Electric, Grass, Mist and Psychic,">But the Seeds that grow in Reborn are entirely different!"EThere's four types: Elemental, Magical, Telluric, and Synthetic."iApparently, each of them has different effects depending on the type of terrain that activates them!""But they do have limitations."cEach terrain can only activate one type, and they can only be used once before they disappear."HIt seems like I'll have to study harder to learn all their effects."5Why don't you try this out and see for yourself?"YThe Seeds that grow in Reborn are entirely different from the ones in other regions!"2Oh, you're the one who beat Florinia, right?!"#What'd you do to finally win?!"AI keep trying, but I've never been able to actually do it..."NTell me the secret to beating her and I'll tell you a secret in return..."..."&Whaaaat, that's how you beat her?"-I don't even have any of those Pokémon!"'Sigh... Whatever, a deal's a deal."Here's the secret!"Don't tell anyone!"No fair!!!"/Stop hogging your victory all to yourself!"<If you're here, that means you're down to fight, right?""Down in the dumps, more like."You'll be fine already."Yes"No[d"1Bienvenue! Voulez-vous soigner vos Pokémon?"+Ok, je prends vos Pokémon un instant."EIl semblerait que l'un de vos Pokémon ait attrapé le Pokérus."�Le Pokérus est encore trop méconnu, à part que ce sont des formes de vie microscopiques qui passent d'un Pokémon à l'autre."UQuand ils sont infectés, les Pokémon se développent beaucoup plus rapidement!"0Tenez. Nous espérons vous revoir bientôt!")Nous espérons vous revoir bientôt!"5Tout d'abord, vous devriez soigner vos Pokémon."1Vos Pokémon sont en super forme maintenant."&À une prochaine fois peut-être!":"Barrière Supérieure du Hall Central-- Ouverture..."Déverrouillée.""-C'est la meilleure école de la région."kC'est incroyable, surtout vu que la directrice actuelle y a eu son diplôme il y a seulement deux ans."JHé, tu as entendu parler de ce Dresseur? C'est devenu viral par ici."|Ils disent qu'un jeune Dresseur appelé \PN a parcouru tout Reborn, et a résolu des problèmes partout où il passait!"KApparemment, il est beau comme un prince et élégant comme une reine!"BEt il aurait captué cinq cents Pokémon, tous au niveau max!"=Et d'autres disent qu'il aurait des pouvoirs psychiques!"7J'aimerais bien rencontrer cette personne un jour."`Florinia n'est pas la plus sociable, mais elle sait comme faire marcher les choses par ici."`Je te fais une confidence, l'école est trois fois plus agréable depuis Fern en est parti."�Maintenant que lui et ses larbins n'harcèlent plus tout le monde pour asseoir leur soi-disant popularité, l'ambiance est TELLEMENT meilleure."'Alors, c'est toi le minable, hein?"Un vrai minable, ouais."'Fais-ce que tu veux, je m'en fous."#C'est toi que le chef voulait!"...Chef."!On en parlera pas, d'accord?"+"Tout sur Serpang, le Pokémon Abysse""
Lire?"g"Numéro 367 sur le Pokédex National, Serpang est une espèce unique dans sa manière d'évoluer."zSa pré-évolution, Coquiperl, peut devenir soit Serpang soit Rosabyss, selon l'Objet qu'il tient lors d'un échange."�Serpang possède des caractéristiques différentes de Rosabyss, avec des capacités plus physiques couplées à une statistique d'Attaque plus importante."�De plus, tandis que Rosabyss a des capacités naturelles d'un pseudo Type Psy, Serpang pourrait être considéré comme un pseudo Type Ténèbres."jEn tout cas, Serpang est une curiosité scientifique de part l'impact des Objets sur son évolution.""2"Pokémon par Total de Statistiques de Base.""�"Total : 300 : Archéomire, Balbuto, Chétiflor, Chinchidou, Cradopaud, Draby, Embrylex, Griknot, Minidraco, Pikachu, Ptitard, Racaillou, Rémoraid, Sabelette,"/Solochi, Snubbull, Stalgamin, Terhal, Tic."Total : 302 : Gloupti."$Total: 303: Gringolem, Tutafeh."�Total: 305: Carvanha, Chamallot, Charpenti, Couaneton, Escargaume, Férosinge, Grindur, Kokiyas, Lippouti, Machop, Mimitoss, Polarhume, Sorbébé,"")...le reste des pages est déchiré." "Coup d'Jus vs Ébullilave""�"Coup d'Jus vs Ébullilave, les deux capacités découvertes lors la période de Génération 4, possèdent des traits similaires."`Chacune a 100% de Précision, 80 de Puissance, et affecte tous les Pokémon sur le terrain."�Cependant, Coup d'Jus est de Type Électrik tandis que Ébullilave est de Type Feu, et peuvent infliger respectivement la paralysie et la brûlure."�Aussi, alors que Coud'Jus est appris par une grande variété de Pokémon, seulement quinze Pokémon peuvent apprendre Ébullilave.""#"Calculer la Puissance totale""T"Il y a trois paramètres déterminants pour la puissance finale d'une attaque."iPremièrement, la Puissance de la capacité. Par exemple, prenons Choc Mental qui a 50 de Puissance."�Ensuite, appliquons le coefficient basé sur l'efficacité du type ciblé. Si Choc Mental est utilisé sur un Férosinge, un type Combat, alors l'attaque sera Super Efficace."�Ainsi, la Puissance est doublée à 100. Si le Pokémon ciblé est un Cradopaud par exemple, ce sera doublement Super Efficace. Et la Puissance de l'attaque atteindra 200."sEnfin, le STAB (Same-Type Attack Boost). C'est un bonus si le Pokémon utilise une attaque de son propre type."yAutrement dit, un Choc Mental d'un Kadabra sera plus fort que celui d'un Mimitoss, car seul Kadabra est de type Psy."�Ce sera 1.5 fois plus puissant. Alors si Mimitoss utilise Choc Mental sur Cradopaud, la puissance totale sera de 200. Si c'est Kadabra, la puissance totale sera de 300."!C'est aussi simple que ça!""ETu devrais jeter un œil aux livres par ici! Ils valent le coup!"<Hé, wouah, c'est toi qui avait battu Fern avant, hein?"gEt tu avais aidé à sauver la ville. Pour être franc, Fern est plus un problème qu'autre chose."+Hé! Tu vas affronter Madame Florinia?"oJ'ai un truc que tu peux obtenir nulle part ailleurs. Je crois que ça pourrait t'aider. Ça t'intéresse?"CLa Directrice Florinia devrait revenir bientôt, n'est-ce pas?"�Bien que ses tâches administratives à l'École ont été accomplies, les instances de la ville attendent beaucoup de réponses de sa part."�Elle s'est portée volontaire pour le travail de titan de répartition des ressources et des fonds pour faire en sorte que chacun puisse avoir ce dont il a besoin."uEntre ça et la direction des étudiants dans les travaux d'intérêt général, elle s'en rendue indispensable."~Mais sans ses retours, beaucoup de nos projets n'ont plus aucune visibilité sur ce qu'ils peuvent accomplir dans leur budget."6Hmm. Il ne reste plus qu'à attendre, je suppose."VJ'ai fait des recherches sur les Graines de Terrain qui poussent dans la région."`J'ai lu qu'à Alola, il y a quatre types de Graines : Électrik, Herbe, Brume et Psychique."DMais les Graines qui poussent à Reborn sont bien différentes!"RIl y en a quatre sortes : Élémentaire, Magique, Tellurique et Synthétique."lApparemment, chacune d'entre elles a des effets spécifiques selon le type de terrain qui les activent!"$Mais elles ont des limitations."dChaque terrain ne peut activer qu'un seul type de Graine, et leur activation consume la Graine."POn dirait que je vais devoir travailler dur pour apprendre tous les effets."0Pourquoi n'essaierais-tu pas par toi-même?"]Les Graines qui poussent à Reborn sont bien différentes de celles des autres régions!"/Oh, c'est toi qui as battu Florinia, non?!"$Comment t'as fait pour gagner?!"7J'arrête pas d'essayer, mais j'y arrive jamais..."OSi tu me dis ton secret pour la battre, je te dirai un secret en retour..."..."-Quoiiiii, c'est comme ça que t'as fait?"%Mais j'ai aucun de ces Pokémon!",Pfff... Bon, un marché est un marché."Voilà le secret!"Ne le dis à personne!"C'est pas juste!!!",Arrête de garder ta victoire pour toi!"0Si t'es là, c'est pour qu'on s'batte, non?")C'est pour que tu m'tabasses, ouais."C'est bon, c'est bon."Oui"Non;[d"3Welcome! Would you like to rest your Pokémon?"3OK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."/Your Pokémon may be infected by PokéRus."kLittle is known about the PokéRus except that they are microscopic lifeforms that attach to Pokémon."BWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."+Here you go. We hope to see you again!"We hope to see you again!"<First, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."6Your Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."We hope you excel!","Central Hall Lower Gate-- Unlocking..."Unlocked.""*This is the top school in the region."^That's amazing, considering the current acting principal is only a graduate of two years."JHey, have you heard about that Trainer? They're all the rage, lately."fThey say a young Trainer named \PN has been sweeping through Reborn, solving problems everywhere!"ISupposedly they're handsome like a prince, but elegant like a queen!";And they have five hundred Pokémon, all at max level!"4And some even say they have telekinetic powers!"/I'd sure like to meet that person someday."dFlorinia may not have the best social skills, but she knows how to get things done around here."cI'll tell you what, this school has been like three times better just from Fern alone leaving."�Now that he and his cronies aren't pushing everyone around with their stupid popularity gimmick, the atmosphere is SO much better."So you're the brat, huh?"SUCH a brat."Do whatever."$You're the one the boss wanted!"...Boss."3So we're just not gonna talk about this, okay?"/"All about Huntail, the Deep Sea Pokémon""
Read?"U"National Dex Number 367, Huntail is a unique species in terms of its evolution."�Its pre-evolution, Clamperl, may become either Huntail or its sister species, Gorebyss, depending on what item is held when it is traded."�Huntail retains different strengths than Gorebyss however, such as a more physically-based movepool to compliment its boosted Attack stat."�Additionally, whereas Gorebyss' natural movepool takes on a Psychic pseudo-type, Huntail's could be said to follow that of a Dark-type."zRegardless, Huntail remains a fascinating contrast from a scientific standpoint on the impact of items on evolution.""""Pokémon by Base Stat Total""�"Total: 300: Bagon, Baltoy, Beldum, Bellsprout, Bronzor, Croagunk, Deino, Dratini, Geodude, Gible, Klink, Larvitar, Minccino, Pikachu, Poliwag, Remoraid,""Sandshrew, Snorunt, Snubbull."Total: 302: Gulpin"Total: 303: Golett, Yamask"�Total: 305: Carvanha, Cubchoo, Ducklett, Ferroseed, Machop, Mankey, Numel, Shellder, Shelmet, Smoochum, Timburr, Vanillite, Venonat.""+...the rest of the pages are torn out.""Discharge vs Lava Plume""k"Discharge and Lava Plume, both attacks discovered during the Gen IV era, possess very similar traits."�Each one has 100% Accuracy, 80 Base Power, and affect all adjacent opponents on the field. They also both have a 30% chance to inflict status."�However, whereas Discharge is Electric-type, Lava Plume is Fire. Accordingly, they inflict different statuses- Paralysis and Burn, respectively."{Also notable, whereas Discharge is learned by a wide variety of Pokémon, only fifteen Pokémon can learn Lava Plume."""Calculating Total Power""H"There are three factors in determining the end power of an attack."qFirstly, the Base Power of the move. Let's take the move Confusion for example. Confusion has 50 Base Power."�Next, apply the multiplier based on type effectiveness. If Confusion is used on a Mankey, a Fighting-type, it will be Super Effective."�Therefore, the power is doubled to 100. If it were used on a Croagunk, for instance, it would be effective twice, and would double again to 200."�Finally, factor in the Same Type Attack Bonus, or STAB for short. This is a bonus for if a Pokémon uses an attack of its own type."�In other words, a Confusion attack from a Kadabra will be stronger than the same attack from Venonat, because Kadabra is Psychic."�It will be 1.5 times more effective. So if Venonat uses Confusion on Croagunk, the total power is 200. If Kadabra uses it, then the total power is 300."!And it's as simple as that!""IYou should check out the books in this school! They're a great read!"DHey, wow, you're that Trainer who swept Fern out before, right?"PAnd fought to save the city, but let's be honest, Fern's more of a problem."1Hey! You're challenging Ms. Florinia, right?"oI got something you can't get anywhere else around here, I think it might help you out. Wanna take a look?"4Headmistress Florinia should be back soon, yes?"|Although her administrative duties at the school have been covered, the city council is waiting on several updates from her."�She volunteered to undertake the lion's share of resource management and accounting to make sure everyone working in the city had what they needed."^Between that and leading students in community service, she has been an invaluable asset."tBut without those reports, many of our work groups won't know how far we can proceed within the current budget.",Hmm. Nothing to do but wait, I suppose."WI've been studying up on the Field Seeds that have been growing around the region."]I read that in Alola, there's four types of Seeds for Electric, Grass, Mist and Psychic,">But the Seeds that grow in Reborn are entirely different!"EThere's four types: Elemental, Magical, Telluric, and Synthetic."iApparently, each of them has different effects depending on the type of terrain that activates them!""But they do have limitations."cEach terrain can only activate one type, and they can only be used once before they disappear."HIt seems like I'll have to study harder to learn all their effects."5Why don't you try this out and see for yourself?"YThe Seeds that grow in Reborn are entirely different from the ones in other regions!"2Oh, you're the one who beat Florinia, right?!"#What'd you do to finally win?!"AI keep trying, but I've never been able to actually do it..."NTell me the secret to beating her and I'll tell you a secret in return..."..."&Whaaaat, that's how you beat her?"-I don't even have any of those Pokémon!"'Sigh... Whatever, a deal's a deal."Here's the secret!"Don't tell anyone!"No fair!!!"/Stop hogging your victory all to yourself!"<If you're here, that means you're down to fight, right?""Down in the dumps, more like."You'll be fine already."Yes"NoIu;␀k[["UYou're not going any further. Orders are orders, and they come from the top dog."Defeat is defeat."6There are some things that just can't be changed."=The students are all in a fluster. I need a distraction."You're a flurry yourself."'All right now, everyone stay calm."Hey, sly. Don't move."Do you even go here?"Whatever, I tried."Locked.")You're a Gym challenger, aren't you?"NVisitors are frequent here, but they usually don't have to come upstairs."Are you lost?"#Are you a Gym challenger here?",Oh, you won a long time ago? Well then."/Listen, I think you're really cool, and..."=And I was just, uhm, wondering if you wanted to maybe..."STUDENT: Hey!"/STUDENT: D-don't sneak up on me like that!"TEACHER: Sorry about that."I'll go get a janitor.["[Tu n'iras pas plus loin. Les ordres sont les ordres, et ils viennent du chef de meute."Quand on perd, on perd."<Il y a certaines choses qui ne peuvent être changées."ILes étudiants me paraissent troublés. J'ai besoin de me distraire."&C'est toi le fauteur de troubles!"'Que tout le monde garde son calme!"Hé. Arrête-toi là!"Tu m'écoutes, au moins?"Bon, j'ai essayé."Verrouillé.")Tu vas relever le défi de l'Arène?"\Il y a beaucoup de visiteurs ici, m