ow, the Big Boss Pokémon""u"Honchkrow, like its pre-evolution Murkrow, is a Dark/Flying-type, obtained by applying a Dusk Stone to Murkrow."IIts Abilities include Insomnia, Super Luck, and most notably, Moxie."�Honchkrow is a great abuser of the move Sucker Punch, and proper timing combined with the Moxie Ability can make Honchkrow a devastating force."�However, by evolving into Honchkrow, a Trainer could miss out on Murkrow's super-utile Prankster Ability, so make sure to choose wisely!""2"Study notes: Answers to Ms. Belatry's final"""1- C\n2- A 3- C"4- B\n5- B 6- D""...">Somebody could get in a lot of trouble if this was found."H-hey, back off!"4You trying to peek in on my Mr. Mimecraft game?"No way, buddy!"I got here first!"9I'm putting off studying, and having a helluva time!"UOnly way you could ever convince me to move is helping me find somethin' better!"2Hey, back off while I'm playing my game, man!"!Only way I'll ever move is--"	Huh?"4There's a cave with a bunch of mining rocks...?""Under the North Obsidia Ward?"2Just like Mr. Mimecraft-- but like, actually!"&Gonna mine some diamonds, y'know?"XThere's, uh... something wrong with the computer now, anyways. I dunno what I did--""Well, not my problem anymore!"&Peace, homie! Thanks for the tip!"Yes"NoIu;␀�D[[�"$"Study notes: Never-miss moves""
Read?"e"In total, there are thirteen damaging moves that have the effect of never missing their attack."�These moves are Swift, Aerial Ace, Magnet Bomb, Magical Leaf, Aura Sphere, Feint Attack, Shadow Punch, Hyperspace Fury, Hyperspace Hole,"JClear Smog, Shock Wave, Trump Card, Vital Throw and Disarming Voice.""""The Personal Diary of Julia""!Should you really read this?"7"Soooo something superduperly cool happened today~"\I. Made. Cheerleading Captain! Many booms were had! But I feel bad... Hey, that rhymes~"(Maybe I can work that into a cheer."�Anyway, I feel bad, cuz Amy had to give up her spot, orrrr well, she didn't HAVE to, but she did. Buuuut, she recommended that I take her place, and I did!"VAmy was such a great captain, though~ I can't understand why she wanted to leave."�And then afterwards, I wanted to go out to celebrate, but Tania and Amy were hanging out in their room like usual, so it was just Rini..."�And of course, Rini never wants to go anywhere, because she's too shy and all 'social interaction is not a productive blahblahblah'..."So here I am. Mrrrrrrrr."8I think I'll just go to sleep... Nightsies, diary!""%"The Personal Diary of Florinia"""Dear Diary,"!This will be my final entry."GThe retention of emotions has proven veritably counter-productive."SIrrational thoughts and feelings remain a severe detriment to work efficiency."XMoreover, they appear to invariably breed scorn in those with whom they are shared."RThis writer has lost much on behalf of these turbulent confounding variables."fEmotional excision has thereby been deemed necessary, beginning with the termination of archival."Farewell.""$"The Personal Diary of Titania""C"So, you think it's cool to go reading other people's diaries."THoping you'll find dirt on me here? Or maybe some weeping emotional confession?"{A little piece of advice: If you want to get to know someone, go talk to them. Don't creep around their private files."SBut if this is the kind of person you are, don't bother trying to talk to me.""#"The Personal Diary of Amaria"""I don't know, diary."9I know I have everything a girl could possibly want."NI have lots of friends, an amazing partner, a great education and life..."$...But it doesn't feel like it.")I try to always smile and be cheery."XI'm very good at it, apparently, or else I might not have made cheerleader captain!"OI guess I was secretly hoping that would make me happy on the inside, too." But I guess that was naive."#I'm tired of feeling this way."3I'm tired of feeling like I'm always drowning."MTania tries her best for me, I know that. And I appreciate it so much..."4But in the end, will it even make a difference?"EI'll see you in meaningless tomorrow, with another false smile."""On Fairytales""g"History and literature have an awful habit of letting little girls wander past the forest's edge,"BOnly to be swallowed up by any number of enchantments beyond."She awakens in a tower,"Stone,"
Cold,"Alone."7A dragon guards her, its fangs bared to the world,"�Brimstone breath faithfully reserved for whatever metal-clad ignoramus thinks himself so mighty that even fire may not char his miserable flesh."2But there is only one who can slay the beast:")The one to whom its back is turned.""What up, BIATCH."1I'm the most LEARNINGEST bro in these parts."9I can give you some HOT LEARNS if you have the cash."Check out my SKILLS, yo."VOh yeah, oh yeah. No one's gonna hurt you with this, here. That'll run you $1000."-Yo, you gotta HAVE the money first, bro."QOh, man, you feel that POWER? You're only gonna get that from this guy here."a$500 and I got you. But, hey, if you sleep in class, don't tell teach it came from me, yeah?"ZThis is the big money, yeah? Grab 'em, don't let 'em go. And I only want $500 for it."WYeah, that hate, that rage, I see you feel that. So I'll pop you a discount: $250."Later, BIATCH."Oh, hold up."aI don't know if you know how we do things in these parts, but you only gotta pay once. Ever."lThe way we see it, you got us covered for a move, right? And, y'know, maybe you forget it or something."So no one here is gonna double charge you. And by "here" I mean the whole city. Or anywhere else that does something like this."Sound good?"I'll see you."-Hi, you! I'm one of the top in my class!"2I happen to do a little tutoring on the side."/Maybe I've got something that'll help you!"$Any of these sound good to you?"Snatch will run you $500."uIt looks like you're a little short on money, though. No problem if you need to run and get some-- I'll be here."2All done! Just come back if you forget, okay?"&I'll teach Helping Hand for $500!"Ally Switch will be $250."#I'll teach After You for $250."�Hey, before you go-- I usually say to come back if you forget, but I wanted to make sure you knew that applies to everyone you learn moves from."BIt's just kind of a thing that we do here. In Reborn, I mean."LYou seem like you're new to these parts, so I thought I'd let you know."BYou know where to find me if you want to learn anything else!"	Hey."Did you know that, like..."Magic is, like...."
Real?"Cuz, like..."It's real."If you have like...."$500..."I'll show you my magic."It's like a coat...."Made of magic...."But like..."$If you don't have the money...."It's not a fair trade..."Maaaaaagic."+If you, like, need a practice sesh...."Just hit me up, y'know...""I'll give you a refresher...."It's like a room......"Made of magic........."It's like a room....."Made of ma--"Wait..."No...."Wonder.........".Oh.... this is like.... the OG magic....."You can look at things..."#And they, like....float......."Oh, uh...."6I don't really want the full money for this......"To be honest....."It kinda sucks......"&So you can just give me $100....."Hey, so, like....."Before you go....."7If you ever, like, learn something from someone...")They'll, like, refresh you for free.")It's just what we do around here...."It's kind of like..."The city's magic......""If you need more magic......."-I've got magic.........................."Trainer!">You must have approached me because of my vast knowledge!",I know it practically radiates from me!"lYou are in luck! For, with the appropriate compensation, I am willing to share what I know with others!"-Feast your eyes, your senses, your mind!"gGravity! Gravity is so fascinating. Did you know that we don't fully understand how gravity works?"bI will tell you everything I know that humanity doesn't know about gravity for a paltry $500."{Alas, you are lacking in funding. I will ask that you procure more-- but please return upon doing so! I have much to share!"3The joy of knowledge- shared! Truly priceless."'Magnets! Magnets are incredible..."DTheir power is invisible and our understanding of it eludes us!"2I will display the power of magnets for $500."fIn life, there are many mysteries. But, sometimes, all you need is something simple, like a wall."0A simple discussion will run a simple $500."*Ah, yes, the transmission of anxiety."EI, too, find myself an insomniac, though I do not suffer for it!"+I will request $1000 for this service."4The joy of knowledge-- shared! Truly priceless."UTrainer! I do not wish to hold you, but before you depart, I must say something."^I am always available to converse once more with one who I have passed my knowledge onto."bHowever, you will find that this is true even for those who do not share my love of learning!"�Should you engage in such tutoring with anyone in the region, you will find that their services will be available to you after one transaction!"\Please remember this when engaging in a similar arrangement with others in this region."5Please return if there is more that I can share!".Uggggggggh, those Lapis trustfund babies!"You know what I mean?!"hEven if you somehow finally manage to get a leg up on their specially-tutored 5 IV bred Pokémon..."M...Then they just throw one of their five-bajillion Full Restores at it!")There's no winning against classism."6We little people gotta take the W's where we can."SFor instance, if someone asked me for a password, you know what I'd tell them?"I'd tell them "stopitems"."rThat way, no enemy I ever face would ever be able to use a stupid Potion on their stupid Pokémon ever again!"Yes"No"Iron Defense"
