[["-Florinia takes education very seriously!"aSo serious, in fact, you'll have to answer a set of quiz questions to even access her arena!"Study up, young one!"0Hmm. So you've done your reading after all."<Well, then it's time to put your knowledge to the test.".You earned your Badge from her after all?"2She also still has a lot to learn, I suppose."EI'm afraid Florinia is out on business, and will be for a while."AME: \PN?"3Hey there! So I see you've made it to the Gym."�This telecom system connects right to the Grand Hall, so no matter where you are, whenever you get to a Gym, you can call in for advice!"Anyway..."!So you're at Florinia's Gym."�Okay! So Florinia's fighting style is a little different from what you might expect from a Grass Leader-- her team is centered around sand."�Her 'desert rose' fighting style can be tricky-- she'll try to stall you out and take you down with residual sand damage and other status effects."cFlorinia's all about knowledge and strategy, so try something different from that to beat her."gMaybe you can find a way to abuse the sand and get lucky? Even if she insists that's not a factor."}Or, pick something that hits hard and power through her before she can get her effects going! Brawn over brains, if you will."Good luck!"7No one seems to be picking up at the Grand Hall...["4Florinia prends l'éducation très au sérieux!"hSi sérieusement que tu devras répondre à une série de questions avant d'accéder à son arène." Va réviser, tu as partiel!"+Hmm, tu connais ton sujet après tout.".Il est temps de tester tes connaissances."(Elle t'a donné ton badge au final?"5Elle a encore beaucoup à apprendre, je suppose."FJ'ai bien peur que Florinia se soit absentée, et pour un moment."AMÉ: \PN?"8Comment vas-tu? Je vois que tu as atteint l'Arène."Ces interfaces sont reliées au Grand Hall, donc où que tu sois, il y aura quelqu'un pour te conseiller à chaque Arène!"Bref..."Tu es donc chez Florinia."�Ok! Le style de combat de Florinia 