 a restraurant?"BENNETT: Yes?"GIRL: With just her?"BENNETT: Yes...?"GIRL: So it's a date."BENNETT: ...No, it's--"GIRL: So you're dating."BENNETT: No, we--"kGIRL: You're meeting for dinner at a restaurant, alone, with a girl, so it's a date, so you're dating."9Like, that's the word; that's what those words mean."You're dating."BENNETT: ..."/Are there any questions about the lecture?"BENNETT: ...Right."EWell, practical application is always better than theory anyway."?To that end, I've brought in a friend to help demonstrate."Please come in."PSTUDENT: Wait, so we get to see a member of the Elite 4 AND the Champion???"BENNETT: Not only that,"nBut after our fight, we'll also be accepting volunteers, and will fight against several of you ourselves."STUDENT: What?!"3There's no way we'd win against either of you!"4BENNETT: The point is not to win; but to learn."*BENNETT: I'm still doing that myself."#\PN, shall we have another go?Iu;␀�[["Pi-pichu?"6The wild Pokémon attacked \PN for the PokéSnax!["Pi-pichu?"8Le Pokémon sauvage attaque \PN pour le PokéSnack!;["Pi-pichu?"6The wild Pokémon attacked \PN for the PokéSnax!Iu;␀m[[	"Ground Floor"Rooftop Garden"1F"Rooftop[	"Rez-de-Chaussée"Jardin en terrasse"Rdc"Terrasse;[	"Ground Floor"Rooftop Garden"1F"RooftopIu;␀[[f"???: Hi! Who are you?"My name's Heather!"HCOREY: I have told you a thousand times, do not speak to strangers."F???: I have told you a thousand times, do not speak to strangers."�Especially here, there is a veritable gaggle of degenerates who would not think twice about harming a young girl such as yourself."Am I or am I not clear?"HEATHER: Yes, father."$COREY: "Yes" to which, exactly?""???: "Yes" to which, exactly?",HEATHER: I will not speak to strangers.",Or anyone ever, if you have your way..."COREY: Excuse me?"???: Excuse me?"(HEATHER: Forget it. I'm going home."COREY: Heather!"???: Heather!"	Tch."]COREY: I don't know why you've come here, but whatever busine