now how the police are, with their "deals"."&Isn't that right, Officer Gavin~?"5OFFICER: ...Your information had better be good."%ACE: My information is the BEST!"9ACE: You'll have to forgive his attitude, of course."lThe boys in blue are really hurting for some leads now that boring old Borealis is out of the business."lOld boy had been dogging them for months, and it's not as if we haven't kept them busy in recent times."	Aha!"1--"2--"And-- poof!"+Your files forgot how to be encrypted,">And learned to spread their glorious truths to the world!"!AMARIA: How did you do that?"ACE: I just unzipped them."AMARIA: ..."ACE: Kidding~"$ACE: They are yours to explore!"LI recognize much of this as the very same data I purged from Mosswater."1I should've guessed that snake had a backup."UHe must've been planning to turn tail long before the curtain closed for proper."And now I'm here."Funny how things work out."#AMARIA: Three other PULSEs...?"ACE: Hm? Three?"MAMARIA: It says here that there's three more plans underway immediately."ACE: That's... curious."8AMARIA: They're setting one up at Apophyll Beach..."+There's one... in Byxbysion Wasteland?"CAIN: What."AMARIA: And one..."(In the Peridot Ward of Reborn City."&But that's just down the stairs--"You knew about this?"ACE: Some of it."Surprisingly, not all!"/I wonder what else they've kept from me..."CAIN: Hold on--"*Before anything, what about the kids?"HI was hoping Anna had hidden some clue on how to rescue them here--",But what are we going to do about them?"0ACE: If you want my opinion on the matter--"%CAIN: And I'm not sure if I do--"ACE: Don't worry about it!"wCAIN: Five kids just got kidnapped by your former terrorist organization and you're saying "don't worry about it"?"UACE: I was dismissed, but I've still been listening in on their correspondences~"DTurns out that without me, they aren't so big on cybersecurity."EThe kids are being held for that old doctor from the Lapis Ward."cIt's not the most pleasant circumstance, but he has strictly forbidden them from being harmed."They'll be safe."BAMARIA: The more pressing matter is the safety of the people."8Those PULSE Tangrowth machines ruined entire wards!"AIf there's another one in the city, we can't just ignore it!"ACE: Reasonable."4The factory it's housed in isn't far from here."3If you'd like, I can show you how to break in."&AMARIA: Let's not waste any time."*All of us together-- are you with me?"1ACE: I'm happy to be the Ace up your sleeve~"JBesides, I have some questions of my own I'd like to get answers for."CAIN: I'm worried, but..."Let's do it."MThe sooner we shut down those PULSEs, the sooner we can save the others."-ACE: Then let's reconvene at Blacksteam!"UIt's the factory nearest here, just a jaunt down the stairs and off to the side."Bring your Ace-game~"Yes"NoIu;␀J[["aYou must be pretty brave to try and cross through here. Let's see how strong you really are!"You've got guts."9A few plants won't stop people like us. You feel me?";Everything I had is ruined... I'll take it out on you!"&It all just keeps going downhill."0So that's how it is. This is my end, is it?["TTu as du courage d'essayer de t'aventurer par ici. Voyons si tu en as la force!"Tu as du cran."DQuelques plantes comme ça ne vont pas nous arrêter. Tu piges?"8J'ai tout perdu... Et je vais me défouler sur toi!"Ça ne s'arrêtera jamais."$Alors, c'est ça. C'est ma fin?;["aYou must be pretty brave to try and cross through here. Let's see how strong you really are!"You've got guts."9A few plants won't stop people like us. You feel me?";Everything I had is ruined... I'll take it out on you!"&It all just keeps going downhill."0So that's how it is. This is my end, is it?Iu;␀�[["BYou! I remember you! Are you like, following me or something?"Go awayyyy!"!Twice! Twice! What is this?!["4Toi! Je me souviens de toi! Tu me suis ou quoi?"Va t-eeeeen!"4Deux fois! Deux fois! C'est quoi ton problème?;["BYou! I remember you! Ar