a invited us all here, and I was like, "Okay, I'll come to your picnic,"	BUT,"You have to battle me!"";We were gonna see who the stronger Elite 4 member was!"`(And it was gonna be ME, cuz I have the type advantage and that's definitely not cheating!)"(But then she couldn't even make it!"%So now this is kind of a bummer."KI mean, food and picnics are nice and all, but where's the fun stuff?!"cI'd challenge you to a rematch here and now, but I don't wanna mess up the picnic blanket now."1I just wish something exciting would happen!"LHEATHER: But after this, you're gonna run through Charous again, right?"$I'm always down to take you on!",HEATHER: Okay, I'm going back for Noel!" Fixtheproblemokaythanksbye!"-LUMI: Wait, what was that? Where's Noel?"He stayed at the top?!"What is he thinking?!"9EVE: Trying to rescue him on foot is likely a waste."aA barrier has appeared at the entrance of the tree as well, so we can't even get in anymore."DWhatever that is, it's spreading and fortifying itself quickly."LUMI: So what do we do?"We can't just wait here!"SHELLY: Um--"!Um, I have an idea actually?"LUMI: Tell us, tell us!"-SHELLY: Well, there's an Yveltal, right?"MAnd when I was at the roots of the tree, there were all these Z-Cells...";...And doesn't the barrier kind of look like them too?"(EVE: Where are you going with this?"NSHELLY: I don't really know-- but I remembered reading about an old myth,"HAbout a giant tree, an Yveltal, and a snake gnawing at its roots..."Um, what I'm saying is--"What if we used a Zygarde?"7In the myth, I think the snake attacked the bird--"rSo maybe a snake like Zygarde could deliver an attack that would break through the barriers once and for all!" EVE: An interesting theory."FI don't know if there's any use in putting stock in myths, but..."[Zygarde's Core Enforcer attack is known to eliminate special properties of its target."vIf we could get our hands on a 100% Zygarde, I think it's reasonable to assume it would be able to break throu