Yeah."Thanks."8You can get upstairs if you have an ID, by the way.")SHELLY: U-um, what happened to Cain?"GANNA: Nothing 'happened' to him-- he's pushing the orderlies back!"All by himself!"#He's really amazing, isn't he?"-SHELLY: M-maybe we should go help him..."ANNA: \PN, hurry up!"You're the last one down!"UCHARLOTTE: This isn't exactly the time or place to be waiting around for people.".CAIN: Do y'all even have somewhere to go?"@ANNA: We need somewhere nearby and out of sight to meet up!")We can decide what to do from there?"-SHELLY: Is there somewhere like that...?"!CAIN: How about the Railnet?"DI've used that to hide out a few times; no one goes down there."CHARLOTTE: Works for me."Let's make the break!"/SHELLY: C'mon, Heather! We're getting out!"SIGMUND: I think not."%SIGMUND: You had numbers before."Now they have left."gUnder the authority vested in me by the City of Reborn, I will be taking both of you into custody."ANNA: \PN!"(SIGMUND: You don't need to do this."?Submit peacefully and your punishments will yet be gentle."ANNA: "Gentle"?!"1You don't even know the meaning of the word!"ESIGMUND: Allow me to show you just how little it can mean to me."CIf only children had the experience to back up their wisdom..."ANNA: You did it!"WSIGMUND: Indeed, your commitment to lawlessness and disruption is truly inspiring."|ANNA: What good is a law that keeps us trapped with someone who can't tell the difference between hurting and healing?!"\PN saved us!"0Come on, let's go catch up with the others!"&SIGMUND: Consider carefully, \PN,"TIf the delusions of a child are truly the best place for you to lay your trust."%???: Are you sure that was wise?",SIGMUND: What-- Who in blazes are you!?" What are you doing in here?"???: Really, Doctor?"TYou've had rats scurrying about all this time, and you ask why the cat appears?" SIGMUND: Identify yourself!"-???: I'm a huge fan of your work on ECT."'I've found it very useful in my..."Operations."5Doctor, I understand that you've lost something."7I believe we can be of some benefit to each other.Iu;␀�[[W"AME: \PN?"3Hey there! So I see you've made it to the Gym."�This telecom system connects right to the Grand Hall, so no matter where you are, whenever you get to a Gym, you can call in for advice!"Anyway..."1AME: So you're going to fight Shelly, right?"\By the way, did you know that some Leaders in Reborn choose to fight in Double Battles?"�Shelly is one of those. Her tag team strategy focuses on setting up rain to cover her Fire-type weakness, and then going for a safe sweep."mIf you don't let her set the rain up, Fire-type attacks in her Forest Arena will make short work of her."XBut, if the rain does come, go with the flow and use Water moves to ride that wave!"RMany of her bugs won't resist it, so that extra power can be her own undoing."Good luck!"7No one seems to be picking up at the Grand Hall..."
