Hmph."HThis area is strictly off limits to absolutely everybody except us!""Beating us is off limits too!"Vandal!"COMMONS LOCK DISENGAGED"AME: \PN?"3Hey there! So I see you've made it to the Gym."�This telecom system connects right to the Grand Hall, so no matter where you are, whenever you get to a Gym, you can call in for advice!"Anyway..."5AME: So you're at Dr. Connal's Orphanage, right?"8Several of the kids there are prodigious battlers--"jThey were referred to us and managed to beat out all of the competition, so they got their positions."QBecause of that, we actually installed an arena in the Orphanage's basement."%I'm sure you'll see it shortly--"LHuh? They're not accepting battles because the arena is being repaired?"2That's exactly how it was a few months ago..."I thought I handled that."Dr. Connal might be lying.")I'll have to talk to him about that."hWell, whenever you are allowed to fight them, Noel will probably be your first opponent from there."eHe trains Normal-type Pokémon, but he was also allowed to use his ace, Clefable, as a wildcard."9Be careful for that. It can get very big, very fast."kNoel's other Pokémon are very well-rounded on their own, but he mainly only does one thing with them."�When you fight him, you might try to find opportunities to exploit changes in the environment, or anything else that's abnormal for what he's used to."Good luck!"7No one seems to be picking up at the Grand Hall...[+""Archives Patients""/La Clé Archives permet d'ouvrir la porte."Verrouillé."&"Accès Arène Niveau Inférieur"""Chambre garçons""ASHELLY: Euh... On ne devrait peut-être pas aller par là...""Chambre Filles""1SHELLY: Dis, on ne devrait peut-être pas..."SHELLY: Euh, \PN?"Qu'est-ce que tu fais?"3N'avez-vous pas de respect pour la procédure?",Alors je n'ai pas de respect pour vous."Humpf."DCette zone est interdite à absolument tout le monde sauf nous!"$Nous battre aussi est interdit!"Vandales!"BARRIERE DÉVERROUILLÉE"AMÉ: \PN?"8Comment vas-