sed to be the economic center of Reborn, but um, then..."LThen earthquakes happened, and they were hit so hard they had to close."<They also managed the city's electricity at the time..."So that went down, too..."LAnd then the entire city shut down until the renaissance of the League."...Right?"CHARLOTTE: ...And?"vNOEL: So then it won't open because it's connected to the old power plant, rather than the current operating one."ANNA: Old power plant?"Wait a second!"#That's where Mr. Shadow lives!"OI bet if someone went up there and asked him to turn it back on, he would!"$SHELLY: W-wait, you mean Shade?"#We just saw him earlier too..."#He'd r-really listen to us...?"ANNA: Who knows!"&He's secretly super nice, though!")It's a secret, so don't tell anyone!"&NOEL: You've never spoken to him."1How would you know whether he's nice or not?"ANNA: I just do!"(Hey, he's also a Reborn Gym Leader!"\PN, \PN, \PN!"fYou should go up to the old Power Plant and ask Mr. Shadow to turn it back on and then fight him!"=CAIN: Ohhh, that's the place across Beryl Bridge, right?"NANNA: I'll have Nostra tell him to unlock the door, so go quickly, okay~?"uCHARLOTTE: You're really gonna go have \PN fight some guy in hopes that he'll be able to turn the power on here?"!CHARLOTTE: ...Sure, why not."!Better than any idea I have.")We'll probably be fine waiting here."Go get 'em, chief."GCHARLOTTE: We can't move forward until we get the power back here."0Hurry up and kick Old Spooky's butt for us."6ANNA: I like Cain, he's so nice, and pretty, too!"#And his eyes are pitch-black--"Isn't that so cool?!"'NOEL: Anna, his eyes aren't black."ANNA: Yeah, they are!",They're like black holes into his soul~"NOEL: Sigh..."JANNA: Isn't it weird that Heather still hasn't caught her breath yet?"We didn't run that far..."'Does she have asthma or something?" NOEL: She seems fine to me."5NOEL: It's nice to finally be out of that place."<This is probably going to be an arduous journey though."QNOEL: You s