an't things just be normal and consistent and make sense?!"PI'll tell you what, after this I've had enough of random things in my life!"8You, too, Trainer, if you know what's good for you!"INext time someone asks you for a password, tell them "nodamageroll"!"EThat'll help make your life just a little less random, won't it!"Won't it?!!?!"Locked."/ACE: Ah, done in Apophyll already, are we?"1My, I've truly lost track of the schedule..."RThe true magician must not be late for their cues, or the illusion is ruined!"ZPity then, that for all this place's whimsy, it has only been a frustrating timesink."qEven I am bewildered at how long I must have spent wandering tunnels most labyrinthine in search of my muse."-And don't get me started on the smell..."LACE: But you are not here to listen to the complaints of your deceiver!"<You are here because you-- like I-- have been deceived!"^Recall, little hero: I said there was one piece of Borealis' data that surprised even me!"A PULSE in Byxbysion?"3Now who could've pulled that out of their hat?"`Few, to be sure-- and yet it wasn't one even on our radar, let alone a project we designed."6It seems the old fellow had done his own digging."-What could this mean for us, I wondered?"A tool?"A threat?"Loose ends required tying!"{And after a plethora of pondering, probing, and unpleasantly plodding through this perpetually perplexing purplesque place,"&I believe I have put a bow on it."3ACE: Yet, wherefore shalt I dither on as such?"4Where dithers doth dally, the enemy doth rally!"We are foes, you and I,">And yet for you, I've just the olive branch up my sleeve."ACE: Let us play a game!"To win, to wit--"IWe each go free and share in our knowledge as ships in the everdark!">Through the tides of conflict, we sail onward bow to bow,"And then, the crash."Bravo, little hero, bravo~">ACE: With a performance such as that, who could complain?"2Certainly not my higher-ups, that's for sure!"lThe wills above be done, but I would fain share with you my findings so that I may not bear them alone."=The PULSE is but a prototype, incomplete and indisposed!"How it came to be here--"^Well, that is a trick the wizard of these wastes is sure not to give up soon, even to me."LI did wonder whether it was hidden here by design or by carelessness..."But you know that phrase--"RNever attribute to malice that which is adequately explained by incompetence."2Regardless, the machine is entirely inactive."Utterly useless to us."'You may ignore it in its entirety!"3...And I know, little hero, those such as you."yWhen you are told not to do something, particularly if by an adversary, that only makes you want to do it even more.""No, that is not the way here."8Seek it out if you so please; it matters not to us."OBut you can consider the matter entirely optional, and otherwise resolved!"7And that, little friend, is a gold star guarantee~"aACE: Besides, the fewer people who have to deal with THAT creature, the better for us all..."TACE: No, the goose has been chased, and it is time for me to be well on my way."5You've other business in the area, have you not?"SYou look like the kind of sorts who could use a Gym Badge or two in your life.",Just over that hill-- a skip and a hop."/You can thank me for the directions later~"9...I only spent ages getting lost here, after all..."NACE: The folk who live here aren't the sort we'd make our targets anyway."yTopsy and turvy though this place may be, they've settled into it out of gratitude and desperation in equal measure.""We have no quarrel with them."6They live with the land-- rather than against it."<There is magic in nature too, and it must be protected."/That's all we really want, don't you know?""Until next time, little hero,"Snap, flash, and bang!"CAIN: So..."%They should be right in there...",But nothing bad is happening, right...?"..."VPart of me is dreading the chance that one of them might come outside and see me."6The other part of me is kind of hoping they will.