ver you get to a Gym, you can call in for advice!"Anyway..."&AME: So you're at Serra's estate?"]Right. Serra Voclain was once a famous model, so she's all about beauty and reflections."&Her Gym mirrors this-- literally."�Serra loves to play games with her mirrors, increasing Evasion, lowering Accuracy, and even performing critical attacks from hidden places."`In the Mirror Arena, changes to Evasion and Accuracy affect the frequency of critical hits."rBe careful not to take a surprise attack, but if you can boost your own stats, you'll be at an advantage too!"?Besides that, consider using beam and light-based attacks!"FThese moves can be reflected by the mirrors, and will always hit!"WOther light-based moves will be stronger too, including her signature Aurora Veil."YThe Defense boost is a lot to fight through, but I have faith you can break through!"Good luck!"7No one seems to be picking up at the Grand Hall..."FSERRA: Well, the good news is, the PokéMart isn't here any more."7...No telling where it's actually ended up though."Not far, probably."6And the bad news is that Bennett also isn't here.".He probably will be very far away though.":Studying with that stranger to join the Elite Four..."!If that pans out, wonderful."But what are the odds?"3No, I should be happy for my son, shouldn't I?"SERRA: I should be happy."CBut if you do run into him somewhere, please look out for him."WI'm sure he can take care of himself, but he doesn't always make the best choices."Then again, does anyone?"First Luna and Gardevoir."Now Bennett too."It's almost surreal."1All things do fade away in time, it seems..."+\PN obtained Field Effect Read-Out 30!"(Info on Mirror Arena now available!"Yes"NoIu;␀�[[*"�So I was just sitting there, enjoying a nice warm cup of Cherubi Mint Tea, and then suddenly, literally ALL the furniture in my apartment just disappeared."%Even the chair I was sitting on!"DI fell to the ground instantly and spilled tea all over myself!""This whole town has gone mad!"BI've been trying to find a pattern in the strange apparition."*Or disapparition, as the case may be."[As far as I can tell though, nothing is being created or destroyed, only moved around."ZSo all of this-- whatever this chaos is-- is just some sort of teleportation gimmick."Or so I think."OBut there's no way for me to tell when or where it's going to strike next."QUltimately, these random happenstances, though strange, are inconsequential."4The wheel of fate turns in unseen ways, always."This, we knew."&This is simply one more rotation."3Welcome! Would you like to rest your Pokémon?"3OK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."/Your Pokémon may be infected by PokéRus."kLittle is known about the PokéRus except that they are microscopic lifeforms that attach to Pokémon."BWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."+Here you go. We hope to see you again!"We hope to see you again!"<First, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."6Your Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."We hope you excel!"EAt least the disappearing things are entertaining and whimsical."*But the earthquakes are just jarring."	Ack!")My Pokémon are disobeying me again!"'How did I accidentally overlevel?!"VDang, last time someone asked me for a password, I should've told them "hardcap"!"aThat would've stopped my Pokémon from gaining EXP at a certain level instead of disobeying!"
