 random stuff everywhere."BI think it brings a much-needed sense of whimsy to the place."FThough it would be nice if the attendant would show up already..."2MCKREZZY: Hey, I already said, no autographs."+MCKREZZY: What the heck are you doin'?"LI'm definitely not gonna autograph your Pokémon, kid. Forget about it."MCKREZZY: Wait, what?" You got my Roggenrola back!"/Man, I'd given up on ever seeing it again."This is great!"NNow I can totally get back to working on my single, "Boldorian Rhapsody"!"*Sorry for being so dismissive before."#But, you know how fans can be."Well, maybe you don't."3Anyway, you're all right, kid. See you around."%MCKREZZY: You're all right, kid."'But you know what's not all right?"$The total lack of service here."MCKREZZY: Hey, what?"7Don't tell me you want an autograph now after all.")Tch, geez. You all are incorrigible."tAll right, since you did me the favor of turning my Roggenrola back over to me, I'll make an exception for you."Here you go, kid."1MCKREZZY: Seriously, no more of that though."7MCKREZZY: God, they really take forever here, huh?"Hey, you battle, right?"RFace off with me to kill some time. If you win, I'll give you something good."#MCKREZZY: Hell yeah! Shine on!"Hey, not bad.""MCKREZZY: Well, that was fun."AExcept for the whole losing part. Didn't really expect that."#A deal's a deal though. Catch."NMCKREZZY: Well, everything here has gone exactly how I didn't imagine it.".Better luck in your endeavors, starshine.""MCKREZZY: Tch, that's no fun."7MCKREZZY: Some vacation this has turned out to be."7I hope my family's having a better time than I am."5My nephew tends to get himself in trouble a lot."Oh well, he'll be fine."&All of my stuff-- I can't even..."ZUh... Hey, if you happen to see any of my stuff around, mind, like, bringing it back?"I think there was..."KMy bed, my cabinet, the TV, two bookshelves, two chairs and the table."/I would really, super duper appreciate it."qI'll have Kadabra follow your energy, so if you see anything, just touch it and we'll teleport it back here.""Looks like everything's back!"Well. Sort of everything."$This actually isn't my cabinet."�But whatever. I didn't have anything important in there anyway, and if anyone else has a problem with this, I'm sure we'll hear about it."Also, I found this in it.")You should take it for your trouble.")That's one of the new models, right?"rI hear that as long as it's on, it'll also prevent your Pokémon from levelling to the point of disobedience."Nifty, isn't it?"cThere was also a note in there that says "freeexpall" but I have no idea what that would mean."LAaaalso I found some money in there, but that can be our little secret."I like this cabinet."CSerra retired to a Gym Leader position after her son was born."=She didn't feel she could be a model anymore after that."+Incidentally, her son is a little odd."KAll he does is explore the forest or lock himself in his room all day."Karrablast"Shelmet"No thanks"Vanilla - $400"Chocolate - $700"Strawberry - $1000"Cancel"Vanilla - $1000"Yes"No"+Do you have a fossil for me to
