 a simple matter of a single owner knowing their worth, or I'm sure several conflicts would have been solved already."ADRIENN: I believe that."%It's plain that they hold power."{I had been wandering around down here for nearly an hour, yet I couldn't manage to open the doors at all without them."Just what is this place?"ORADOMUS: I believe that that answer will become clear as we press forward."4ADRIENN: Which brings us back to the ring, huh?"*One of you is definitely lying to me."But who?"OCAIN: I dunno what's up with Gardevoir, but El kidnapped her from Radomus."#Luna wants us to get her back!"6ADRIENN: Yes, that Luna girl he keeps mentioning."9Surely there's some way to prove one way or another?"*RADOMUS: Elementary, my dear Adrienn."Allow me."8RADOMUS: This is the ransom note left for me by El."Please, read it."@The others can attest to the fact that it is not a forgery."[ADRIENN: "To one Radomus Vanhanen... I have captured your precious 'Gossip Gardevoir'."ZShould you wish to see her again, you will return my daughter to me immediately. -El""}RADOMUS: If I were really so bad of a Trainer as to warrant the hate that Gardevoir confesses, would I have followed El here?"HCAIN: I'm not gonna lie-- you didn't seem too happy to go at first."RADOMUS: Yet here I am."+ADRIENN: None of this makes any sense.":CAIN: Right? But we're gonna get to the bottom of it!"5Or the top, since we seem to be going up, but..."!Well, bottom, top, whatever." I'm a switch; I don't care~"CRADOMUS: Again, I'm going to pretend that I didn't catch that."4ADRIENN: All right, let's go find out together.",All of us. Through the Ruby Door, then."?ADRIENN: \PN, would you do the honors as the ring- bearer?"!CAIN: Maaan, this is a mess."4It sounds like Adrienn's as confused as we are."LI'm really not sure if we can trust Radomus, but El is also suspicious."'RADOMUS: Is it only obvious to me?"+Well, I suppose that would make sense."CADRIENN: By the by, I prefer xe/xem/xyr or they/them pronouns."