 You here to get pumped up?")This place has the best "level-ups"!"+Whaddya mean you aren't here for that?"Everyone's here for that."That shit is POWERFUL.")Oh, huh. You're lookin' for someone?"_Well, I dunno about a girl, but I just saw some weird guy headin' up to the watering hole."/You could probably catch him if you hurry."DARM: Magma is strength!"#DARM: BRO! We gotta get jobs?!"That's BALLS."8But if everyone else is doing it, I guess I got to."AAll right-- I want the kinda job that I can get POWERFUL on."GI gotta get people to praise me like "YO how that dude so swole?!""QI don't have any qualifications besides my rippling pecs and bulging biceps."RAnd not even construction crews would take me. I break stuff, not make stuff!"LSo what's there left to do but be the muscle in the city streets, huh?!"TIf Maxwell's backing down from leading the Magma Gang, I'll do it in his stead!"Send out your Pokémon."...Understood."%You have no need to speak to me."(Cyndaquil waits calmly in the cage."ITRADER: You want Cyndaquil? I'll give it to you for nine Red Shards."Role Play"
