 That's all well and good, but perhaps we shouldn't chit-chat idly right on our enemy's doorstep."LUNA: Master is right."I wish to quit this place."CRADOMUS: It will not do to return to the Castle at this point."'At least, I will not be returning."JApologies, Cain, but we will not be able to have our battle just yet."1I have other business to attend to just now."4Though I do thank you for the lead from before."Gardevoir?"GARDEVOIR: Ta-ta, dears~"*Stay tuned for our next big entrance!"8CAIN: Wait, what do you mean 'Thanks for the lead'?"ECAIN: ...So, I guess they won't be answering that question then."=LUNA: Ahaha~ Master does love his mysteries, doesn't he?"+Perhaps it's better if he doesn't say.".LUNA: Hearts beat faster in the darkness."Do you know why?"3CAIN: Because it's better with the lights off?"LUNA: Oh, my.";Well, be that as it may, it wasn't quite my intention."IBut in a different vein, darkness is quick to fester in one's heart.".Tell me, \PN, are you afraid of the dark?"LUNA: Darkness is love."There's nothing to fear."0I invite you to discover that for yourself."LUNA: Good."6LUNA: Then why should you have distrusted Master?"Please, take this."=LUNA: With this, you will be able to enter Iolia Valley."As for how to find it..."9There is a single tree within my master's Labyrinth.">Just behind that, and you can figure out the rest, right?"XLUNA: The darkness in Master's heart bores a hole that I cannot hope to fill alone." But I can pretend, can't I?"\PN, I'll be waiting."\CAIN: Sooooo I have no idea what she meant by any of that, but I'm gonna get going too!"oSince Radomus flew the coop, I guess I'll see if I can give those guards at Agate a wake-up call in a bit."8I guess that's still on the other end of Route 1..."\If you're going to the labyrinth right away, wanna walk together until the road splits?"0CAIN: Then we depart at once, hand in hand!"%Metaphorically, if nothing else?"7Oh, and thanks for the save again, darling prince~"PCAIN: Our su