en, and even some adults, are scared of the darkness."Why is that, I wonder?"PIs it because they think that awful and sinister things come here to dwell?"BThere are too many of those in the light for that to be true."AOr perhaps they are simply afraid of their own imaginations."oDarkness is that which draws out the greatest potential, but for some, infinity can be a terrifying abyss."<Please, allow me to introduce you to an infinity, lost."=Scattered and fractured, it shall return piece by piece."Are you ready?"�You have overcome the gateway into the soul of eternity... Though its beauty is tarnished, your soul shines with hope. I pray you farewell."&LUNA: You fought especially well."I expected no less."$Now, I may present this to you."$\PN received the Eclipse Badge!"bLUNA: With the Eclipse Badge, Pokémon up to level 70 will trust you. Please treat them well."+Finally, I have one last gift for you."1Please use darkness' embrace as you see fit."*I shall be remaining here for a time."]I feel that I, like all the monsters of which children fear, shall be safer in the dark."OAs for you, did your friend not say that he would move towards Agate City?"wI know not what dreams mesmerize the station guards, but perhaps it is time for you to discover that for yourself."%I do hope we meet again someday."Until then, farewell."ILUNA: Did your friend not say that he would move towards Agate City?[%"%La Clé réagit avec le Cristal!"8LUNA: Je t'en prie, ne succombe pas à la rêverie."+C'est une chose que tu peux réaliser."Pouvons-nous commencer?"&LUNA: Il est parti, n'est-ce pas?"Fort bien." Reprenons depuis le début."=Bienvenue, \PN. Ravie que tu aies pu parvenir jusqu'ici."?Les enfants, ainsi que certains adultes, ont peur du noir."Pourquoi donc?"UEst-ce car ils pensent que de sinistres créatures s'y cachent pour y conspirer?"JTrop d'entre elles se montrent à la lumière pour que ce soit exact."MOu peut-être sont-ils simplement effrayés par leur propre imagination."|C'est d