".There are two kinds of plants on Route 2:"0Sleep Powder plants and Rage Powder plants."0They're just like the attacks Pokémon use!"YIf any Crustle get in your way, either put 'em to sleep, or rile 'em up and KO them!"PAlso, if one of them is totally unresponsive, try Rage Powder for that too!"KThrowing Sleep Powder on a wild Pokémon-- you can guess what happens."IBut Rage Powder will wake up sleeping Pokémon and make them attack!"EShoot! I sprained my ankle jumping across the wild Crustle here!"dHaha... Well, I guess that's what I get for shoving it into a hole in order to get across, huh?"Careful crossing Route 2!"/Some stones you can jump on aren't stable!"OThey'll spoil any powder you're holding, but some people have even fallen!"6Try your best to avoid unstable rocks, all right?"Now at: Agate Circus"Now at: Route 2."JRoute 2 is ahead, but you might need a Powder Vial to get through it!"UThe Powder Vial collects and stores various spores from large plants in Route 2."NIt can hold one use of two types of powder: Sleep Powder and Rage Powder."VRoute 2 is a rocky road, so you'll probably need those powders to help you cross."(The Pokémon will be happy to help!"$...With some peaceful coercion."However, there's one flaw:"XWhen carrying contained powder, be sure not to shake it too much, or it will spoil!"CAs such, try to avoid stepping anywhere with unstable footing."0Ask me again if you need a refresh, got it?">Please stay calm; it is still not safe to enter the city." Agate City is safe for now."OPlease report to us immediately if you find anything suspicious within it."sHey... I lost my parents when Agate City was shut down and now I'm all alone with no one to take care of me..."kIt's making me really sad, so do you think you could cheer me up by going to get me some cotton candy?"9Is that it? Did you bring that Cotton Candy for me?!"&\PN handed over the Cotton Candy."hWow! Thank you, you're the best! I feel a lot less sad about the untimely demise of my parents now!" ...But I'm still kinda sad."zYou know what would make me less sad? A balloon! Balloons really lift the spirits up! Would you go get me a balloon?!"vHuh? Oh, okay... I'll just go back to being really lonely and sad over here, all alone... with no cotton candy..."rHey... I lost my parents when Agate City was shutdown and now I'm all alone with no one to take care of me..."jIt's making me really sad so do you think you could cheer me up by going to get me some cotton candy?"&Wow, is that Air Balloon for me?!"%\PN handed over the Air Balloon."IOh my god, really? You're so cool! Yay, this balloon is the funnest!"fIt almost makes me forget all about how I'll never see my parents or any of my family ever again!"?Oh... Now I'm thinking about that. I feel really lonely..."2Hey! You know what might make me less lonely?"�If you brought me a Poké Doll from the High Striker! I know I couldn't win it, but you could, and that would stop me from crying myself to sleep every night!"}Oh... That's okay, I understand. I'll just be here, spirits deflating like a six-day-old balloon... forgotten... neglected..."I'm still sad...".Hey, did you get that Poké Doll for me?!"$\PN handed over the Poké Doll."Yay! You're the coolest!"%But you know what's even COOLER?"Ice cream!"EYou know, I haven't had ice cream since my mom disappeared and--"FLADY: There you are, sweetie, I've been looking all over for you!"KID: Umm... Hi, Mom..."It's uh... been a while."}LADY: What are you talking about? It's only been a little bit since you demanded I go off and buy the candy you wanted--"5Wait a second... you're acting suspicious again."KID: ..."ILADY: ...Young man, what have I told you about extorting strangers?!"5KID: Only do it to people who look like jerks..."yLADY: That's right, and this person seems like a nice respectable young Trainer-- again! That's it, you're grounded."SLADY: Sorry for the hassle... My son can get a little out of hand sometimes..."+Why don't you take this as an apo