tually went and took the barrier down?"XMaybe I can finally go up and ask someone from Team Meteor about their fashion now!"#Come to think of it, though..."_Maybe I'll wait until the rays of death and explosions stop coming from Labradorra to ask."Sorry, what?"1Team Meteor's been driven out of Labradorra?"/B-but I needed to ask them some questions!"DA girl's gotta get some new fashion inspiration from somewhere!"4These magazines just aren't cutting it anymore!"Haha, I mean..."The city's safe! Right..."Hey there! Trainer!"UListen, I've moved on from fashion. I'm going to be a radio star! Or star on TV!"3You think you could get me into the Nightclub?"#You've got connections, right?"I mean--"$Thank you for saving all of us!"0From totally-not-my-fashion-inspirations..."Oi, Trainer!"II've been cooped up this whole time-- can we finally get outta here?"�I've been itching to hike up Route 4 again, but we haven't even been able to leave our homes what with all those laser-whatchamacollits..."=You think this time that I can get all the way to Agate?"..."+Maybe that's not such a good idea now."Hail, Trainer!"VThanks to you, I've finally been able to get out and hike to the heart's content!""I'll go all the way to Agate!" No, all the way to Charous!"Oh, finally."UWe've been inside for so long, I was starting to forget what sunlight felt like!"*What do you mean I'm being dramatic?!"-How could you accuse me of such a thing?"I'm wounded!"
