Okay?"=I keep wandering over to peek, even though I shouldn't--"#But I'm just worried, I swear!"ANNA: Another! Another!""ANNA: Tell me more about Mom!"How did you two meet?":RADOMUS: I'm afraid I can't answer that one properly."&She met me long before I met her."+At first, it was a day like any other,"zAnd at second, I was being dragged away by a woman I'd never seen before, who seemed to already know my every secret,")As if I had told them to her myself."@I suspect that is something you can understand well enough."ANNA: Woah..."NOEL: This is pointless."NI don't know what I expected from finding our father, but it wasn't this."&RADOMUS: Can I ask you something?"ANNA: Of course!"YRADOMUS: Is there perhaps anything about me that's different from most other people?"=Something you might see that others don't, for instance."ANNA: Hmm..."4Aside from an amazing collection of hats, nope!"Not that I can tell!"5RADOMUS: I see... So that's the same as for her."CRADOMUS: I suppose the final battle will begin soon, won't it?"Anna is still absent."=I suspect she intends to keep it that way for some time."And with Noel...",I feel as if I am already in checkmate."<Any move I can take with him seems to be the wrong one."'But that is not a game I may quit."So, how to play..."RRADOMUS: Lost time cannot be recovered, but better times can always be found."hStill, I will be beyond content to play the role of the father I haven't been for as long as I may."=For the time being, I must entrust the rest to you, \PN.",SAPHIRA: Laura being safe isn't enough."!She should be here, with us."QIf ANYTHING happens to her under that boy's watch, he will dearly regret it.""CHARLOTTE: It was her choice."What's the big deal?"GIf she wants to prance off with some new boy toy, then forget her."She can."8In the meantime, maybe try not to have an aneurysm."%CHARLOTTE: And she's gone again."!Out to find Laura, no doubt."Guess I'll stay put here."`If she gets back and I'm gone, I'm pretty sure she'll just up and die of shock on the spot."Thanks, "Mom".",CHARLOTTE: You guys save the world yet?"If not, it's cool."Save some for me."Or let it burn."HI don't care all that much as long as the ones who matter are safe."lEVE: I've told some of the others already, but there's a few things you need to know about Team Meteor."|As time went on, Zero was increasingly ostracized from the proverbial inner circle, so there is much I cannot speak to."JHowever, I can tell you in depth about their remaining PULSE systems.")There are four you must be aware of:"8PULSE-Mime, PULSE-Clawitzer, PULSE2 and Arc- PULSE."8If you want to hear their details, ask me for them."0EVE: Which PULSE do you want to know about?"PThe goal of the PULSE-Mime project was to capture and protect a large area."eOriginally, the resulting barrier was intended to encapsulate both Labradorra and Calcenon City,"�But willful ignorance afforded me the opportunity to implement some "technological limitations", reducing its effective area to only one of the cities."{I would have liked to minimize it further, however it was difficult to implement such caveats with Zero policing our ideas."�The PULSE-Mime relies on Labradorra City's power grid to function, meaning its function has been preserved even after shutting off Calcenon's."�On a long range scale, the PULSE-Mime's capabilities are solely defensive, however in close quarters it is as capable of defending itself as any Pokémon."pThe barrier itself can only be permeated by authorized personnel as regulated by the machine system itself."iIn other words, the only way to get through it will be for someone on the inside to grant us access."eUnfortunately, even Lumi and I don't qualify to pass through it, as we were sharing Zero's body."ZThe PULSE-Clawitzer was intended to serve as high-powered super long range artillery."�In tandem with the original conception of the PULSE-Mime, it would have turned the Labradorra- Calcenon area into an undefeatable weapon."rFortunately, I was able to reduce the effective power and range through a series of serendipitous "mistakes"."@The attacks on Calcenon City were effectively an arms test."AI am personally grateful that the damage could be minimized."�The PULSE-Clawitzer was energized by Calcenon's power grid, meaning unless Meteor recaptures the station below, it is inoperational."yHowever, the Pokémon itself is alive and well within the barrier and continues to suffer the system's side effects."�I am relieved that Lumi is not around to hear me advise this, but the best course of mercy for that Pokémon would be to put it down entirely."jThe PULSE2 is an entirely separate line of PULSE systems created for mass production and portability."gWhen designing the PULSE2, I was permitted to make the safety of the affected Pokémon a priority,"PSo I am relieved to say that it is much less harmful than its predecessors."/In return, it is also much less effective."�Unlike the previous line, it is also capable of applying to any Pokémon, as opposed to the specific species it is constructed for."mThe PULSE2 does not cause mutations, but it also cannot amplify a Pokémon's strength to extreme levels."Its effect is two-fold:"DFirst, the Pokémon's abilities are enhanced by a small degree."�This is done by effectively maximizing what would otherwise be considered effort values, exceeding the maximum limit that most Pokémon can achieve."4Second, the Pokémon's free will is suppressed."KStolen Pokémon, for example, may be controlled without fail this way."kHowever, I believe the control function was intended as a preliminary trial for a different purpose..."OMany high ranking Meteors have treated their Pokémon with PULSE2s by now." Please prepare accordingly."iThe Arc-PULSE is an incomplete project combining the functions of the PULSE2 with the original line."^Using the foundation of the original PULSE system, it is designed for a specific species."5As you may conclude from the name, it is Arceus."�However, it is more akin to a PULSE2 in that it does not require a static location, and it contains a strong function to suppress a Pokémon's free will."UI cannot fully say what effects it would produce or if it would cause mutations,"KSince, as one might expect, Team Meteor lacks an Arceus to test it on."�Further, with the demands for power, portability and control that have been placed on the project, it requires a unique energy source."�Team Meteor lacks this as well, but I understand that their movements in Agate City have been dedicated to producing such a thing."The PULSE-Hypno was originally created to put Agate City to sleep and allow Team Meteor to freely search for this power source."5Its hypnotic control functions were added later."bStill, there is no evidence that a power source capable of fueling the machine exists at all."�Since that, the Arceus, and now my technical expertise are all absent from Team Meteor, I find it highly unlikely the project will ever be finished.")SERRA: "Happy little family", huh..."0Tch. I'm having these naive thoughts again."&Maybe I could stand to try again."We'll see, I guess."(SERRA: "Happy little family" huh...";SERRA: Geez, I feel like a high schooler or something."TNOEL: You'd think one would be less alone after finding their father, not more."%I guess that's not how it works."RADOMUS: Ah, \PN.":I see you were successful in obtaining another badge."FAs I ever am with your efforts, I am impressed but not surprised."-But pray tell, have you seen Anna about?"XShe said there was something she needed to do and made off alone in rather a haste.",She even insisted Noel not go with her."*I... wonder if this was for his sake.",NOEL: Why are you acting like this now?" RADOMUS: I beg your pardon?"Acting like what?"NOEL: Doting on me."Like Anna."4RADOMUS: Ah, she often takes this role for you?"NOEL: No, for you."You always focus on her."=RADOMUS: Ah, I was just worried, but I see your concern."II assure you, I don't