esigned to accommodate things such as official matches and large scale tournaments."uHowever, after Reborn's prior collapse and Yureyu's subsequent closure, Labradorra fell into a state of neglect."�The residential sector was purchased by Silph Co. and rebranded to Calcenon City, while the original competitive ward has remained largely unmaintained."7Perhaps this can be used to one party's advantage."tFLORINIA: Repeat trials remain inadvisable under the current conditions wherein relevant variables are unknown."GHARDY: We ain' gonna find out these variables by hangin' out here!"<HARDY: Yo, \PN! Just the man I wanted to see right now!"8HARDY: Yo, \PN! Just who I wanted to see right now!"EHARDY: Listen, mate, this bird found out what's up with my city."�FLORINIA: The aforementioned term continues to be unfit to apply to an individual who bears no resemblance to the avian species."cHARDY: Yeah, yeah, and your bro's not the foremost contender for the Douche of the Year Award.",Just tell \PN what you found out, aite?"FLORINIA: Very well."�A bidirectional comparison of radio output via frequency tracebacks confirms a confounding signal to be emitted by a nearby location."[Hypothesis: Target location is the source of the soporific waves affecting Agate City."9HARDY: Basically, she finally found the place, mate!"AI wanna get in there and rock their worlds once and for all!"BFLORINIA: Proposed procedure remains haphazardly inefficient."Previous incidences of individuals exiting the city have resulted in increasingly diminished numbers among the remaining group."-HARDY: That's exactly why we gotta roll!"NI know it's risky, but if we don't bust in there and find them, who will?"#You agree with me, right, \PN?" HARDY: I knew you'd get it!"YFLORINIA: Nevertheless, reckless enthusiasm holds no effect on established outcomes."HARDY: For real?"CFLORINIA: Indeed, caution is a necessary requisite to success."IRepetition of processes naturally results in repetition of outcomes.