 S-so, um, where do we start?"SHELLY: Hey, isn't this..."H-here."$It's, um, it's from the Circus."0It says it's for Reborn League challengers."That's you, so..."JSHELLY: It must have been mailed here after this house was abandoned."A-anyway..."Books!"Let's start at the books!"4Books are always safe, even when they're scary!"+SHELLY: It looks like this is a diary."KWell, since the house is abandoned, it's probably okay to read, right?"JPlus it's not like reading diaries ever really got anyone in trouble."Okay, here goes."FIt looks like this diary belongs to someone named Lumina Seijaya?"Um... "Dear Diary,"'Now Mama has gotten very sick too."mWe moved to Ametrine to get away from the polluted city, but the doctor says it may already be too late."0I don't want her to leave me like Papa did.".Please, please, please don't let her go.""U-um... Next entry.""Dear Diary,"%Mama is with Papa now after all."%Evelynn and I are all alone now."wShe's doing her best to take care of us, and the city is helping as much as they can, but it's still really tough."!I don't want to be alone...""I have bad news."^Evelynn called the doctor and he says that I've developed the same disease that Mama had."NWe knew it ran in the family, but nobody thought it would happen so soon."Diary, I'm really scared."[The doctor says I still have at least a few years, but I don't want to die that young."I don't want to go...".I'm not ready to face Mama and Papa yet.""I feel so guilty.",Evelynn has been worried sick about me."uShe's been staying up all night, always reading and researching to see if there's anything that could be a cure."cI'm really glad that she cares about me so much, but I don't want her to push herself too far."What if she gets sick too?"/Maybe it would be better if I died sooner."2I would be less of a burden on Eve that way.""2Evelynn has been working herself to the bone."cShe's building some kind of machine that she says will enhance the healing powers of Pokémon."kShe 