ques peuvent temporairement créer des Terrains en plus leur effet primaire."Ces attaques sont..."=Déluge Plasmique, Renversement eeeet... Brume je crois?" Oui! Ok, je le savais bien."�Les Terrains ne seront pas créés si le Pokémon qui utilise ces attaques tient une Pierre Stase, mais ils seront prolongés si ils tiennent une... Roche Ampli."*Oui! Je vais défoncer cette interro!"Hein? Qu'y a t-il?"%C'est de la part de cette fille?"?Je vois... Je n'avais aucune idée qu'elle ressentait ça."+Eh bien, c'est très flatteur, mais..."KJe crois que je vais devoir descendre pour lui dire ce que je ressens."=Oh, je vais pas lui faire des faux espoirs, t'inquiète!"/Enfin bref, tu devrais garder le chocolat."HCe serait bizarre si je le mangeais tout en lui mettant un râteau."*Hé, tu as déjà pensé à t'enfuir?"WVivre en se reposant seulement sur tes propres forces et celles de tes Pokémon...":C'est romantique, pas vrai? J'arrête pas d'y penser."#Tu devrais garder ce chocolat.;["+\PN obtained Field Effect Read-Out 12!"(Info on Desert Field now available!"mOkay, one more time. Some moves can temporarily create Field Effects in addition to their regular usage."These moves are..."3Ion Deluge, Topsy Turvy aaaand... was it Mist?"Yes! Okay, I knew it."�Field Effects won't be created if the user of those moves is holding an Everstone, but it'll be extended if they hold an... Amplifield Rock?"%Got it! I'm gonna ace this test!"Huh? What's this?"This is from that girl?".I see... I had no idea she felt this way."$Well, that's flattering, but..."AI guess I'll have to go down and be straight with her later."-Oh, maybe that's a poor choice of words?"0Anyway, you should hang onto the chocolate."8It would be rude if I ate it and then let her down.",Hey, you ever think about running away?"ETo live solely on your own strength and that of your Pokémon..."@It's romantic, right? I can't get that idea out of my head.")You should hang onto that chocolate.Iu;␀u:[[�"%Soup of the Day: Corphish Bisque"&Soup of the Day: Clamperl Chowder"+Soup of the Day: Farfetch'd Onion Soup".Soup of the Day: Roasted Red Cherubi Soup"+Soup of the Day: Combusken Noodle Soup"-Soup of the Day: Oddish Leaf Lentil Soup"&Soup of the Day: Basculin Borscht"Nope, there's nothing!"Oh, wait!"Nope, still nothing."Good day!"BI am hoping you are to enjoy everything we are have to offer!"5As the head cook here, I am delighting to serve!"1So, please to pull up a seat and digging in!"Hello, customer!"mPlease have a seat! We are in troubled but we will giving you the best service we are to have available!"/Oh, you are not here to do the eating now?".Then maybe I can asking something of you!">You look, our delivering boy is doing the sickness today!"&And so, we are lowering supplies!"eIf you are having time, I would be much obliging for you to collect some grocering items for us."ZYou can do the talking to my assistant chef for the full list of items to recovering."^If you can doing this thing for us, we will give you a sharing of the food, on the house!" My friend! You have did it!"nThanks to you, I have been able to creating a marveling of dishes to sate my customers' utmost desirings!"RIt is but a small piece of my appreciating, but please, you are accept these!"*I hope you will dining with us again!"It will be much obliging!"Welcome to the Spyce!"%Please feel free to have a seat."+We're also now accepting applications."ZFeel free to grab one from the other counter if you're interested in a position here."LThe head chef will be delighted! Go ahead speak to him for your reward!"DHello! Special guests and staff only beyond this point, please."%Ah, you're our stand-in courier?"BThere are currently \v[329] items left to be gathered for us:"Honey!".Oh! You've got the Honey! I'll take that!"Tiny Mushroom!"6Oh! You've got the Tiny Mushroom! I'll take that!"Balm Mushroom!"6Oh! You've got the Balm Mushroom! I'll take that!"Slowpoke Tail!"6Oh! You've got the Slowpoke Tail! I'll take that!"White Herb!"3Oh! You've got the White Herb! I'll take that!"Stick!".Oh! You've got the Stick! I'll take that!"Sweet Heart!"4Oh! You've got the Sweet Heart! I'll take that!"Moomoo Milk!"4Oh! You've got the Moomoo Milk! I'll take that!"Energy Root!"4Oh! You've got the Energy Root! I'll take that!"Custap Berry!"5Oh! You've got the Custap Berry! I'll take that!"Whipped Dream!"6Oh! You've got the Whipped Dream! I'll take that!"Shoal Salt!"3Oh! You've got the Shoal Salt! I'll take that!"!Ah, so you've gotten it all!"7When you find them, just bring them on over to me!"'Thank you very much for your help!"!Care for a refreshing drink?"!Oh, you had an order placed?"For 'Laura'..."Oh, yes, right here!"Six Bubble Teas to go."|These aren't on the normal menu, as they're a specialty from a different region, but we were able to make them as requested!"-Don't worry-- it's all already paid for.">Have a good day, and we hope we could Spyce up your life~""I'm gonna need another one..."These days, who doesn't?"$I'll drink to the city, Reborn!"%Hit me up with another cold one!";The food here is just good, but the dessert is DIVINE."0These Sweet Hearts they sell-- scrumptious!"OCan't get 'em hardly anywhere else, either, unless you make them yourself."5Actually, my niece has been learning to do that."IBrilliant girl, she is. Her cooking tastes just as good as anything."kI hear she's been busy watching after the Onyx Trainers' School Gym since Florinia's been away though."7You think she's got time to make one for me still?"-Ah, well. That's what this place is for!"@Bruh, I've been doing research on these weird rocks, right?"'So like, there's these rocks, bro."=And they can make Pokémon moves last longer. Like, bro!"Trick Room? Sweet!"Field Effects? Real!"Gravity? Duuuude."0The fuck kind of rocks affect gravity, bro."#Tellin' ya, this shit is dope."QHere's to the last bit of solace, and the last bit of pocket money I've got!"?Here's to clean water and smooth sailing from here on out!"0This place really knows how to serve it up!"bI guarantee that you won't find anywhere else in Reborn that serves Slowpoke Tails THIS good!"<Though, can't blame 'em, considering how rare they are."GMy buddy down at the pier makes a pretty penny sellin' the things."%Maybe I oughta get in on that..."Cheers!">The Balm Mushrooms this place serves are really the best!"+Where do you think those grow, anyway?""Maybe in the woods somewhere?"Howdy, Trainer."KDid you know that Wild Pokémon each have their own personalities too?"tI don't mean natures or anything like that, but every Pokémon in the wild has a favorite Move it likes to use."NWon't matter a lick once you actually catch 'em, but I think that's neat!""Don't you think that's neat?!"CA stack of job applications for The Spyce sits on the counter."Take one?"-Wheeeewie, I could not eat another bite!"hTell you what, kiddo, these folks ain't stingy with their servings if you're paying the good price."JIt'll be tough to finish all this right now-- much too full for that!"	See?"That's just how full I am!"MAnyway, it's not like just anyone'd let you have their Leftovers, right?"FI think I'll just have a mild food coma before I mosey on back..."6TAKA: So I figured up what was up with the drier."DI had to ask my neighbor why my clothes were always still wet--"NBut did you know that tumble dry doesn't actually use heat to dry them???"~I thought, "Oh yeah, I know this, driers totally make the clothes tumble when they spin so that's probably the option I want,""(Apparently that's not how it works."*She was really nice about it, though."!A little confused, but nice!"8Man, I feel bad for worrying her the other night..."MI was trying to make some food and accidentally melted one of the, uh...""The plastic cooking thingies?"A spatula?"#Is that technically a spatula?"�Well, I left it on the edge of the pan, so then when I picked it up, a bit of plastic dripped down on me, and I accidentally yeeted the whole thing,"1And it hit the wall and knocked out a light."�She heard the glass break and came to check on me and I kinda tripped over my words explaining what happened, cuz I was still in shock..."l...And I forgot I was cooking, so the smoke alarm went off while she was still standing in the doorway."RUh, but she helped me clean everything up even though it was almost midnight.";...Cuz I kinda woke up at like, four in the afternoon."1I should like, buy her flowers or something."Or like,"A casserole?"NThat's a normal thing to bring your neighbor as a thanksorry gift, right?"<Actually, I'm not even sure what a casserole is, but..." Maybe I'll try cooking one?"3Wait, \PN, would you help me make a casserole?"8If you're around, maybe I won't burn it... Ahaha..."+TAKA: Hey, I'm glad we went out today."This is nice."#All of this really has been..."II mean, I know I'm not great at this whole living on my own thing..."ELuna, Elias, or the grunts usually did the cooking and cleaning.">But I would've never gotten the chance to do this before."XEven just waking up at whatever time I want, as opposed to for the morning drill..."It's really nice."0I didn't think I'd ever be able to do this.";Thanks for being here with me through all my disaster~"Yes"No[�"%Soupe du jour: Bisque au Corayon"'Soupe du jour: Coquiperl bouillies"0Soupe du jour: Soupe à l'oignon Canarticho"%Soupe du jour: Potage au Ceribou"4Soupe du jour: Soupe aux nouilles et au Galifeu"4Soupe du jour: Potage aux feuilles de Mystherbe"%Soupe du jour: Borscht Bargantua"Non, y a R!"Oh, attends!"Nan, toujours R."Bonjour!"EJ'espère que vous appréciez tout ce que nous pouvons proposer!"GJe suis le chef cuisinier ici, et c'est un plaisir de vous servir!"DAlors, n'hésitez pas à vous asseoir et à vous faire plaisir!"Bienvenue!"Prenez un siège, je vous en prie! Nous avons une petite pénurie mais nous vous offrirons le meilleur service disponible!"JOh, mais peut-être n'êtes-vous pas là ici pour déguster nos mets?"4Alors, peut-être que vous pourriez nous aider!"AVoyez-vous, notre livreur est en congé maladie aujourd'hui!"#Ainsi, nous manquons de stock!"tSi vous avez du temps, je serai très reconnaissant si vous pouviez aller chercher quelques denrées pour nous."UAllez en parler à mon assistant pour la liste complète des aliments manquants."sSi vous pouvez faire ça pour nous, nous vous proposerons quelques restes de repas. C'est la maison qui offre!""Vous avez réussi! Grandiose!"sGrâce à vous, j'ai pu créer des merveilleux plats pour la satiété de mes clients toujours plus désireux!"YC'est bien peu pour exprimer ma reconnaissance, mais acceptez ceci, je vous en prie!"6J'espère que vous dînerez chez nous de nouveau!"+Ce serait un plaisir de vous recevoir!"Bienvenue au Pimenté!"#Asseyez-vous, je vous en prie."!Nous recrutons en ce moment."jN'hésitez pas à prendre une annonce à l'autre comptoir si ça vous intéresse de travailler ici..."?Le chef cuistot sera ravi! Va le voir pour ta récompense!"dBonjour! Seulement quelques invités et le personnel sont autorisés à passer par là, navré."/Ah, vous êtes notre service de livraison?"AVous devez encore rassembler \v[329] ingrédients pour nous:"Du Miel!"*Oh! Vous avez le Miel! Je prends ça!"Un Petit Champi!"2Oh! Vous avez le Petit Champi! Je prends ça!"Un Champi Suave!"2Oh! Vous avez le Champi Suave! Je prends ça!"Une Queue Ramoloss!"4Oh! Vous avez la Queue Ramoloss! Je prends ça!"Une Herbe Blanche!"2Oh! Vous avez l'Herbe Blanche! Je prends ça!"Un Poireau!"-Oh! Vous avez le Poireau! Je prends ça!"Un Chococœur!"0Oh! Vous avez le Chococœur! Je prends ça!"Du Lait Meumeu!"1Oh! Vous avez le Lait Meumeu! Je prends ça!"Une Racinénergie!"5Oh! Vous avez la Racine Énergie! Je prends ça!"Une Baie Chérim!"2Oh! Vous avez la Baie Chérim! Je prends ça!"Un Chantibonbon!"2Oh! Vous avez le Chantibonbon! Je prends ça!"Du Sel Tréfonds!"3Oh! Vous avez le Sel Tréfonds! Je prends ça!"&Ah, vous les avez tous attrapés!".Quand vous les trouverez, amenez-les moi!"