is-tu que les Pokémon Sauvages ont eux aussi leurs propres personnalités?"mJe ne parle pas de nature, mais chaque Pokémon sauvage a une préférence dans l'Attaque qu'il utilise."^Ça n'aura plus d'importance une fois que tu l'auras attrapé, mais je trouve ça stylé!"%Tu trouves pas ça trop stylé?!"NUne pile d'annonces d'emploi pour Le Pimenté est posée sur le comptoir."En prendre une?"6Pfouuuuah, je peux pas avaler une miette de plus!"OTu veux qu'j'te dise? Dans ce resto-là, t'as à grailler pour ton argent."EJ'vais même pas pouvoir tout finir! J'suis complètement plein!"Tiens, regarde!"*Mon estomac est plein à en éclater!"FMais j'crois pas que tu vas pouvoir gratter des Restes comme ça."WJ'vais aller faire un p'tit somme pour digérer, puis je reviendrai m'empiffrer..."6TAKA: So I figured up what was up with the drier."DI had to ask my neighbor why my clothes were always still wet--"NBut did you know that tumble dry doesn't actually use heat to dry them???"~I thought, "Oh yeah, I know this, driers totally make the clothes tumble when they spin so that's probably the option I want,""(Apparently that's not how it works."*She was really nice about it, though."!A little confused, but nice!"8Man, I feel bad for worrying her the other night..."MI was trying to make some food and accidentally melted one of the, uh...""The plastic cooking thingies?"A spatula?"#Is that technically a spatula?"�Well, I left it on the edge of the pan, so then when I picked it up, a bit of plastic dripped down on me, and I accidentally yeeted the whole thing,"1And it hit the wall and knocked out a light."�She heard the glass break and came to check on me and I kinda tripped over my words explaining what happened, cuz I was still in shock..."l...And I forgot I was cooking, so the smoke alarm went off while she was still standing in the doorway."RUh, but she helped me clean everything up even though it was almost midnight.";...Cuz I kinda woke up at like, four in the afternoon."1I should like, buy her flowers or something."Or like,"A casserole?"NThat's a normal thing to bring your neighbor as a thanksorry gift, right?"<Actually, I'm not even sure what a casserole is, but..." Maybe I'll try cooking one?"3Wait, \PN, would you help me make a casserole?"8If you're around, maybe I won't burn it... Ahaha..."+TAKA: Hey, I'm glad we went out today."C'est sympa."#All of this really has been..."II mean, I know I'm not great at this whole living on my own thing..."ELuna, Elias, or the grunts usually did the cooking and cleaning.">But I would've never gotten the chance to do this before."XEven just waking up at whatever time I want, as opposed to for the morning drill..."It's really nice."0I didn't think I'd ever be able to do this.";Thanks for being here with me through all my disaster~"Oui"Non;[�"%Soup of the Day: Corphish Bisque"&Soup of the Day: Clamperl Chowder"+Soup of the Day: Farfetch'd Onion Soup".Soup of the Day: Roasted Red Cherubi Soup"+Soup of the Day: Combusken Noodle Soup"-Soup of the Day: Oddish Leaf Lentil Soup"&Soup of the Day: Basculin Borscht"Nope, there's nothing!"Oh, wait!"Nope, still nothing."Good day!"BI am hoping you are to enjoy everything we are have to offer!"5As the head cook here, I am delighting to serve!"1So, please to pull up a seat and digging in!"Hello, customer!"mPlease have a seat! We are in troubled but we will giving you the best service we are to have available!"/Oh, you are not here to do the eating now?".Then maybe I can asking something of you!">You look, our delivering boy is doing the sickness today!"&And so, we are lowering supplies!"eIf you are having time, I would be much obliging for you to collect some grocering items for us."ZYou can do the talking to my assistant chef for the full list of items to recovering."^If you can doing this thing for us, we will give you a sharing of the food, on the house!" My friend! You have did it!"nThanks to you, I have been able to creating a marveling of dishes to sate my customers' utmost desirings!"RIt is but a small piece of my appreciating, but please, you are accept these!"*I hope you will dining with us again!"It will be much obliging!"Welcome to the Spyce!"%Please feel free to have a seat."+We're also now accepting applications."ZFeel free to grab one from the other counter if you're interested in a position here."LThe head chef will be delighted! Go ahead speak to him for your reward!"DHello! Special guests and staff only beyond this point, please."%Ah, you're our stand-in courier?"BThere are currently \v[329] items left to be gathered for us:"Honey!".Oh! You've got the Honey! I'll take that!"Tiny Mushroom!"6Oh! You've got the Tiny Mushroom! I'll take that!"Balm Mushroom!"6Oh! You've got the Balm Mushroom! I'll take that!"Slowpoke Tail!"6Oh! You've got the Slowpoke Tail! I'll take that!"White Herb!"3Oh! You've got the White Herb! I'll take that!"Stick!".Oh! You've got the Stick! I'll take that!"Sweet Heart!"4Oh! You've got the Sweet Heart! I'll take that!"Moomoo Milk!"4Oh! You've got the Moomoo Milk! I'll take that!"Energy Root!"4Oh! You've got the Energy Root! I'll take that!"Custap Berry!"5Oh! You've got the Custap Berry! I'll take that!"Whipped Dream!"6Oh! You've got the Whipped Dream! I'll take that!"Shoal Salt!"3Oh! You've got the Shoal Salt! I'll take that!"!Ah, so you've gotten it all!"7When you find them, just bring them on over to me!"'Thank you very much for your help!"!Care for a refreshing drink?"!Oh, you had an order placed?"For 'Laura'..."Oh, yes, right here!"Six Bubble Teas to go."|These aren't on the normal menu, as they're a specialty from a different region, but we were able to make them as requested!"-Don't worry-- it's all already paid for.">Have a good day, and we hope we could Spyce up your life~""I'm gonna need another one..."These days, who doesn't?"$I'll drink to the city, Reborn!"%Hit me up with another cold one!";The food here is just good, but the dessert is DIVINE."0These Sweet Hearts they sell-- scrumptious!"OCan't get 'em hardly anywhere else, either, unless you make them yourself."5Actually, my niece has been learning to do that."IBrilliant girl, she is. Her cooking tastes just as good as anything."kI hear she's been busy watching after the Onyx Trainers' School Gym since Florinia's been away though."7You think she's got time to make one for me still?"-Ah, well. That's what this place is for!"@Bruh, I've been doing research on these weird rocks, right?"'So like, there's these rocks, bro."=And they can make Pokémon moves last longer. Like, bro!"Trick Room? Sweet!"Field Effects? Real!"Gravity? Duuuude."0The fuck kind of rocks affect gravity, bro."#Tellin' ya, this shit is dope."QHere's to the last bit of solace, and the last bit of pocket money I've got!"?Here's to clean water and smooth sailing from here on out!"0This place really knows how to serve it up!"bI guarantee that you won't find anywhere else in Reborn that serves Slowpoke Tails THIS good!"<Though, can't blame 'em, considering how rare they are."GMy buddy down at the pier makes a pretty penny sellin' the things."%Maybe I oughta get in on that..."Cheers!">The Balm Mushrooms this place serves are really the best!"+Where do you think those grow, anyway?""Maybe in the woods somewhere?"Howdy, Trainer."KDid you know that Wild Pokémon each have their own personalities too?"tI don't mean natures or anything like that, but every Pokémon in the wild has a favorite Move it likes to use."NWon't matter a lick once you actually catch 'em, but I think that's neat!""Don't you think that's neat?!"CA stack of job applications for The Spyce sits on the counter."Take one?"-Wheeeewie, I could not eat another bite!"hTell you what, kiddo, these folks ain't stingy with their servings if you're paying the good price."JIt'll be tough to finish all this right now-- much too full for that!"	See?"That's just how full I am!"MAnyway, it's not like just anyone'd let you have their Leftovers, right?"FI think I'll just have a mild food coma before I mosey on back..."6TAKA: So I figured up what was up with the drier."DI had to ask my neighbor why my clothes were always still wet--"NBut did you know that tumble dry doesn't actually use heat to dry them???"~I thought, "Oh yeah, I know this, driers totally make the clothes tumble when they spin so that's probably the option I want,""(Apparently that's not how it works."*She was really nice about it, though."!A little confused, but nice!"8Man, I feel bad for worrying her the other night..."MI was trying to make some food and accidentally melted one of the, uh...""The plastic cooking thingies?"A spatula?"#Is that technically a spatula?"�Well, I left it on the edge of the pan, so then when I picked it up, a bit of plastic dripped down on me, and I accidentally yeeted the whole thing,"1And it hit the wall and knocked out a light."�She heard the glass break and came to check on me and I kinda tripped over my words explaining what happened, cuz I was still in shock..."l...And I forgot I was cooking, so the smoke alarm went off while she was still standing in the doorway."RUh, but she helped me clean everything up even though it was almost midnight.";...Cuz I kinda woke up at like, four in the afternoon."1I should like, buy her flowers or something."Or like,"A casserole?"NThat's a normal thing to bring your neighbor as a thanksorry gift, right?"<Actually, I'm not even sure what a casserole is, but..." Maybe I'll try cooking one?"3Wait, \PN, would you help me make a casserole?"8If you're around, maybe I won't burn it... Ahaha..."+TAKA: Hey, I'm glad we went out today."This is nice."#All of this really has been..."II mean, I know I'm not great at this whole living on my own thing..."ELuna, Elias, or the grunts usually did the cooking and cleaning.">But I would've never gotten the chance to do this before."XEven just waking up at whatever time I want, as opposed to for the morning drill..."It's really nice."0I didn't think I'd ever be able to do this.";Thanks for being here with me through all my disaster~"Yes"No0Iu;␀�c[[�"=You shoulda seen this place before the water cleared up."OWe'd clean up the walls, and then they'd just be grimy again the next day."7What a nightmare. I'm thankful it pulled together."SDon't take this the wrong way, because I'm glad the city's looking better now."/But on the real, it doesn't feel the same."WWe used to own these streets. Now everything's wrapped up in order and perfection."No thanks."IThis city is still far from the technological paradise I dream of..."%But it'll do for the time being."cSo much to do now! Houses to refurnish, a new market to visit, and I still have work tomorrow!"qWho knew that all it would take to make the plants here bloom again was clean water and some Pokémon magic?"*And a bit of elbow grease, of course!"turbo thrusters: ACTIVATE"+Hey, Trainer. We fought before, right?"*You only had one Badge then. And now?"Sheesh.":Makes me feel a little better about getting thrashed."If only I had known."8This city was always marvelous beneath the surface."AIt only took everyone's help to bring it out into the light."!To go some place far away..."That sounds nice.":I want to go somewhere with open seas, shining sun..."+And most importantly, you, my darling."AAfter the Grandview Station reopens, let's leave this place."HI never realized how much I wanted to leave until I wasn't able to."<Now that I can again, I don't want to miss that chance."ZImagine being able to make an entirely rebuilt city in such a short amount of time..."+The power of technology is incredible!";Trainer, would you like to hear something fascinating?"=For a long time, I've been researching Hidden Abilities."{In most regions, it's very rare that Pokémon in the wild have different Abilities, but in Reborn, it's almost commonplace."I wanted to know, why?"3The truth is, I still haven't found an answer."�For a while, my hypothesis was that pollution and radiation from Reborn City was prompting rogue genetic mutations in Pokémon of all kinds."FThis renovation project provided the perfect chance to test this."bAfter all, we've closed most of the wasteful factories, and cleaned up our act significantly."WBy now, Reborn produces only a small bit more pollution than any other major city."�If my theory were correct, then we should have seen a decline in the number of Pokémon with alternate Abilities and coloration."@But surprisingly, nothing with regards to that has changed!"rEven among newborn Pokémon, the difference in mutations between then and now is statistically insignificant."&So, I must find a new hypothesis."}Could past radiation produce lingering epigenetic changes? Could there be some other energy source hidden near the city?"_Maybe it could even be the work of a legendary Pokémon! Arceus or Rayquaza, for instance!"CNo matter the case, I will definitely find the answer one day!"IFor a long time, I've been researching Hidden-- Oh, what? You don't?"Well, uh... Okay."Can you hear the voices?"?"Thank you", they command me to whisper, "For everything.""*<>- Grandview Avenue\n^ - Opal Bridge">TESLA: Oh, are you on a stroll through the Opal Ward too?"qI'm here for some work and I decided it'd be fun to turn the experience into a mini vacation with my family!"+My family being my little girl, Amber."PAMBER: I'm not little anymore... I'm twelve now, you don't have to baby me!"I wish Dad was here..."pTESLA: Yes, your father would have a nice time for once if he wasn't so obsessed trying to cause trouble..."<That man... I don't know what I'm going to do with him."BOh, I'm so sorry to take up your time with all this nonsense!"ILet me treat you to something for all of that... Hm.... Let's see..."TESLA: Ah-hah!"PThe vendor down by Obsidia gave me an extra bit of cotton candy by mistake."Here, you can have it!"7TESLA: Please, have a wonderful rest of your day~!"@TESLA: You look like you've been traveling for ages, hun..."UYou better make sure you're eating properly-- And hydrating as much as possible!"JAlso getting enough sleep. It's good for your skin and mental health!"4And make sure you're taking your vitamins too--"EAMBER: Mom... Give it a rest. They didn't ask for your advice..."KTESLA: Oh, true! I'm so sorry! I can get carried away pretty easily..."!Please have a wonderful day!"5Hey there! Can I interest you in some ice cream?"AMBER: ..."#Can I help you with something?"!TESLA: Amber, don't be rude!"IAMBER: I'm the rude one? This adult is the one talking to a child..."$TESLA: I'm sure they mean well."AMBER: Sure..."(Anyway, I'm Amber. I wanna go home."#TESLA: But we just got here..."CAMBER: Yeah, but it's like... I don't know this place, y'know?"MI've never been this far from the resort. I dunno, I just wanna go home."8TESLA: That's the fun about visiting somewhere new!"*You can explore and see the sights..."FFind foods you've never even heard of! The sky's the limit, dear!"SAMBER: I am pretty hungry... All I've had were Red Hots from that candy store."4They were fine and all, but I want actual food.">TESLA: Okay! We can go somewhere soon! Your choice, okay?":AMBER: We passed this place that looked kinda good..."BI think it was called the "The Spyce" or something like that."ATESLA: Let's have a nice meal there then. That sounds great."8AMBER: Hm... Okay! That sounds nice... Thanks, Mom!"GOh, sorry but you can't come with. This is for me and my mom only."=TESLA: Oh Amber... Please don't be so rude all the time."9AMBER: Hey, I'm not rude to you! Most of the time..."MI just don't trust anyone else, that's all. Don't take it so personally."TESLA: Sigh..."7KIXUR: We're on a quest to build the perfect city!"/Always happy to help when I can, stranger."sIf we all do just a little bit of that here and there, maybe we'll find a world worth sticking around for yet."UHere lies inscribed the names of the many hands who helped to sculpt our city..."
