ul thing for both of us. I'm really not a fan of blaming innocents."*Do you wanna take this as an apology?"bMy brother works at the cycle shop up here. He gave us that for a present for my little girl."CUnfortunately, she... didn't survive that whole mess in Beryl."XShe was reading in her room, and then the plants broke through the wall. She was..."...Nevermind."FI don't want to think about it. Please, just take this off of me."Sorry.",Growlithe is dutifully waiting outside.",Well, this city's really come together.")Not that I can claim any part in it.""Perhaps it's too late though.":Ehh? They're still looking for help at the Coral Gym?"Hrmm! All right!"ILooks like it's time for this old bird to fly into action after all!"+Watch out, Reborn! I'm comin' for you!"$<- Peony Circle\n^v -4th Street"#>- Crocus Road\n^v -4th Street"(<- Hydrangea Street\n^v -5th Street"$<- Dahlia Street\nv -5th Street"%<>- Dahlia Street\nv -4th Street")<>- Hydrangea Street\n^v -4th Street"lARCHER: I'm gonna leave dealing with her to you, \PN. I'll stand guard and make sure no one interferes."nMAXWELL: The floor is yours, \PN. Go show her what 'glory' means. I'll make sure no one gets in your way."`ARCHER: Well done. I do believe that will be sufficient to see her excised from 7th Street."|I won't keep you any longer, but one gift, from me to you. A member of the Aqua Gang should naturally find this useful."!ARCHER: I'll see you around."xMAXWELL: That? Was hilarious. Good show! I bet she won't be showing her tail around down there for quite some time."=Hey, thanks for your help. I have one more gift for you."bMAXWELL: Not bad for a group like ours, yeah? I'll see you on the flip-side. For glory, baby!"{Oh, if I only have a few more years left to live, I'm glad I could spend them here, seeing what this place has become."Hey, did you know?"qThe winds in Reborn are sometimes so strong that they allow Flying-type Pokémon to ignore their weaknesses!"MAnd now with all these flowers around the 