[[ "AHowdy! If your home is in need of repairs, just let me know!"VAll I ask is that you pay it forward. That's how things go around here, you know?"_This place has been a lot quieter ever since that business in Rhodochrine came to a close."HShame, I was thinking I might have fun rising up to stop it myself."9I'm lucky that my part of Beryl survived the damage."fNot only did I get to stay in my home, but I also got free upgrades when the restoration started!"/It's about time this place was patched up!"kBeryl was one of the first wards we worked on as a massive project, but even then it took sooooo long."ZIf you think all this happened overnight, you're crazy, no matter what it seems like!"/<- Little Poe Street\n^v - Platinum Street",<- Kingsbury Street\nv - Emerald Street"'Something unseeable is in the way."\PN used the Silvon Scope."$The startled Pokémon attacked!"9<- Stoker Road\n^ - Platinum Street\n>- Beryl Bridge"Much has changed."!I do not know this city now."That is its strength."'The past is not worth clinging to." Not when the future awaits."/Take this from me-- a memento of the past.",It is something like a good luck charm.",May it bring new things into your life."Most things can be remade."Homes, people..."But not lives."#Those are our own to treasure.[ "JBonjour! Si votre logement a besoin de travaux, faites-le moi savoir!"`Tout ce qu'on demande, c'est un paiement d'avance. C'est comme ça que les choses marchent."dLe quartier est devenu bien plus calme depuis que cette histoire à Rhodocrine s'est terminée."TC'est dommage. Je m'imaginais m'en occuper moi-même. Ça aurait été amusant."RJ'ai beaucoup de chance que mon appartement à Béryl ait pas été détruit."cNon seulement j'ai pu retrouver mon chez-moi, mais j'ai aussi le droit à un meilleur appart'!"6Il était temps que ce quartier soit reconstruit:"wBéryl était l'un des premiers quartiers où il y a eu des gros chantiers, mais ça a pris teeeellement de temps."`Si tu penses que tout s'est reconstrui