 everyone disembarks, it can be kept here or below without any hassle at all!"�In this way, the Grandview Station is able to maintain a high-capacity transportation network with just a fraction of the space of other regions' stations."(Ticket Purchase within Reborn City:"Currently unavailable."'Ticket Purchase within Reborn City")Would you like to purchase a ticket?"Hello!"You see this beauty here?"~This is the first in a line of new trains we'll be rolling out across the city once we just secure the remaining funds for it."%The long-awaited 9R000 series..."�These babies are clean, lightning fast, and will take everyone to stations all across Reborn City faster than they can say 'modern locomotives!'"Look forward to it soon!"2It's about time this place got back underway!"UNow that it's an option again, you can bet I'll be traveling all over the place."-I got a bucket list to finish, you know!"Hrmm..."iPerhaps it's because we've only recently opened, but there's hardly any trains scheduled to come in."[Now that this place is restored, I just have to hope that my son will come back to me."I like trains!"I wanna ride on one!"I wanna ride on two!"At the same time!"?Goodness, I seem to have dropped my ticket. Can't be late!"Zzz..."@7:15 to Goldenrod. 7:25 to Peony. Tuesday. 7:25 to Ivyline."KWednesday. 7:25 to Shantyport. 7:30 to Heatherhill. 7:40 to Goldenrod."[Monday. 7:45 to Kingsbury. Tuesday. 7:45 to Ivyline. Wednesday. 7:25 to Sunset. Click."1Hello! I'm with Reborn Construction Company!"�After just completing our last major product, in the revitalized Railnet, we're raring to hire up and take on even grander designs!"oIf you or anyone you know is looking for a hands-on career to shape the future of this city, please apply!"(ADRIENN: \PN! My favorite champion!"=I'm grateful you could make it, and you're just in time."?I was just discussing the particulars with the chief here.",CHIEF: Allow me to summarize once more."MTwo of your compatriots recently un