!"�ADRIENN: Even though it's menial, if you could go explore the city and look for anybody who might be willing to lend a hand, I'd really appreciate it."TBut closer to ten would be ideal. I'd make the difference worth your time, too."ADRIENN: You're back!"^I just finished assigning the last of our volunteers. We should have just enough for now."Thank you for your help."EI know it's not easy going out and looking for people like that.""Well, then I guess it's time."^I just finished assigning the last of our volunteers. We've gotten plenty, thanks to you!"%Thank you so much for your help!"3Here, please take this as a thank you from me."lI just finished assigning the last of our volunteers. We've gotten so many, and it's all thanks to you!"WI'm astounded! But then, exceeding expectations does seem to be your strong point.")Thank you so, so much for your help!"UIt must have been really challenging to go out and look for all of those people."4Here, please take these as a thank you from me."MWhenever you're ready, just take your place on the stand opposite to me."And, \PN?"HEven if you're the Champion-to-be, don't think I'm gonna hold back!"I wanna really enjoy this!"@ADRIENN: Okay, \PN. Are you ready to give this another try?"CADRIENN: Okay, \PN! Are you ready for our long- awaited match?"4ADRIENN: That's the spirit. Back up and at 'em!"PYou're not the Champion, so there's no shame or loss in having a few slips.")It's all part of the process, right?"Okay, let's try again!"/Prove to me that my trust isn't misplaced!"GADRIENN: Yes! I've been looking forward to this ever since we met!"$Okay, "Champion"! Picture this!"4You're in your palace at the Hall of Champions!"JA new Trainer, Adrienn, has just blown through all of the Elite Four."2Xe intends to challenge and claim your title!"0Now you have to fight to defend your honor!"�Although the roles are reversed right now, this is still a defining step on that adventure, so come at me with all of that same spirit!"6Show 