 me a... shall we say, flat intelligence check to manipulate these small bubbles of liquid sugar."EVE: ...22."ACE: Impressive!"~So, yes, you dexterously manage to coax this strange creature of the delicious deep out of its sugary saccharine habitat."]ACE: As its body breaks above the molten surface, you find yourself face to face with..."ACE: A gigantic!"ACE: Writhing!"ACE: Licorice Eel!"LUMI: Oh!!!"5ZERO: Important question, red or black licorice?"ACE: Red!"ZERO: Darn."'EVE: You'd really prefer black...?"{ACE: Casting magic as easily as if it were a fishing rod, Yveraanya dexterously reels the creature to the spring's surface."�Its body is an unceasing helix of carmine and caramel, viscous cherry fins forming together at its head in a veritable vortex of teeth and lucre."�Searing spurts of sugar surge out across the spring's shore as its tail wildly thrashes about, finally pulled from the deliquescent depths!"]You see that this creature is, at minimum, the length of several more humans end to end,"qAnd is perhaps prone to preying on the unsuspecting passersby who dare dip their hands in the sugary spring."#ZERO: I stab the Licorice Eel."&LUMI: But what if it's friendly?!"!ACE: An attack roll, please!"jYou may have advantage, as Yvera currently has this creature suspended in the air for a brief moment!"ZERO: ...Natural 20!"�ACE: In an incredible display of caramel-coated combat from Zoro von Zilchenstein, the cadaverous crusader stabs his sacchariferous saber straight into the eel's aberrant eye!"�The licorice-like creature tries to blink, but squeals and shivers, every cylinder of its confectionery form howling and convulsing at its honeyed hanger!"{With a gnashing and a thrashing, it slams side to side, shattering the glossy glaze of the caramel crest across the sword--"rAnd in its wild rampage, inadvertently pierces itself through its other eye from its soft and sugary insides!"LUMI: "Nice hit, Zoro!!""3ZERO: "Feh... Something like this is nothing.""�ACE: You withdraw your rapier as the newly-blinded beast falls to the ground, its head bouncing on the surface of the shore in complete confoundment."oA long and winding licorice tongue lollygags out of its teleost maw, and you see, tied at the end of it..."...Is a birdcage."=ZERO: ...Did we just skip a whole combat with that crit?"ACE: I'll never tell~",EVE: Yveraanya will open the bird cage."iACE: As you open it, you notice that it seems this cage is enchanted with no small number of sigils."1Some, you recognize as being for protection."Others, for containment."�But you are able to quickly undo the latch, and no sooner than you do, a small shape sharply shoots out of the enclosure, and buzzes around you!"�You quickly recognize the figure as some kind of flying fae, eager to stretch its wings and taste freedom for the first time after surely far too long..."9As it does so, you finally get a good look at her..."#LUMI: What does she look like?"ACE: A wonderful question!"ACE: Little starlet,"4Would you please describe your character to us?"CIEL: Hello, \PN!"Hello, everyone~"qI'm afraid I haven't had the pleasure to get to know you all terribly well in our previous endeavors, but..."OI hope you will be welcoming and patient with me as I'm learning the game."1Something like this is... certainly a first."<ACE: I'm sure we'll all be happy to show you the ropes!"%LUMI: Yeah, new players are fun!"CACE: Besides, I'm still trying to convince \PN to join at all."6In that regard, you're a step ahead of him still!"6In that regard, you're a step ahead of her still!"7In that regard, you're a step ahead of them still!"?CIEL: So, Terra plays this with you all as well, does she?"4EVE: Whether or not Terra is in this game is..."...An ongoing debate." CIEL: Say no more, darling.";I think I understand the picture perfectly from there."Now, as to introductions!"cPirellia Pyellia is a pureblood pixie performer from the heart of the confectionary kingdom..."Yes"No"Clawit