eurs."XMême si t'étais là pour chourer un truc, y a vraiment rien de précieux par ici." Moi c'est François Frison."�Enchanté de faire ta connaissance, mais essaie plutôt la porte d'entrée la prochaine plutôt que me donner une crise cardiaque.""Aldie..."BQu'est-ce que je t'avais dit à propos de ces trucs magiques?"kMad'moiselle Percy est venue me voir en panique pour me parler de grands miroirs et de barreaux en or."JJ'pensais qu'elle avait encore pioché dans la réserve de François,"bMais au bout de 20 minutes de protestation, j'ai finalement accepté de jeter un coup d'œil."ZEt tu peux me dire quelle sorcellerie tarabiscotée c'est, ce truc dans notre wagon?!"1Dans tous les cas, je veux que ça dégage!";[�"RECOVERY UNIT INITIATED"!\PN's team was fully healed!"9Well, well. We don't get many new faces around here.""Just call me Bouffalant Bill."?You need anythin', I just might be able to hook you on up."[Ain' no shortage of odds and ends we been salvaged from the supply trains 'round here."0Gimme a holler if you wanna see what I got."7BOUFFALANT BILL: You wanna know how I got my name?">Well, it's kind of a long story, but I'll just say this--"uIt involves a herd of Bouffalant, a high speed tractor, and the real reason the old Railnet had to be shut down."<Heh. I ain't allowed in Reborn City no more after that."/Anyway, you here to buy somethin' or what?"]BOUFFALANT BILL: Money don't do you too much good out here. Might as well buy somethin'!"&Hey there, welcome to Train Town!"*Name's Alduous. Al for short is fine."/I suppose you already met my wife, Europa?"�The two of us got a little stir-crazy cooped up in the city, so we decided to hoof it out here and see what kind of adventure we could make.",In the end, we never wanted to go back."uOver time we've picked up a few stragglers here and there-- mostly people lookin' to escape the city themselves."For instance, Miss Percy?".We found her collapsed out in the desert."\Apparently her husband had sworn to kill her if she stepped foot outside one more time."1So she ran to somewhere he'd never find her."MAnd sometimes there's that kid wanderin' around too. He's a strange one."6Anyway, I hope you'll make yourself at home here."5If you need anything, you let my wife or I know."bALDUOUS: By the way, if you're out here, I don't suppose you're looking for the Gym, are you?"OHate to disappoint, but despite the pattern marked outside, this isn't it."9Miss Titania used to run challenges out here, but..."6Well, you should go a little farther. You'll see."!Um... Hello. Can I help you?".Y-you weren't sent here by anyone, right?">You're not looking for me and don't know who I am, right?"...Oh, thank goodness."AI'm sorry-- I just get so nervous when new people come here."0I worry that they might be from that guy..."IBut if you don't know who I'm talking about, then no problem, right?"3Just, don't tell anyone you met me here, okay?":My name's Persephone, but, please just call me Percy."aUmm, I'm probably not much use to you, but if you're staying a while, maybe speak to Europa?"#She's kind of our leader here."\PERCY: It's tough living out here. Sometimes we have hardly any food or drink to go on."HBut I think that just makes us appreciate what we do get even more."JLiving out here, I've learned how many things I've taken for granted,"=And I've also learned how many things I was too used to."cBeing out here, and not having to worry about being yelled at because I didn't clean properly,"+Or because someone else had a bad day,"0Or because I didn't want to kiss someone..."2That's the kind of thing I had resigned to..."'But here, I've never felt so free."%I wouldn't go back for anything."Please excuse me. I--"...know you."Do you remember me?"!But, we fought once before--"At Dr. Connal's Orphanage."My name is Stephanie."VWell, the others have taken to calling me "Stephoscope" because of this outfit..."1I keep telling them I'm not a doctor myself."2But you and that girl were pretty impressive."fIt seems that as a result of that incident, the Doctor took a leave of absence from the facility.",It's hard to forget an event like that.".Even so, I didn't expect to see you here."*I came here hoping to avoid everyone."SThe truth is, a while after the Doctor left, we were recruited by Team Meteor."ZThey said we would stop receiving wages if we didn't switch over to working for them."3Most of us were coerced into working for them.";I don't even know what happened to the other children."4But I still refused, even under threat of harm."DWhen they said they would not let me go, I fled-- and ran here."fI was lucky to find this company and shelter... but it is very difficult compared to my old life."�I've been researching how we can more effectively grow food in this kind of environment so that we don't struggle so much to get by."OBut it's hard to adjust to-- these kinds of people, this kind of living..."ZI don't dare go back to the city though-- not until Team Meteor isn't active anymore."GAnyway, this has been a surprise... but I should get back to work."fNot just for my own sake, but I'd like to ensure the others can keep living a free life here too."_STEPHOSCOPE: Frankly, trying to get anything to grow with so little water is unreasonable."That's the main problem."We sometimes have water brought to us, and we can sometimes luck into it at a mirage, but neither of those are really reliable."lIf we could find even just a single consistent water source in this desert, we'd probably be just fine."WI gather from your increasingly scuffed attire you've been traveling around a lot?"}Should you happen to find anywhere in this desert where there might be some kind of water source, please tell me immediately."Eh...?"4You've already seen one? Really? Tell me where!"In the cave to the west...")Those must be the Teknite Mountains?"3But that's not far at all! This could be huge!"2I'll start reassessing my options right away."Thank you very much."9Hmm... As a token of thanks, please take this stone."`I'm not sure what its properties are, but I found it while I was out looking myself before."?STEPHOSCOPE: There may just be enduring hope for us yet..."!I'll keep searching as well."MSTEPHOSCOPE: I don't suppose you've had any luck finding a water source?"-You've found one? Really? Tell me where!"9Well, it's only to be expected in a place like this."2For all we know, there may not be one at all."But I'll keep looking."BSTEPHOSCOPE: Thanks again for your help with the water stuff."/Hmm... As a token, please take this stone."6STEPHOSCOPE: This opens up so many opportunities."{Now I've got to explore what would be the most efficient things to grow, what arrangements, and how we can use them..."VOh! And how do we handle distribution while minimizing evaporation from the heat?"CLots to do-- but I'll definitely figure it out, thanks to you."!TAKA: Well, this is perfect."EUROPA: Y'all like it?"TAKA: Yeah."This is me."!EUROPA: Then it's all yours!":Feel free to clean up or redecorate however you like."nAnd if you need anything, you just let me or one of the others know and we'll see what we can do for you."}I imagine y'all are mighty tired, but when you feel up to it, come out and introduce yourselves to the rest of the folk here."4Everyone's always excited to meet a new friend!""Until then I'll leave you be.",TAKA: Maybe I'll take her up on that...".Sleep is sounding pretty swell right now."&\PN, thanks for bringing me here.",I feel like, maybe things will be okay.".I guess I'm gonna take a nap, and then..."!Let's talk more later, okay?"TAKA: Mmm... \PN?"%You're not going too far, right?"I feel like..."4Maybe I could sleep better if you're near by..."8TAKA: I don't know if I'll really be able to sleep,"#But I sure need to try anyway."Locked."%BUFFOULANT BILL: Yipes, partner!")I didn't see you come in even a bit."BGosh, the ol' back alley she built in here is a real spooker."???: Yipes, stranger!"How you get in here?!"And what you 