ymore."As if I ever did."Not against you..."#TAKA: ...and not against them."So I guess that's it."FTAKA: This'll probably be the last time you have to deal with me."TAKA: Sorry."TAKA: ...but you can."*You've always been standing up to us."$And you've always been winning.".You're gonna keep doing that, aren't you?"$TAKA: Yeah. You always do, huh."1Did you ever even think to do anything else?"Cuz I don't think I have."=I never thought anything could change, but here you are."9You rocked the boat and I've fallen right out of it."Splash."0TAKA: Hey, is that humility or just a joke?"&You're startin' to sound like me.""Maybe we're not so different."Maybe...""Maybe I can be more like you.""But where does that leave me?"@When I go back a failure again, I won't get another chance."And you..."...will keep fighting."TAKA: Can I come with you?"TAKA: Really?"&TAKA: All right, here's the plan:" I don't have a single clue."0So I'm just gonna follow you for now, okay?"%I'll try not to get in your way."XAnd uh, I kinda took a bunch of healing items from base before they sent me here..."8So I'll heal your Pokémon whenever you need, okay?"RIf I can find somewhere safe to hide, I think I'll lay low there for a while."?Maybe long enough that I'll get off of that woman's radar."3After that... let's beat Team Meteor together." I'll follow your lead, \PN."/TAKA: Yeah, I'd just be in the way, right?"I get it."I guess this is it then."See ya, \PN."#TAKA: Welcome home sweet home."�I've somehow managed to avoid melting into a blistering puddle of sands, which frankly might be the greatest victory I've ever had.""Well, off to wherever, right?"CORIN-ROUGE: Ahaha..."3So you've caught up to me even here, have you?"rMy fair lady, I must apologize to you with every drop of sparkling sincerity which my weary heart can muster."ZI am not known to be so oblivious to the desires of beautiful women such as yourself,"7But for you to have followed me so far even now..."ODarling, you could h