n't..."OThey're gonna say something like, there's no reason for me to stay, right?";Ace has been missing since the Water Treatment Center."&The others are probably already--"!Or she's probably already..."#...watching us from somewhere."+TAKA: I don't-- have a choice anymore."As if I ever did."Not against you..."#TAKA: ...and not against them."So I guess that's it."FTAKA: This'll probably be the last time you have to deal with me."TAKA: Sorry."TAKA: ...but you can."*You've always been standing up to us."$And you've always been winning.".You're gonna keep doing that, aren't you?"$TAKA: Yeah. You always do, huh."1Did you ever even think to do anything else?"Cuz I don't think I have."=I never thought anything could change, but here you are."9You rocked the boat and I've fallen right out of it."Splash."0TAKA: Hey, is that humility or just a joke?"&You're startin' to sound like me.""Maybe we're not so different."Maybe...""Maybe I can be more like you.""But where does that leave me?"@When I go back a failure again, I won't get another chance."And you..."...will keep fighting."TAKA: Can I come with you?"TAKA: Really?"&TAKA: All right, here's the plan:" I don't have a single clue."0So I'm just gonna follow you for now, okay?"%I'll try not to get in your way."XAnd uh, I kinda took a bunch of healing items from base before they sent me here..."8So I'll heal your Pokémon whenever you need, okay?"RIf I can find somewhere safe to hide, I think I'll lay low there for a while."?Maybe long enough that I'll get off of that woman's radar."3After that... let's beat Team Meteor together." I'll follow your lead, \PN."/TAKA: Yeah, I'd just be in the way, right?"I get it."I guess this is it then."See ya, \PN."#TAKA: Welcome home sweet home."�I've somehow managed to avoid melting into a blistering puddle of sands, which frankly might be the greatest victory I've ever had.""Well, off to wherever, right?"CORIN-ROUGE: Ahaha..."3So you've caught up to me even here, have you?"rMy fair lady, I must apologize to you with every drop of sparkling sincerity which my weary heart can muster."ZI am not known to be so oblivious to the desires of beautiful women such as yourself,"7But for you to have followed me so far even now..."ODarling, you could have just asked and I would have swept you away myself.")Ah, but there's the game, is it not?"@A dance moves not in one direction, so neither must hearts."rNor must I, who finds his breath stolen away not by the golden arid flourish amongst which we find ourselves,"pBut by the fever of your passion compared to which such a scalding scene as this is but a candle to a star."$Very well, my sweet supernova--" I shall deny you no longer."[It is all of me you may have to keep, and the same I would say for my treasures too..."Alas, that is impossible,")Since my greatest treasure-- is you."Nevertheless!"GSuch a place as this will not do for our most climactic encounter!"(I offer you points for persistence,"2But I'm afraid that's all you'll get from me.")I cannot return what I have stolen--"It is too critical.""If you would like to see why,"XMeet me in the place where the only thing more broken than the trains is our lives."No tricks this time."No running."-There is something I'd like to show you."2I shall wait for you the only way I know how:"(Breath, bated-- and heart, patient."Until then."TAKA: Uh."
