gest..."0VICTORIA: I must be seriously over-tired..."OMost people count Mareep; I'm about to be counting Vulpix to sleep here..."WSo, the proposed Railnet would feature eight stations, one for each ward, correct?"�But placing a station in Opal Ward is inefficient considering the water's placement and underground structure of the Grand Hall."NIs there really a need for an Opal Station when Grandview is so close by?"Ah, geez..."NSo after much ado, Reborn's Railnet system is finally rebuilt and active,""But there's just one problem."PThere's a part of the Railnet that we haven't been able to properly repair."4The whole thing is overrun with angry Pokémon!"And yeah-- I get it."DA bunch of humans marched into their home and messed it all up."@But that's their fault for infesting it in the first place!"	Ugh."jHey, listen, you're that ace Champion Trainer or whatever that Adrienn's always talking about, right?"NYou think you could do us a favor and go have a word with those Pokémon?"AI'll ask one of the guys to leave the door unlocked for you."WYou can find the entrance to the part that they've gathered in the Byxbysion Ward."Er-- Wasteland, sorry."}Byxbysion was originally going to be its own ward so we extended the railnet to there, but then it obviously didn't work out."3And of course now that part of it is an issue.":It'd be a huge help if you could do something though."]You think you could do us a favor and go have a word with those Pokémon in the Railnet?"_You can find the entrance to the part that they've gathered in in the Byxbysion Wasteland."CHowdy! I hear you were able to clean up those Pokémon for us!"MThanks a ton, pal! We'll get that section of the city tidied up now too."RBy the way, I heard the crew found this when they went to check the area out."+Oh, and there was one more thing too--"Consider them payment."Call it payment."6Now, let's consider plans for the Byxbysion Ward."gIt maybe in the distant future, but I see it as a possibility for Reborn's most cultured ward yet!"�We've been dedicated to revising our policies so that we can act quickly if Reborn City ever gets nearly as bad as it was before."{Some people insist we're being too subjective with what we punish for, but if you ask me, that's better than doing nothing!"'Victoria always seems so stressed!"'I wish there were more I could do."hI try to take her out for coffee now and then, but it seems like she really just misses her school.")Drinks can't solve that, I'm afraid."ZSix more registering Trainers have departed for the region from the Kanto-Johto area."IPlease make sure to prepare their registrations properly in advance."EThis morning I came in and found Adrienn passed out on xyr desk."Again."eI'm thinking we should just turn the old director's office into a bedroom for xem at this point."Director's Office"Trainer Data Center"Starter Pokémon Storage"Legal Office"RPRP Office"Inspector's Office"Corporate"(Always an honor to have you around."NI dunno where they all came from, but I think these little guys are cute."-They add a nice touch to the atmosphere."Good for employee morale."CBut it would be nice if they would stop making it snow inside."8This office is for the Azurine Restoration Project."�Just as soon as the project receives the adequate funding, we'll do our best to get the Pokémon of the area in ship shape to ensure their future in Reborn."!Oh, hello. \PN, was it, yes?"�I hear you're the one who funded the reconstruction of the Azurine Nature Center. Thank you so much for taking an interest in the Pokémon's future!"�If you are willing to help out just a little more, I've received word that the Island Center is waiting on a few Pokémon samples that we haven't acquired yet."�If you have any spare time and interest, would you mind heading down to the Azurine Center and seeing if you can contribute anything for them?"Oh, it's you!"QI got word just a bit ago that you were able to help out the Azurine Center!"]Thank you so much 