 resources needed to put it into action, but the planning and coordination can begin already."4Frankly, I'll be happy to have it off my plate."9The new project manager should be here any moment..."NHe was just on a brief trip to Kalos, so I'm sure he's had a busy return."5...But personally, I'm glad he came back at all."I wondered, for a bit."HI've got to hurry off to another session, but it shouldn't be long."%CAIN: Heyyy, I'm not late, am I?"Kalos was awesome--"CI'll have to tell you all about the stuff Dad and I saw later."#CAIN: ...Oh, I'm totally late."Well, that's fine."6CAIN: So, are you my cute-as-a-button secretary~?"^I know you had that Champion thing going on, but I'd understand if you gave it up for me."2After all, who wouldn't wanna work under me~?"<CAIN: You know, I never expected to have an office job."AI always felt like, once you turn 20 or whatever, it's over."WYou're gonna blink and wake up one day and you're 65 and hated every moment of it."?Like, the 9-5 work day might as well be a prison sentence."IBuuut, I realize now maybe that was maybe a teensy bit overreactive."\It's easy to get swept up in the idea of months and years passing without your control,"OBecause until that happens, it's just an idea that exists in that instant."�But in reality, you still have all of those moments to question, every step of the way, if this is the path you really want to be walking."pWhen you realize you can turn away at any time, it makes it that much easier to take the next step forward."1...At least, that's what I've been thinking.">As long as the work is worthwhile, I think I can do that."And a project like this..."&The Byxbysion Ward Restoration..."'Well, that feels pretty important."3I'm still a little shaky on calling it 'home',"MBut maybe that's only because I was so desperate to get away from there."DI don't know what it's like to call somewhere home and feel it,".But I think maybe this is how I find out:""By trying to build one there."*CAIN: ...So, first order of business!"tThere's a giant semi-intelligent Garbodor that desperately wants a hug but, unfortunately, is made of Garbodor.".So I'm thinking-- and stay with me here--"Hug suit."Eh?"
