ill remain loyal even now?"FHow many are simply beside us to further their own selfish goals?"dI beg you to take action and excise Lin from the organization before she taints it any further."With desperation and hope,"'~Your ever-faithful fool, Nashira""ACE: And with that,"ACE: Send~"ACE: ...Hm?"ACE: W-what is--"QDouble Magic Square completion has been detected from a different save file."USkip the Double Magic Square on this file? Rewards will be obtained immediately."Yes"No"
