ve to know what she is in order to know how to fight her."JAll of that starts with killing her first, and watching what happens."UThat's how you make a plan; know what you don't know, and learn how to learn it."HARDY: And what about Aya?"TITANIA: What about Aya?"VHARDY: You'll spend all that time deadset on Lin while the others still have Aya!"/TITANIA: Treat the cause; not the symptom."HARDY: Aya is suffering!"You'd just leave her?!"CTITANIA: She's been suffering. A little longer won't kill her." HARDY: You don't know that!"=You know what they're like-- they'll do anything to win!"TITANIA: So must we."3And that means choosing our priorities wisely.":Aya is not a critical piece in defeating Team Meteor."@The only thing she's critical to is making you feel needed."=You're putting your ego above what's actually important."-HARDY: And you're tossing her life away!"0TITANIA: What are you going to do about it?"HARDY: I'll save her!"_I'll find another way around and prove to you that she doesn't have to just be a casualty!">TITANIA: So the same thing you were already set on doing."7Glad to see this conversation made any difference."5I don't really know what else I expected though."6You've always been short-sighted and hard-headed."#HARDY: Must run in the family."TITANIA: Likely.">Neither of us are getting anywhere standing here arguing."$You go your way; we'll go ours."BHARDY: Hold on now, who's to say that \PN is going with you?!""TITANIA: That wasn't literal."4Right now all we can do is move forward anyway."\We'll have time to argue about what to do once there's actually a choice in the matter."=And if we don't have time then, we won't be losing much."HARDY: Tch."+You know, she wasn't always like this."ANothin' anyone says is gonna stop me from saving her, yanno?")Let's not waste anymore time for it!"&An old area map is posted here..."2It doesn't seem to have been touched in ages.Iu;␀4[[?"3HARDY: Yo, I see you made it out too, old man."RADOMUS: It would se