 business staying here."SOLARIS: Hmm."So that was Cal."=I suppose he is nothing like his brother said after all."Nevertheless."&I understand my fate well enough."*If it is not her, it will be another."SOLARIS: Go freely."9The outcome of our conflict was made clear in Agate."We need not rehash it."II suspect that, despite her mercy, my time is at its end regardless."8Please create a world in line with your own ideals."The struggle to do so..."8Perhaps that is the only meaning life has to offer." SOLARIS: I thought as much."=I will not pretend to be capable of fighting you either."lI understood that as soon as I had to resign to asking for your help, I had already forfeit everything."4I pieced together what happened to Ace as well."TI have but three questions for you, if you will grant me the kindness for them."Then I shall go in peace."9SOLARIS: I'll take your silence as tacit compliance."My first question..."SWhen you first joined our team, were you already planning to make this happen?"2Or was this simply the result of opportunism?"ILIN: The only thing better than a well-laid plan coming to fruition,"AIs a well-laid plan coming unraveled at the hand of impulse."SOLARIS: I see."Second question."I understand your goal."nYou will make the lie we promised others in order to manipulate them a reality, and create the New World."9But just what kind of world do you intend to create?",LIN: The only one where hope can exist."'LIN: The only kind worth creating."#One where anything can happen,";Whether that is everything at once, or nothing at all."SOLARIS: Uh huh."My third question..."-LIN: I did not agree to three questions."TVICTORIA: Thanks for coming up here for me, despite how I've acted towards you."5CAL: Forgiveness was a staple of our curriculum.".I would not be who I am today without it."VICTORIA: Y-yeah..."..."+You really saved Kiki's Medicham, huh?"CAL: Yeah."#Do you want to meet her again?"VICTORIA: Not right now."%Let's... do it back at Apophyll." You'll come with me, right?"FI could use some help, between that place and Reborn City duties."#CAL: After this is all over..."Yeah, I can do that."4But there's something I still need to do first."VICTORIA: Oh..."That's okay."!Whenever you get back, then."(It's been a long time, hasn't it..."CAL: I guess so."VICTORIA: Um..."This--"VMight be a little weird for me to say given how long I've been mad at you, but..."Um, back then I..."I really liked you."Do you think..."%Maybe once things settle down..."&We could... go out, or something?"CAL: Oh."
Uh..."!This is... a little awkward."I'm, uh..."Not... actually..."...Into women?"VICTORIA: ...Oh!"Oh."Oh-- okay."Okay, well!"NIt's a long trip back to Apophyll from here, so I guess I'll get started!"+I, uh, hope to see you around someday!"	Bye!"&I'll get in touch with her later."For now...",I'll go back and look for him, I guess."$CHATOT: Chat-chat-- 'Save \PN!'"...Chatot!"%Chatot decided to come with you!"GAll that matters is that you pick Pokémon that you enjoy playing."3Win or lose, it's how you use their strengths.Iu;␀�[[S""SIZE:"""Miniscule"""Small"""Medium"""Large"""HARDNESS:"""5"""6"""7"""8"""PURITY:"""Impure"""Middling"""Pure"""Flawless"""FOLIATION:"""Indistinct"""Difficult"""Perfect"""Eminent"""LUSTER:"""Silky"""Vitreous"""Pearly"""Adamantine"""HABIT:"""Cubic"""Hexagonal"""Tabular"""Coxcomb""RADOMUS: Well, well, well."$This is quite a mess, isn't it?"ZThat lad dropped me off here and went to search for the way forward, and here we are."�I feel that I can safely assume you've had some experience with these contraptions by now, and I believe I've a solid enough understanding of it."Shall we get right to it?".But I will say... looking at this data..."hWhoever designed this surely had either a veritable sadistic streak, or a very good sense of humor."-I suspect we shall never find out which."%RADOMUS: What will your move be?";RADOMUS: Very well. This will be a mite complicated..."{RADOMUS: If there were an award for the most inefficient data system in all of history, they surely would have won it."&RADOMUS: Shall we try? Very well."..."RADOMUS: Hm."And there it is."Impressive as always."VI will fetch Hardy from wherever he's gotten to exploring, and we'll go on ahead."1RADOMUS: It would seem that wasn't quite it.":Permit me just a moment to try something on my end..."RADOMUS: There it is."IThere is no use in holding ourselves against systems this arbitrary.">Ah, but I believe I'm putting the pieces together myself."STake another try, and give me just another moment more to perfect an approach."fThis will continue to be rather challenging until you can properly draw the necessary inferences."(Let's take this clue as an example:"�5. The Hardness of the "Small" gem is less than the Hardness of the Amethyst, which is less than the Hardness of the "Pure" Gem."bIt may not appear to give us any concrete information at first, but that's far from the case."[If the "Small" gem is softer than Amethyst, then we know that Amethyst is not "Small"."qConversely, we also hereby know that Amethyst is not "Pure", and further that the "Small" gem is not "Pure"."[This allows us to rule out several possibilities-- and of course, it is only one clue."With eight such similar ones, I have faith that inferring these eliminated possibilities will reveal only one possible outcome."SBut that may be difficult to imagine without marking it down visually somehow."CSurely you have not come this far without being able to do so?"1This system is rather unfortunate, isn't it?"RADOMUS: Instructions?"pIt's nearly a miracle that the constructor of this convoluted contraption considered to create such things."KSimply read the available dataset as if they were 'clues' to a puzzle."�Using your powers of logic, deduction, and perhaps drawing a lot of boxes on paper, figure out all the qualities each of four crystals has."�We then input those qualities as data back into the system by moving the colored blocks to our right in line with the screens displaying those qualities."For example, a Ruby with a "Coxcomb" Habit requires the red block to be moved in front of the screen that reads "Coxcomb"."@It is tedious and nonsensical, but then, aren't all things?"Complete."You there!"(Pick your head up and hold it high!"�When everything seems lost and you're at the end of the road, I want you to remind yourself, to never give up, and never stop fighting."See Clues"Check Solution"Review Instructions[S""TAILLE:"""Miniscule"""Petite"""Moyenne"""Grande"""DURETÉ:"""5"""6"""7"""8"""PURETÉ:"""Impure"""Médiocre"""Pure"""Immaculée"""FOLIATION:"""Indistincte"""Difficile"""Parfaite"""Exceptionnelle"""ÉCLAT:"""Soyeux"""Vitreux"""Nacré"""Adamantin"""STRUCTURE:"""Cubique"""Hexagonale"""Tabulaire"""Crêtée""RADOMUS: Eh bien, eh bien."'Quelle mésaventure, n'est-ce pas?"SCe jeune homme m'a déposé ici avant de repartir à la recherche d'une issue."�Il me semble que je peux supposer que tu as désormais quelque expérience avec ces dispositifs. De plus, je crois assez bien les comprendre." Attelons-nous à la tâche!"%Tout de même... ces données..."uQuiconque a conçu ce projet avait certainement un véritable penchant sadique ou un très bon sens de l'humour."Nous ne le saurons jamais.")RADOMUS: Quel est ton prochain coup?"DRADOMUS: Très bien. Cela sera sans doute un brin compliqué..."�RADOMUS: S'il existait une récompense pour le système de données le plus inefficace de l'histoire, nous tiendrions là les vainqueurs.")RADOMUS: Veux-tu que nous essayions?"..."RADOMUS: Hm."Eh bien."$Impressionnant, comme toujours."RJe pars à la recherche de Hardy, puis nous continuerons d'explorer ensemble."ARADOMUS: Il semblerait que ce ne soit pas tout à fait cela."9Permets-moi d'essayer quelque chose de mon côté..."RADOMUS: Voilà."ZNous n'allons pas nous laisser mener à la baguette par un système aussi arbitraire."DAh, je commence à mon tour à assembler les pièces du puzzle."KEssaie de nouveau, et laisse-moi un moment pour parfaire mon approche."\Tout ceci restera un défi tant que tu n'auras pas tracé les inférences nécessaires."%Prenons cet indice, par exemple:"~5. La Dureté de la Petite gemme est inférieure à celle de l'Améthyste, laquelle est inférieure à celle de la gemme Pure."sÀ la première lecture, il ne semble donner aucune information concrète. C'est pourtant loin d'être le cas."nSi la Petite Gemme est moins dure que l'Améthyste, nous en déduisons que l'Améthyste n'est pas Petite."~Par le même raisonnement, nous savons désromais que l'Améthyste n'est pas Pure, et que la Petite gemme n'est pas Pure."ZCe qui nous permet d'éliminer plusieurs combinaisons. Et ce n'est qu'un seul indice."�Avec huit indices du même acabit, tout porte à penser que les combinaisons possibles seront à la fin toutes éliminées pour n'en laisser qu'une seule."NMas cela peut être ardu à visualiser sans un outil concret de notation."SBien sûr, tu n'as pas pu parvenir jusqu'ici sans recourir à un tel système?"CCette tâche est pour le moins fastidieuse, ne trouves-tu pas?"RADOMUS: Des instructions?"{Il est presque miraculeux que le concepteur de cet assemblage alambiqué ait eu l'idée de fabriquer une telle œuvre."CLis les données disponibles commes les indices d'une énigme."�En utilisant la logique et la déduction, ainsi qu'une grande grille sur un papier, détermine les propriétés respectives des quatre cristaux."�Nous implémenterons ensuite ces données dans le système en déplaçant les blocs colorés devant les écrans correspondant aux propriété supposées."�Par exemple, un Rubis avec une Structure "Crêtée" nécessite que le bloc rouge soit pacé devant l'écran qui indique "Crêtée"."MC'est absurde et laborieux, mais n'est-ce pas le cas de bien des choses?"Complété."	Toi!"Redresse la tête!"jLorsque tout semble, perdu, rappelle-toi de ne jamais abandonner et de ne jamais cesser de te battre."Voir Indices"Soumettre la Solution"Relire les Instructions;[S""SIZE:"""Miniscule"""Small"""Medium"""Large"""HARDNESS:"""5"""6"""7"""8"""PURITY:"""Impure"""Middling"""Pure"""Flawless"""FOLIATION:"""Indistinct"""Difficult"""Perfect"""Eminent"""LUSTER:"""Silky"""Vitreous"""Pearly"""Adamantine"""HABIT:"""Cubic"""Hexagonal"""Tabular"""Coxcomb""RADOMUS: Well, well, well."$This is quite a mess, isn't it?"ZThat lad dropped me off here and went to search for the way forward, and here we are."�I feel that I can safely assume you've had some exp