 Look is a classic strat' in other regions, but it ain't necessary here."4The more you find it, the more tired it'll get."WDamage and what-not'll stick around between encounters as long as you don't KO it."CIf you do, it'll probably just take a Roost and revive itself."7I think that's about it, 'side from one more note."sIt might not've looked it in the Anomaly, cuz, yanno, Anomaly, but there's still a chance that it'll be shiny."yThis might go without sayin', but if it is, it'll be that way from the start. No changin' colors while it runs away.">Keep that in mind, and you'll be ship-shape to rock this!"HARDY: Suit yourself."You got this!"Yes"No[�"Verrouillé."@TAKA: When you're ready, you should give Celebi that water."?But remember to stock up on items and stuff, just in case."TTAKA: \PN? I didn't expect to see you again. I just figured you'd leave, and..."6I mean, go stand at the mountain's peak, I guess?"*Isn't that what Champions usually do?"iIt's... good to see you again, though. I've not really spoken to anyone since... y'know, everything."&I was just up here... reflecting."VDid you know there used to be a temple to Arceus here before they built a League?"%Father mentioned it a few times."BHis father ran it, so he spent a lot of time here as a kid..."8It was already gone by the time I was born, though."*And he only mentioned it a few times."0He didn't like talking about his parents..."They must've been intense.",Probably best I never got to meet them."I doubt Fath--"F... I doubt Solaris would even want them to see how I turned out."QTAKA: Wait a minute, that Pokémon over there, the one just staring at us...")That's Celebi, a Legendary Pokémon!"2It looks pretty rough though, like it's sick?"+We need to help it; we can't let it..."@Too many bad things have happened on this mountain already."But why did it come here?"UI know a bit about Legendary Pokémon, but only what I read in Father's books..."lApparently Grandfather was an expert on medicine and Lege