y, just give Celebi that water when you're ready, I guess."-ELIAS: My Lord, is everything all right?"I assume you felt it too?"XI just had the strangest sense of familiarity with these events, for some reason..."oAh, not that you would find yourself affected by being in the presence of a Pokémon with power over time."1You must have been waiting for me to adjust."9I am, as always, humbled by how considerate you are."LI'm sure Celebi will be ready for you as soon as you give it the water."+\PN obtained Field Effect Read-Out 35!"%Info on New World now available!"-HARDY: You're in the nick o' time, mate."/I just wiped to this thing like a dumbass."ABut it's softened up and doesn't like to stay in place long."-Battle first and talk later! You got me?"RAYQUAZA: Razaah!!"QUAAAARR!!!"RAYQUAZA: Raiiiiyi--"%HARDY: It's gonna fly off again!"Waitstopcomebackdon't--"HARDY: Bloody hell..."<HARDY: There's no telling where that thing is gonna go."0But at least you got the Anomaly off of it."IAt this point, we can chase it down like any other roaming Pokémon.""I heard what happened to Sis.""Or what's happening, I guess."|Thought maybe I could actually show some goodwill between us for once and chase that thing down to knock her out of it."No dice."(First time I found it, I heard her."A young girl's voice..."8I swear I've heard it before, but I can't place it."*She sounded self-righteous and cocky."/Almost like Sis in that way, but brighter."^Coming from a place of unshakable optimism even as she pitches a Legend straight at me..."	Lin."She sounds... different."pThe whole time we were fighting Meteor, I'd never have guessed they were under the banner of a little girl."Shit's messed up, yanno?";I'm questioning if we were even doin' the right thing."+But I think, we gotta have been right?"WOtherwise we'd have a lot more problems than a few ragtag legends and open worlds."Y...Anyway, point is, I learned a thing or two 'bout chasing down Pokémon like this."*Drop a word if you want the run-down.",HARDY: Want the scoop on roamers, mate?"TRayquaza has some quirks compared to what I've read it's like in other regions."HARDY: Word. So, basics:",Rayquaza's touring out there somewhere."{It's usually not going with a destination in mind, so it might move to a nearby place randomly or not at all as you travel."]I doubt it'll fly inside anywhere, so you've only gotta care about major outdoor places.">Check your Map App to see where it's at, and make tracks."DYou'll know when you're close because of Rayquaza's windstream."-Once you're nearby, Repels can help too."JThe problem is, once you find it, it's likely to just run away again."Annoying bugger."QMean Look is a classic strat' in other regions, but it ain't necessary here."4The more you find it, the more tired it'll get."WDamage and what-not'll stick around between encounters as long as you don't KO it."CIf you do, it'll probably just take a Roost and revive itself."7I think that's about it, 'side from one more note."sIt might not've looked it in the Anomaly, cuz, yanno, Anomaly, but there's still a chance that it'll be shiny."yThis might go without sayin', but if it is, it'll be that way from the start. No changin' colors while it runs away.">Keep that in mind, and you'll be ship-shape to rock this!"HARDY: Suit yourself."You got this!"Yes"NoIu;␀�[[%"!FLORA: Took you long enough."!Are you really the Champion?"CI figured it would be someone at least a little more reliable."VAnyway, I already called in and talked to some League manager person or whatever?"fThey said a bunch of airy bullshit about "preserving the sanctity of the challenge" and whatever,"?But after I mentioned you, their whole tone turned around."aAnd THEN they told me about how that PULSE has just taken over the Champion room entirely???"GLike it just teleports anyone who gets close to it right back out."3Seriously, how does your League even function."zAPPARENTLY it's because everyone who's gone to check on it has bypass