hey just drew up plans to incorporate that area into the city."LThey want it to be super swanky, luxury apartments and that whole deal."How'd that turn out?"/TAKA: I, uh, I'm not sure we should tell--"@ELENA: Oh, oh, I know! What about the Tourmaline Trainline?"HDoes it still have its reputation for 24/7 service, always on time?"!TAKA: I really don't think--"KELENA: Oh, how about Calcenon and Labradorra, who are the Gym Leaders?"[I know Caroline and Monty want their daughters to succeed them, but knowing those two,"[They'll probably cling onto their titles until one of the kids can actually beat them!"TAKA: Oh, uh, actually--"5ELENA: Okay, last question. Who is the Champion?"%TAKA: Oh, umm, well that's uh..."That's actually \PN."ELENA: Bullshit it is!"$Hey, show me your trainer card!"IElena snatches your trainer card away from you before you can react."$ELENA: Huh. The date on here..."NAnd I mean, that's 18 badges, even though I don't recognize most of them."<You really are the future Champion? That's pretty wild."5Here's your trainer card back; sorry about that."-TAKA: So, I guess you believe us now...?"-ELENA: I mean, I've seen weirder things."fTry to think about how the geography of any of these Elite Four rooms works for like ten seconds."$TAKA: Uh... I guess... Magnets?"ELENA: Ha!"I like you, kid."qNow, here's the thing. I COULD just let you chill out while you wait for the onion to get its strength back.".But, as I'm sure you are very well aware,"1I don't plan to retire until I'm an old hag."RIf you're the Champion in the future, you've beaten me in battle once before."OAnd I have a responsibility to make sure I've not gone soft in the future."4Talk to me when you're ready to lose, Champion!"#TAKA: She's pretty... intense."$I know we can't tell her but..."It's just sad."/ELIAS: Huh, this isn't my room. But why..."ELIAS: Ah."GWe are closer to our time, but I believe we are still in the past."HThis room must look familiar to you-- a perfect match to Heat