eve that one's condition in the past should determine their treatment in the present."DI would not be so well-off if that were the case either........"OAnd damage done to any flower is erased each spring when a new one blooms."TBENNETT: Adaptation to the circumstances is a necessary trait for any organism."LLAURA: And nature possesses beauty exactly because it is ever-changing."JBENNETT: Those who do not change inevitably fall behind in the world."SI have no intention of falling behind and I hope, \PN, that you do not either."SLaura and I will endeavor as partners to adapt to each other's battling style."9Show us, \PN, how you've adapted to your conditions!"=BENNETT: Impressive. I'll make note to study this later."2BENNETT: \PN, do you know what "Apolysis" is?"BENNETT: Impressive!"=Then you may already understand how well you're growing.")BENNETT: That's only understandable."0Apolysis is the process by which a larval--"Ah, well..."+In short, it means you're growing too.">I look forward to seeing just what heights you can reach."%BENNETT: Amazing as always, \PN.")I'll continue to study more as well."ELAURA: Butterflies and buttercups are not so terribly different."=Everyone must find beauty in their own struggle to grow."0I hope you do not miss the beauty in yours."0BENNETT: One more thing before you go, \PN."BENNETT: I owe you this.":It should not have left your care in the first place."LAURA: And mine as well."2One half of the pair will hardly do you well."_It is better in your hands for the purpose it was meant, than in mine as a simple memento."+BENNETT: No more time to waste though." Your path is forward still."BLAURA: Perhaps I will make a new arrangement for next time..."6But then, this is such an easy place to decorate."IAfter all, it's near impossible to count wisteria even if one tries."@There is as much freedom in that as there is in the future.".BENNETT: You have my utmost support, \PN."I have just one request:"=Give the next trainer a solid thrashin