rk that I just forget to explain it right."Basically..."1This isn't the first time this has happened."HThis conflict with Team Meteor suddenly escalating to this point..."oEven everything that happened with Heather's dad, and those sorority girls, and the teacher at Apophyll..."%So much of this happened before."2But back then, it was different-- and faster."WThe old champion died alongside you, when you would have first come to the region."QTruthfully I don't even remember it myself; I just know what Nostra told me."8Back then, I made a wish to try and save the world."~It was such an earth-shattering, reality-bending wish that Nostra could hardly maintain her presence in the world she rewound."*That's why she's like this, you know?"+And it's not just her-- that boy, too."NHis body was the sacrifice necessary to rewind the world so dramatically."But that wish..."It brought me you, \PN."[Trying to control an entire timeline just on Nostra's guidance alone has been tough..."YUnexpected things kept happening, but we've tried to correct it as much as possible."QAfter all, if things became too different, Nostra wouldn't know how to help."[I'm sure I've caused you a lot of inconveniences that way, even if you didn't know it."�For instance, even though Ame was still alive, I asked her to stay out of things long enough so that you would gain enough experience to persevere."�You have to believe me when I say that everything I've done was just to build you up strong enough so that you could eventually defeat Lin!"8Before, she was too powerful for anyone to take on."CYou being here and opposing them has slowed them down so much!".And soon, you should be able to beat her!"'I'll try and make it short though."-You may not believe me, and that's okay.".Things haven't gone exactly as planned..."(But you should be able to beat her!":You're like a pawn that reached the end of the board.",And this is the final stage of my wish!"Nostra!"Please finish the job!"MWith this battle, 