s is for the best."-We'll be right there with you too, okay?"You can do it.")Because you're the one Nostra chose."*Because you've already come this far."And because...")For everyone's sake, we have to win."Good luck out there."ANNA: Go ahead."+You aren't fighting this battle alone."!Me, Nostra, your Pokémon..."(We're all with you to the very end."XAME: Anna's a great kid, but somebody needs to tell her to treat her toys better..."1I can't believe she requested this set-up..."WShe said something about it being because she feels guilty, but I don't... get it."MI should never have approved this, I should never have approved this~...";Celebi seems curious about who that voice belonged to."=Celebi seems pretty tired out after all the time travel."1Celebi seems full of energy and ready to go!".Do you want to travel through time again?"jYou once again feel your surroundings fade away around you as Celebi brings you forward through time!"<Celebi looks a little impatient, but will wait for you."@TAKA: But why would she be in here, she's not Elite Four...",TAKA: ...I don't really like this room."+I didn't have proper toys growing up--")So, seeing all of this is kind of..."ELIAS: Of course it's her."5Another person who's death I am responsible for."[ELIAS: As eerie I find this room, she at least made the right choice going for stairs.",My floating platforms constantly break."UTAKA: We're so close to our time, the next jump will have to get us back, right?"7ELIAS: We should be going back to the present now."$These meetings have all been..."*I'm glad I got to see them all again."#AME: Shimmer, give me a boost."I can almost reach them..."AME: Gah!"{Officer, I swear, I didn't sneak into Anna's room while she was away with the sole purpose of rescuing all these toys!"GThat's a preposterous accusation which I can't believe you'd make!"I'm hurt!"Wounded!",My heart weeps at the mere insinuation!"%AME: And even if it were true..."mI shan't be pressured and shamed by some thuggish officer of the state for trying to do the right thing!"MI will give each of these toys a safe home, and nobody is going stop me!"5...This doesn't mean you're Champion now, right?"MAME: Woah, what kind of officer are you that you can beat me so easily!?"9TAKA: Uh, hi. We're nothing to do with the police...".TAKA: I'm Taka. And you just battled \PN."#We're kind of from the future."sAME: Oh! And over there must be that time traveling lettuce Pokémon I saw in one of the books in Elias' room?"]TAKA: ...Do you make a habit of going into the Elite Four's rooms when they aren't here?"6AME: Do you make a habit of impersonating police?"That sounds like a crime.""TAKA: We didn't... Nevermind."iCelebi just needs to rest before time traveling-- so we've been making small jumps to get back home."sIt seems like we're pretty close to our time period though, so we can get out of your hair and leave you to..."0Doing nothing criminal whatsoever, I guess.""AME: Hey, hold up a minute..."0\PN, right? You're a very talented trainer."1Have you challenged the League in your time?"IIf not, you should-- you might have what it takes to go all the way!"TAKA: About that..."'\PN is your successor as Champion.".AME: Wait, so you've beaten me twice now?"That's incredible!"cMy dream was to build up this League to attract the best trainers from all around the world..."2And clearly it worked! I couldn't be happier!"?To think my League attracted such an incredible trainer..."!Well, don't let me keep you!"IYou should get back to your time-- Say "Hi" to me when you get back!"FAME: Woah, what kind of officer are you that you can beat me so--",Wait, Elias!? Is this trainer with you?"8Did you sneak in here to rescue all of Anna's toys?"@Bringing a friend was a good call; I'm struggling to reach."ELIAS: Amethyst."+That's very much your hobby, not mine."3AME: I have no idea what you're talking about."DI have never done anything of questionable legality in my life."pShimmer appears to be doing a dance 