e this, you know?"+And it's not just her-- that boy, too."NHis body was the sacrifice necessary to rewind the world so dramatically."But that wish..."It brought me you, \PN."[Trying to control an entire timeline just on Nostra's guidance alone has been tough..."YUnexpected things kept happening, but we've tried to correct it as much as possible."QAfter all, if things became too different, Nostra wouldn't know how to help."[I'm sure I've caused you a lot of inconveniences that way, even if you didn't know it."�For instance, even though Ame was still alive, I asked her to stay out of things long enough so that you would gain enough experience to persevere."�You have to believe me when I say that everything I've done was just to build you up strong enough so that you could eventually defeat Lin!"8Before, she was too powerful for anyone to take on."CYou being here and opposing them has slowed them down so much!".And soon, you should be able to beat her!"'I'll try and make it short though."-You may not believe me, and that's okay.".Things haven't gone exactly as planned..."(But you should be able to beat her!":You're like a pawn that reached the end of the board.",And this is the final stage of my wish!"Nostra!"Please finish the job!"MWith this battle, you'll have the strength you need to finally face Lin!"This is your promotion!"=If stars never fell, how would anyone make their wishes?"ANNA: There you go."No need to worry."2We've rewound her part of time again for you."3We'll do it as much as it takes until you win.";After all, I said we'd be right there with you, right?"!This victory belongs to you."Now go for it!"ANNA: That's it, then..."Take a rest, Nostra.";After everything and so long, you've beyond earned it."And, \PN?"-Thank you for playing this game with me."+I've been... really, horribly selfish."=Not only didn't I tell anyone what was going on, but I--"VI guess I've been running from the fact that this was all my fault to begin with."You see, Lin--"Isn't what she seems."_When I was still at the orphanage, we all used to play games as much as we could together.":And there was one game that I was always the best at."Chess, of course!"NNo one could even stand a chance against me... except for one other girl."Her name was Lin."0In the end, we developed kind of a rivalry."nI thought it was all in good spirits fun until one day, I suddenly reversed a losing game on her and won."YShe snapped at me, and the Doctor got angry, and both of them started yelling and..."DWell, I never saw her again after she was put into the Circuit."RI heard she escaped that night, but the Doctor refused to ever talk about it."[Then, before long, the Lin we know now appeared and started pulling strings elsewhere."8There's no doubt in my mind that it's the same Lin."And I think..."9All of this has still been some kind of game to her.",She hasn't come after me in specific..."+But if I were her opponent, would she?"HI know I'm such a child to have let a stupid rivalry come this far.">But that's all the more reason why we have to end it now!"$I couldn't do it myself before."$That's why I'm counting on you."Thank you for everything."Please..."ANNA: Take this."?ANNA: It may seem like a bad thing at first, but trust me."This is for the best."-We'll be right there with you too, okay?"You can do it.")Because you're the one Nostra chose."*Because you've already come this far."And because...")For everyone's sake, we have to win."Good luck out there."ANNA: Go ahead."+You aren't fighting this battle alone."!Me, Nostra, your Pokémon..."(We're all with you to the very end."XAME: Anna's a great kid, but somebody needs to tell her to treat her toys better..."1I can't believe she requested this set-up..."WShe said something about it being because she feels guilty, but I don't... get it."MI should never have approved this, I should never have approved this~...";Celebi seems curious about who that voice belonged to."=Celebi seems pretty tired o