ng that some people listen to.";It's the only thing some people can listen to anymore."FIn the case of Aya's step-father, I'm sure a threat will suffice.",But that's its own kind of tragedy too."%I'm so beyond tired of conflict.";And there's nothing to do but build a little bridge..."4TITANIA: Taking a rest after the train jacking?"Yeah, I know about it."BMr. Rock Dundee over there hasn’t stopped talking about it."XI’ve got to say, I wish I’d been able to see those Orbs before they got stolen.">They sound like a pain, but I’m honestly a bit curious."vOf course, now they’re lost and that thief’s probably in the back end of nowhere by now, but what can you do."9Maybe they’ll turn up again and I can have a look."pI don’t have much faith in Reborn’s police department, but I think they’re pretty steamed about this."Anyway, good job."6You’re good at not dying, I’ll give you that,"YAnd Julia seems happy to see Terra, even if literally no one else with any sense is."9...Actually, you know what, forget the 'sense' part."0But it’s still good to see her like that."So... thanks."TITANIA: Oh."Hi."Do you need something?"I'm trying to read, so."-...I should really pick up another book."(Honestly, I've read this one twice."1Maybe I'll borrow one from Shelly's library."Be good to check on her."Good luck out there."Try not to die.",TITANIA: You've got stuff to do, right?"Go on."WTITANIA: Look, I don't actually mind talking when there's something to talk about."/But small talk for the sake of small talk?"Just kill me."AMARIA: Oh,"...Mm."=...I'm really not sure what I should say to you anymore."After everything--";After an absolutely inexcusable amount of everything--"/It would be rude to you to just ignore it,"It was never your fault,"4But apologizing for it will only make me worse."4What does anyone who's suffering want, I guess?"To be seen, perhaps?"PTo know that even if no one can save them, they're not alone and forgotten?"What good is that?"4None, and yet, I sup