ou know, again."'Thanks for hearing me out, though."JZERO: Heh, guess I've gotta figure out what else to do nowadays, huh."/It's uh, weird to not have anything to do."K...Don't have to tell me twice how much I've been blabbering about it."mI'm just glad that there's even been something that someone like me could do for this whole clusterfuck."ZERO: ...Uh."5Someone like me is only rude to myself, I guess."uThis is... embarrassing, but sometimes it still helps me to think of myself as if I were still different people."7I wouldn't want to talk like that to Eve and Lumi.")I know they wouldn't say that to me."So, uh... to correct it..."9I'm proud that I could still make a difference here.".Help around with fighting the good fight."8ZERO: I'm glad you stopped by for a chat over here."*...Maybe I'll join everyone sometime."*ZERO: Need any kind of support today?"#...Or were you just saying hi?"9ZERO: It can be kind of disorienting here sometimes."Not that I mind, though.":Good music, people who... still tolerate me? Friends?"It's nice."What's up, champ?"You into remixing at all?"GWhether it's music or Pokémon, it can really help to shake it up!"xFor instance, say you wanna swap out a move or two on your squad for one battle, but you wanna get it back later..."I can help you out there!"See, all you gotta do?"BBring me a Pokémon, and I'll memorize its moves as they are."EWe save that mix, and you can come back to it any time you want."No charge, for the champ."+What do you say, wanna give it a shot?"Here to mix it up, champ?"What are you thinkin'?"Pick a moveset to record."Changed your mind?"4All right, I'll memorize that Pokémon's moves.""What should we call this mix?"6You already saved a moveset under the name \v[6].",How do you wanna deal with this, champ?"$Got it. \v[6] has been updated." Got it. It's saved as \v[6]"/Hey, we gotta call it something, don't we?"It's more fun that way."-And if it's not something, it's nothing."JYou don't wanna make your Pokémon