Et..."?I wasn't captain of the cheer squad for nothing, you know!"kSooooooo I mayyyyyy have told one or two teensy weensy little white lies about what happened to you..."'Just to cheer people up, you know?",So if you get some strange reactions..."Don't worry about it!"Great to see you again;"4Definitely glad you're not a shadow clone, yep!"JULIA: HIYA!!!!"..."Oops, sorry for yelling!":I'm in an Extra-Happy-Fun mood now, because BOOMIES!!"8Not that I'm not always the extra-cheeriest around,"+But explosions make everything better!"&Plus, I got to make a new friend!"/Y'know, it is kinda unfortunate, though..."!That that Corin guy ran off.";I know, I know, he was in big trouble with the police,"And he stood me up,"7And sure, maybe he's kiiiind of a notorious thief,"But he was really cute!"DNot that I'd ever give him another chance after he stood me up,"GBut you've gotta admit, it would sure be an exciting relationship!"DAah... It's too bad things with that other guy didn't work out."\Anyhoo, I'm sure you've got things to do, and I've got a fifth cup of coffee to get to."Enjoy your day, \PN~"6JULIA: That circus gig was the best daytrip EVER.">Well, at least since that one date I had a few years ago,"�Where we went out to Apophyll and had a water balloon fight and they had to ask us to quiet down because people were trying to meditate or whatever,"But it was pretty amazing!"%I TOTALLY wanted to stay longer!"At the circus, I mean."XBuuuut I may have eaten too much cotton candy and felt sick after the Ferris Wheel."Pro tip: Don't do that."(But it all worked out for you, huh?""That Pokémon was soooo cute."LMy Electric-types are still cuter, though. So I don't mind not winning."	But."'That's ONLY this once, understand?"-Don't get used to that kind of attitude."JI'm still the best, peppiest battler, and the peppiest, best battler!"So don't forget it!";JULIA: Okay, so, here's the itinerary for Rini and me:"?I'm thinking, we see if we can fly on fireworks next week.