es, then is illusion truly delusion,"1Or was it just a memory made special for us?"*Make some fine memories, little hero!"$Some days, they're all we have."*ACE: Ah-- \PN, a moment of your time.",Back at that awfully chilly New World--"ZCertainly a rather... frigid and unpleasant place to wake up in my own right mind to."ZBut perhaps, it is the company I kept that made the spectacle all the more tolerable."yI hadn't the chance before to express my thanks truly and properly for rescuing me from that predicament of its own."SIt is admittedly still difficult to remember all the details before I came to."7Ah, but why dwell on matters out of our own hands?"{I'd simply wanted to find the time to thank you from the bottom of my heart for rescuing the little prince as you did."kI had enough lucidity at the start from the box I was in to save ZEL from Magnezone's explosion, but--"�I-- I-I'd never quite lived out my own nightmares in reality as I did when I bore witness to his fate in that Steel Leader's Gym, and..."UACE: ...Well, all I can say is that I have never been more grateful as I am now.")...For you, and for his safe return."8ACE: Trouble with a disappearing dragon, was there?"5You know, I always did think it was a bit queer,"SThe wasteland packed more whimsy and pizzazz than you could punt a whiffle at."Why would that be?"8Some kind of Legendary force just living out there?"*Something real that no one could see?"oThings like that-- they're always in such a way that someone must be trying very hard to keep them hidden."`It is perhaps surprising that someone of my persuasions didn't see through the ruse sooner!"xAh, but if we could see all of life's illusions with just a glance, then what would be the point of looking at all?"?It does this performer a spot of good to be outmaneuvered!"8Still, all for the best for you to still the beast."QAnd don't bother asking something silly like how I would know what happened."Didn't I ever tell you?" I can read minds, you know!"