ons on the win."HI will take your rental Pokémon back and return your own Pokémon."6We've been waiting for you. Please come this way."ZERO: ...Hey there, \PN."6Surprised to see me out from behind the desk now?"QWe'd finally finished cleaning up all the Anomaly reports, and, well, uhh..."/Figured I'd stick around for a little bit."(Take a little bit of time to relax."2...You know, uh... enjoy the scenery and all."-It can be... a little overwhelming here."BBut whether I'm behind the counter managing reports or not..."/It's been nice to see everyone back again."/ZERO: ...Thanks for stopping by to say hi.")It's good to see you as always, too."5ZERO: Honestly, \PN, it feels all too weird now."PNo reports to manage, no equipment to monitor, no Anomalies to help with..."S...No nights losing sleep over how many we received at once sometimes, either.">One part of me kinda thought the reports would never end."9...The other part is sad they're over and done with."...Heh."WI won't lie, though, it's still been nice to be able to rest at the end of it all."Seeing everyone here..."Ace, Blake... Cal--"Ace, Taka--"Eve and Lumi, too..."...I, uh... I missed them."8Maybe I could try and talk with them sometime, too."'...Dunno if they'd want to, but..."Might be nice."-ZERO: You know, \PN, I've been thinking."SI kinda want to see if there's other places where I can try and help out, too."hBetween helping manage the Anomaly reports, and that, uh, freezing New World expedition together..."It was... a lot to manage."But it just... felt right."5To finally be able to do something right myself."LBeing able to support you there, and support behind the counter here..."ZERO: ...Y'know, \PN..."3All that time behind the desk got me thinking."VKinda want to see if there's some other places where I can try and help out, too."3Helping manage all of those Anomaly reports..."It just... felt right."~If we could all do the little things within our power to help the people around us, then maybe