Eeeh?"Eeeeeeh?"She's gonna love it."wIt's nice to have someone who you know will be there for you in the future instead of having to cling to the past!"+That's why communication is important!"Also bubbles!"$JULIA: A one, two, three, four~"'Give me TNT if you want some more~"JULIA: THIS IS MY SONG!!!"0JULIA: C'mon, \PN, show me how you work it!"1JULIA: This place always has the best music!"%JULIA: Let's blow this place up!"$FLORINIA: Greetings again, \PN."&I am... relieved to see you well."9This speaker is grateful to see you return unharmed."%There are two reasons therefore:"lFirst, it is only natural to be concerned about another's well-being after an untimely disappearance..."However..."dWhile the obvious level degree of human sympathy naturally still takes precedence and priority,")An additional selfish aspect exists."It's... Julia."rShe has repeatedly attempted to correlate your disappearance to a variety of statistically impossible causes."6It is... what some would probably call obnoxious."Maddening, perhaps."�And because I alone have continued to doubt the validity of her claims, she has made it a personal undertaking to repeat them as much as possible,"5And in increasing magnitudes of improbability..."tJulia has repeatedly attempted to correlate your disappearance to a variety of statistically impossible causes."OWhen this speaker did not believe her initial suggestion, she tried again."JAnd when the second trial produced additional failure, she continued."�The only worthwhile comment that can be said of any of it is that persistence is rivaled only by the sheer magnitude of her ridiculousness."BTherefore, additional gratitude for your return is warranted."-Thank you for inadvertently rescuing us.";FLORINIA: This is all very difficult to process fully."REmotions are ultimately mere electrical stimulation on a biological hardware."YEven then, what part of that electricity-- what neurotransmitter is responsible for,";The peace that the system feels upon accepting itself?"dWhat evolutionary mechanism had already adapted to protect even the very concept of mechanisms?"ZAnd even naming the specific chemicals and voltages involved, the routes they trace--"IHow should such things influence my perception as a conscious being?"AWhy is it my eyes that I, as a conscious being, see through?"YWhat makes my emotions so special that they need to be felt more than anyone else's?"All of the questions..."$...Don't have answers, do they?"HNo amount of science or study is equal to the task of solving them."\No, it's better to simply accept the way things are, and enjoy the lightness of it all.")There can be peace even under siege."bFLORINIA: I am grateful to not have closed the proverbial book on my former friends entirely."uIt is perhaps lamentable how regularly they require one to go in and avail themselves of their own drama, but..."9I suppose that is what some refer to as being the..."..."Mom friend"..."3...I do not know how I feel about that phrase."5Julia appears to be planning something sinister."^...Against my better judgment, I am rather looking forward to finding out what it may be.",FLORINIA: There's too much to identify."8A solution of hope and fear and relief and anxiety,"jBut independent of all of those feelings together, I can say with confidence that I'm glad he's back."<No analysis was necessary to settle on that conclusion."FLORINIA: ...\PN?"Something has happened?"Fern has--"...Understood.",I am glad to see that you are unharmed."7Actually, I had wanted to ask you about something."QSince the emergence of this 'New World', in addition to various Legendaries,"CCreatures known as 'Ultra Beasts' have been appearing as well."%I've been... curious, I suppose,"�About the differences between them, and would much appreciate the chance to inspect any further instances of them you might encounter."dThis speaker recognizes the dangers you have faced, and is glad that you have emerged unharmed."A query:"�Since the emergence of the phenomenon known as the 'New World', in addition to the presence of an unusual number of Legendary Pokémon,"NReports of the creatures known as 'Ultra Beasts' have also been received."�While this speaker has encountered one so far, further study of multiple samples is merited to ascertain validity of prior observations."-Have you encountered any such creatures?"Interesting."May I see?"?A moment, while this speaker examines the relevant data..."FLORINIA: Interesting.",Your assistance is greatly appreciated."IFLORINIA: The pertinent data has been downloaded from your Pokédex."8FLORINIA: Please return if you find an Ultra Beast."A shame."CIf you encounter any, I would appreciate if you would tell me.",I find the creatures quite interesting."vIf the subject encounters any such beings at any time in the future, this speaker would be interested in knowing."'FLORINIA: Thank you for your help."AI have been fascinated by these creatures for some time now."Thank you."QI've acquired a few of these specialized Poke Balls since all of this began."8To show my gratitude, I would like you to have one.".FLORINIA: Your assistance is appreciated.">The opportunity to study this data will prove invaluable."#In return, please accept this."oA small number had been collected to aid in study, and it would perhaps aid you in your endeavors as well."IFLORINIA: So Fern has decided to loiter around this place now too..."H...Perhaps it is for the best that he is no longer hiding his face."There is..."8...A surplus of confounding emotional information--"Er, that is to say...",I'm... not sure what to feel right now."NFLORINIA: There will always be uncertainties and confounding variables..."BTo gather all of one's anxieties and face them head- first..."%Perhaps that's what luck is for."AFLORINIA: I appreciate you taking the moment to check on me.".FLORINIA: This place is still a little..."Overstimulating.":Still, I would rather be here with everyone than not."FLORINIA: Good day."What do you require?"#SHELLY: \PN, is it really you?"(You're back, safe and sound, truly?"Huh..."5Don't get me wrong-- I'm relieved you're back..."6But to be honest, I'm also a little disappointed."ZI heard that you'd fallen into a Darkrai's nightmare and it wouldn't let you wake up!"\And-- And I wanted, you know, since you had always been going around saving everyone..."`Um, I was thinking that, this time, maybe it would be nice if I could be your hero instead."_I've been going on a lot of Legendary hunts, hoping I'd eventually run into that Darkrai--"<...But if you're back, I guess it's already dealt with."9And that's what's most important-- that you're here."+I'm so glad you made it! Welcome back!"SHELLY: D-don't tell me..."#I heard about what happened..."1\PN... You were attacked by a Darkrai again?"+And-- and I still wasn't here to help!"@I suppose it's probably easier after you've done it once..."5B-but still! That's twice I've missed my chance!",And of course, twice you've been taken!"KI'm not sure why Darkrai keep coming after you, but they need to stop!"_Maybe-- maybe it was the same one? And now that you've caught it, it will leave you alone!"I hope so, anyway..."B-but don't worry, \PN!"8I know I missed the first two times, but I promise,"$Someday I'm going to be a hero."8I've gotten so much stronger, and so much braver..."&I'm going to keep helping people!"SHELLY: But, um--"Please do be careful."5A-and maybe... stay away from Darkrai out there."VJust in case it wasn't only the one, and more are angry with you for some reason."<Even if you can break out, nightmares aren't very nice."SHELLY: \PN?"9I was wondering-- did you really go and time travel?"`Heather wouldn't stop talking about it after she'd gone to ask Simon about what happened..."*Um, and I just had to ask for myself!"eI'd heard that you met Heather and her mom, and I was, um... wondering if-- if I was there, too?"5I-I mean, you don't have to tell me or anything!"1SHELLY: O-oh! You 