4[[y"Locked."#LUNA: Hello, \PN, and welcome."2We last parted ways not far from here before,"6Though it looked much different then, did it not?",Nothing can refuse the tides of change,"!Not even nothingness itself."eTo you, I am eternally indebted for preventing Lin from overwriting our world with this new one."But you must understand,"DThat I am also indebted to Lin for making this dream a reality."_I have always said that the beauty of darkness lies in its infinite potential, have I not?"7One never knows just what lies beyond arm's reach,"/Whether it is the warm embrace of a lover,"Or the maw of a demon."Here, both exist."2I believe there can be no finer edge to walk.""No finer pleasure to savor..."But I dally."4You are here for business rather than pleasure."Noel and Mother..."Anna, Noel and Mother..."!Rest assured, they are safe."Asleep, but safe."HAfter all, even the worst nightmare is safer than the waking world."%Still, is it not time they rose?"4As ever, \PN, the way forward is yours to take.":LUNA: As ever, \PN, the way forward is yours to take."jLUNA: One day, this germinal world will produce visions and landscapes far surpassing any among ours."kBut like an artist who's only just taken to the brush, what it can create right now is rather limited."oOver time, as it too grows with experience and history, its productions will become more and more complex,"�With mountains as melodies and moments as motifs, each stroke it makes plays over each other as if building up to a melodious canon."ZI can only hope that I will still be around to hear its performance at its crescendo."(For now, it is no such grand thing,"WBut more like two songs played over each other, each vying for its listener's ear.";You will find our world twisted together alongside it."FIn particular, it seems to have tangled up in my Master's estate."Look there."=LUNA: It is still possible to step into our world there."LPockets of that world have been isolated behind and among this reality."{It is how what should have been an ordinary trip to explore Master's castle ended up with each of them stuck in this realm."KBut that does not mean those pockets line up to what we see perfectly."NIf a door is locked, it may as well be as if nothing is behind it at all."3And in this case, that is very well the truth."CLike a lamp with no bulb, what we seek simply isn't there yet."LUNA: Fear not."qIn a world as unstable as this, I have no doubt that there is a way for us to connect the dots, so to speak."`Let us search and find what belongs behind each door, so that it may put itself into place."fLUNA: Let us search and find what belongs behind each door, so that it may put itself into place."NLUNA: With this, two ends of our worlds have been stitched to each other."pIt is perhaps unsurprising that the needle required for such a thing would have been left about this place."nI suspect that Lin may have intended the New World to serve as a sort of playground or toy box for her..."MAnd what a dangerous toy that is, isn't it, able to sew worlds together?")It is just to her liking, I imagine.",Nevertheless, there will be others now."*Let us hope that they can be reached."lLUNA: Needles may be dangerous, but I am not of the opinion that we should withhold them from children."NAfter all, it is only through experience that one will learn proper care."!LUNA: You saw Noel, did you?"EWorry not. I'm sure we'll be able to connect to him soon enough."JLUNA: It would seem that we've arrived at our final destination here."FFear not; the others have been safely escorted out of this place."0Let us focus solely on the trial before us.":To that end, there is something you must be aware of."UThis Cresselia was generated here in the New World, among all of its infinities,"5And as a result, it is the source of an Anomaly."BThat Anomaly is the swirling aura that encompasses Cresselia."�It has the effect of attracting, strengthening, and directing other Pokémon, much like how a planet's gravity maintains its moons."YWhen confronting an Anomaly, please be prepared to deal with these 'moons', as well."@The Pokémon at the source of the Anomaly is also affected."ZYou may find that the Anomaly gives it extra strength, or renewed life, for instance.")There is no need for alarm, however."MOnce you defeat the Anomaly, it will disappear, leaving only its source."[Its source may still be healthy afterwards, but its power will be drastically reduced."JAt this point, you will be able to catch it, should you so choose to."!Does all of that make sense?"LUNA: Very good."*LUNA: My apologies for the confusion."eTo put it in simpler terms, think of confronting these Legendary Pokémon as a two step process:"hFirst, you will fight the Anomaly and its accompanying Pokémon, much like as if it were a Trainer."DSecond, you will confront the wild Legendary Pokémon directly."+But let us not dally too much further."5After all, it seems that Anna is waiting for us."5LUNA: And it would seem she is not the only one."@LUNA: After all, it seems that Cresselia is waiting for us."#CRESSELIA: Liiiiiiiiiiiiiiiii!"Cress--?"LUNA: Well met, as ever."!The second phase begins now.":With the energy dispelled, its defenses are weakened."4If you wish to catch it, now would be the time."LUNA: It's coming back."Once more, please, \PN?"CRESSELIA: Cress!!!"LUNA: And so it's done."1You've handled this as expertly as expected."9But I suppose there is nothing left for us here now."tThe castle will not return to normal, but somehow I doubt that Master will mind the redecoration terribly much."kMeanwhile, this world has developed quickly enough that I'm afraid nothing is near this place anymore."~It is likely we will need to rely on other entrances to do so, but there still is a chance we will find him in this place too."STo that end, I suppose I must eventually step back into the light for a spell."LUNA: Curious."-She isn't waking up like the others did?"'She is most certainly breathing..."PBut if Cresselia wasn't what was keeping her asleep, then what could it be?"?You don't suppose she's just having a sweet dream, do you?"ANevertheless, I'll take responsibility to see her to safety."=I am aware that I owe her for several things, after all."DAh, by the way, I found this while I was exploring the nebulae."ENow that you've returned, I suppose you may find some use in it."-LUNA: As always, it has been a pleasure."bI understand the Nightclub has been serving as a base of operations for exploring this place?"*Would you like to accompany me there?"LUNA: Then let us be off."LUNA: Very well."$Until next our destinies cross~"Yes"No[y"Verrouillé."#LUNA: Hello, \PN, and welcome."2We last parted ways not far from here before,"6Though it looked much different then, did it not?",Nothing can refuse the tides of change,"!Not even nothingness itself."eTo you, I am eternally indebted for preventing Lin from overwriting our world with this new one."But you must understand,"DThat I am also indebted to Lin for making this dream a reality."_I have always said that the beauty of darkness lies in its infinite potential, have I not?"7One never knows just what lies beyond arm's reach,"/Whether it is the warm embrace of a lover,"Or the maw of a demon."Here, both exist."2I believe there can be no finer edge to walk.""No finer pleasure to savor..."But I dally."4You are here for business rather than pleasure."Noel and Mother..."Anna, Noel and Mother..."!Rest assured, they are safe."Asleep, but safe."HAfter all, even the worst nightmare is safer than the waking world."%Still, is it not time they rose?"4As ever, \PN, the way forward is yours to take.":LUNA: As ever, \PN, the way forward is yours to take."jLUNA: One day, this germinal world will produce visions and landscapes far surpassing any among ours."kBut like an artist who's only just taken to the brush, what it can create right now is rather limited."oOver time, as it too grows with experience and history, 