hat Nightclub of yours from time to time."9Heard it's fancy-- maybe even a good place to train."0Especially if the Champion might be around.".For now, I'll leave you two to the catch.".We've no business with it anymore anyway."Good luck!")ARC: Well, someone's feeling better."ZERAORA: Ora!"8ARC: ...And it sounds like it wants to go with you."9I guess you earned its respect in that whole ordeal."gJust as well-- it's likely safer with you than staying wild and a potential target for that woman."ZERAORA: Zerrra!"ARC: That okay with you?"ZERAORA: Razza!!")ARC: What, you really don't want it?"GCan't say I understand it, but I'll respect your decision in turn."You sure about that?"-ARC: All right, if that's what you want."CIn that case, Zeraora, you mind tagging along with me instead?"HI'll keep you safe and sound just the same, sure as the sun shines."ARC: Thought as much."It's all yours, then."*ARC: Sounds like that's a wrap, then."-Thanks for tuning into this one with me."#I think we did some good here."0You ready to head back to the club already?"#ARC: Roger that; let's be off."$ARC: Then it's 'till next time."$Pichu is trapped in the cage..."&Geodude is trapped in the cage..."4Capture the weak ones to lure out the strong..."$Now we just gotta wait for it--"+Oh, right, gotta try and stop you too!"VAll right, you win for now... I was going easy on you anyway, 'cause you're cute."#Man, that speed is incredible!"Strong, too--"<It rescued the Pokémon in an instant just like that...">Well, I guess there's nothing to do but head on out, huh?"1You've still got some work to do, don't you?"!Go easy on Willow, will you?"'She's kinda in a slump these days."=The client's probably still waiting somewhere northeast.""She's a beauty-- and a brute."See ya!"0FERN: Ugh, get back here, you stupid pixie!"FERN: Now I've got you!"wIf you were just going to get cornered anyway, you may as well have saved me the trouble and not bothered running!"MEW: Mew?"FERN: Don't you mew at m