esent!"CELEBI: Biiiii~">TAUBE: Taka, I'm sure people would miss you just as much."HYou both seem very kind, traveling through time to help a Pokémon."�But of course, I do not expect you to sit around reading and discussing theology while you wait-- though you are welcome to, if you would enjoy that."6I notice you both appear to be Pokémon Trainers.":I must admit I don't find much time to battle, but..."nWell, with my son just born, this might be the last chance I have to battle for a while; I'll be so busy!"6TAKA: Ah, well... I'm pretty rusty, to be honest."$But not \PN! He's the Champion!"%But not \PN! She's the Champion!"'But not \PN! They're the Champion!""TAUBE: The Champion, you say?">From another region, or do we get a League in the future?"<You know, don't answer that. I probably shouldn't know."bI doubt a humble man of the cloth will be much of a challenge for a Champion of any region..."ABut I hope I can at least help pass the time while you wait."fNo pressure, of course. Feel free to look around, but speak to me if you feel like a battle, \PN!"+TAKA: So Father was born... yesterday?"#And Grandfather seems... nice?"This is a lot to take in."QHonestly, watching a battle might take my mind off of how weird this all is."I apologize, my Lord;"0This temple holds a lot of memories for me."I was briefly overwhelmed."3When I was a child, I would often visit Phoe--",ELIAS: Ah, the task at hand. Of course."aFather Taube is an incredibly important and busy man, but he will surely aid us with Celebi."6Also I kindly request you do not mention my name."6It may be complicated if he figures out who I am."$ELIAS: Aquila non capit muscas."nWe understand you are incredibly busy, and would not bother you if we were not in the utmost need of aid."Tempus rerum imperator." ???: Time waits for no man."4You are very well versed in the ancient tongue."5Judging by your garb, you are also of our Order?"kIt is of no matter-- I truly am in a hurry, but if this is as urgent as you 