es though..."[If you need, I think I can prompt one of your Pokémon to learn the move here and now."Should we see about it?"BENNETT: Good luck."9BENNETT: From this point, we'll need \v[614] things:"*One Sweet Apple, for the main course.")...And I see you have it. Good work."-One Tart Apple, for substance and depth."(...And you've gotten it. Well done."-One Balm Mushroom, for a second texture." You've got that. Excellent."TOne Pecha Berry, for the signature sweetness. Check the Headbutt trees for one.",You have the Pecha Berry. Im-pecha-ble."...Sorry. Anyway..."-Berry Juice, for sweetness and thinning.")You have the Berry Juice. Wonderful."gA Farfetch'd's Stick. This leek will sauté into a perfect start, and the ends are a good garnish."<I see you have a Stick... Leek. Whatever. I'll take it."tRage Powder. Properly treated, this powder stops having adverse effects and starts being a wonderful spice mix."1And you've got it. Expectably reliable work."...That should be it."qIf you want some hints on where to find everything, feel free to ask. I have a general idea for most things."&BENNETT: You got everything then."#Fantastic work as always, \PN."HSERRA: One pot of questionable cleanliness, ready to go as ordered."=BENNETT: We were fortunate to find everything we needed.",Let's hope our fortune carries forward."2SERRA: I guess I'll get started with cooking."What all did you find?"GBENNETT: Everything we need for Galarian-style Spiced Apple Curry."SERRA: Curry! In a cave!"4Shall I prepare the other four courses as well?"BENNETT: ...No,"4In fact, why don't you leave the cooking to me?":SERRA: Oh, please. What would you know about cooking?"MYou've never prepared so much as microwaveable Hot Pokétt for yourself.""BENNETT: Not under your roof."MBut I've learned much in my time away, including how to care for myself."3I would enjoy a chance to demonstrate as much."3SERRA: Well... We could try to do it together."As equals?"BENNETT: As equals, then."(Would you mind skinning the apples?"&Volcarona can get the fire going."4\PN, you've done enough. Have a seat and relax.")The rest of this meal will be on us."0A hole in the ground shoots directly below."
