 for human consumption."tAnd you will hold the Oran Juice as well. It is unsuitable for all occasions except the blandest of breakfasts."Hop to it, garçon."FWe can't all stand around all day with stupid looks on our faces."EUSTACE: Garçon?" Where is my juice, garçon?"'The service here is truly abysmal."4JULIA: \PN, I thought that was you who went by!"(What a coincidence seeing you here!"JI was invited for a trip abroad by someone, and would you believe it?"I got stood up!"Me!",Imagine a cheerleader getting stood up!"RI hope the guy recently realized he was gay, or else I want an explanation!!!"xAnd if he did realize he's gay, then I hope he's very happy with his life choices and finds a wonderful husband!!!!"CBut not if the husband would've been interested in me instead!"=It's a pity-- he seemed like such a sweet-talker, too..."But no matter!"*I'm making the best of the situation!"SAnd I've met a fine gentleman in his absence, and we are having a lovely time,"+So there, Mr.Stander-Upper! Take that!"-JULIA: Maybe he just missed the train..."`I almost got on the wrong one-- but I blame him for telling me which it was so last minute!"Mrrgrgrr..."/MAXWELL: \PN. Funny running into you here."lI was just heading out on this train for a change of pace, when I met this lovely lady across from me--"JULIA: Ohstopityou~"#No, I'm kidding-- keep going--"8MAXWELL: For you, baby, I can keep going all night.".But let's take things slow, how about it?"�Anyway, regardless of whatever history we have, I do hope you wouldn't ruin a personal outing just for the sake of some petty past drama."IMy boys are back at the ranch-- you'll get no trouble from our gang."Take care."ARCHER: Ah, \PN."9I understand you're acquainted with my date tonight."�I was just heading out on some business-- which I would ask for your discretion with regards to, lest I mention your own involvement--"VWhen I encountered this young treasure who had been abandoned by some lesser man."EI feel it is only just not to let her mourn her rejection alone."(JULIA: Forget whoever that guy was!"!Tell me more about yourself!"(ARCHER: Naturally, all in due time."OWe have an entire voyage ahead of us to get to know each other, after all."DIn any case, I would appreciate if you granted us some privacy."NYou'll find no unsavory business from me on this ride-- you have my word.""MAXWELL: Until we meet again."%ARCHER: Some space, if you will?"KHow are we supposed to enjoy a moment between the two of us otherwise?"?MAXWELL: My date appears to have pulled a vanishing act..."ARCHER: Curious."Just where did she go...?"DMAXWELL: Well, it seems like we're on opposite sides again, hm?")But I'm innocent as innocent can be."What've you got to ask me?"JMAXWELL: You know, I don't think there's a point in denying this one."wEither of the orbs has power enough that could give me the edge I need to bring the Magma Gang back to full glory."%That's just a no-brainer, right?"II'd just be making myself look more suspicious if I lied about that.",MAXWELL: I'd love to give you an alibi."-I was sitting right here the whole time."1Didn't move an inch, like a good little boy."UThe problem is, the person who could corroborate that story disappeared herself,"1Which I'm guessing leaves me in the shitter."|She and I were having a lively conversation-- no idea why she'd just up and run off unless she got a very wrong idea..."MAXWELL: Well..."OI hate to do this, but that Julia girl said some pretty suspicious things."�She suggested how she could go head up to the front and make the lights go out herself-- and then low and behold, out they went."qBut she was right here when that actually happened, so I don't imagine how she could've done that, unless...""She uses an Electrode, right?"~I'm imagining an interesting scenario in which she bowls it down the center of the train, scoring a strike in the engine room.":But I didn't see any of that, so best to discount it."6She's suspicious, but I don't think she's 