urrently investigating the disturbance."SANDY: Please let me go!"8I just got lost looking for the little girl's room!"IHave you noticed that this train doesn't seem to have one anywhere?!"SANDY: Am I cursed?"Did a Hoopa jinx me?"^Is my fate to suffer misfortune after misfortune every time I so much as venture outside?"-SANDY: Don't tell me you suspect me too!"TOkay, sure, I've been known to go to extremes for the sake of the environment--"~And, sure, the Blue Orb has been said to be a powerful water source and together with the Red Orb, could reshape the climate--"�And... sure, the condition of the climate is a growing threat that nobody seems to either know what to do about or care enough to help--"DBut that doesn't mean I was going back there to steal the orbs!"aAlthough, if someone did steal the orbs, they should definitely use them to help the planet."*That's just a true statement of fact."Think about it?"CSANDY: Okay, so this isn't the most... positive... alibi, but."RAt the time of the incident, I was being detained by that officer over there!"EHe caught me over here-- just looking for the bathroom, I swear!"FAnd he held me up the entire time until it was already too late--"1Errr, I mean, until the lights came back on!";There's no way I could've had a chance to go get them!"SANDY: I'm glad you asked!"BYou remember that Ignosia Craudburry whose office we flooded?"9Turns out she's here, and I think she wants revenge!"sShe started working from home after that, and I mayyy have intercepted some of her personal correspondences..."8She wants to sell the orbs to her corporate shills!"$You know that Craudburry woman?"zI happened to come into some information when looking around at her role in the city, and I think she wants the orbs!"9Something about selling them off for corporate use--"JShe has a history of illegal trading, and this is right up her alley!"UAnd who knows what she'd buy with all the money she could get from selling them!"#Don't trust anything she says!"SANDY: Save me!"JOHN: Agh!"What do you want?!"'JOHN: Motives?! Motives for what?!"{What motive could I possibly have to steal the Red and Blue Orbs and use them to return Team Meteor to their former might?!"7JOHN: Pshh-- I need no alibi, for I am innocent..."�...And because although I confess, I may have charged towards the storage car with the intent of stealing just a glance at the orbs..."%I was assailed in the darkness--"By all of these boxes...",I tripped on one, stumbled back here..."_Passed out, and then when the lights were back on, I thought it wisest to remain hidden..."...It was not wise."I may have hit my head..."JOHN: Hmph..."vI haven't seen much of the others-- except for stepping on that boy as he was hollering about something or other."bI swear, that child screamed louder than some of our toughest cases at Dr. Connal's clinic..."...Eustace, his name was?"`I believe I saw that screen name in the CC of the message I received about this train ride."'EustaceOverlord, I believe it was."=What a devil child. He was certainly planning something."jBut I suspect several others of the notable passengers on this train received the same message I did.":The orbs were aboard-- they could be stolen, it said.">There were five recipients of the message besides myself."ESomeone was clearly setting all of this up, but who could it be?"%JOHN: Yes, allow me a respite..."My head still aches..."�EUSTACE: If you don't let me off this train right now, I swear on your mother's life I will sue you to the ends of the world and back."/This is a violation of my rights, officer."JYou are keeping me here unlawfully and you will lose your job for it,">And subsequently, your home-- your family-- your friends,"�Everything you know and have will be decimated all because of your one foolish arbitrary mistake to confine me here against my will."Now let me go, officer."GK-kid please, I've been ordered not to let anyone leave the train."8That's my job, there's nothing 