 Reborn region."DHere, the distance is too great, and the sandstorms too fierce."There's nothing for miles."YThey always told us about how more and more accidents happen around the Scrapyard...",It seems we'll be counted among them..."CONDUCTOR: I'm doing the best I can, and we at least got power restored to the cars, but I'm afraid the engine is a goner."wWe're completely grounded, and I suspect no repairs short of a completely new engine car are going to change that."RFortunately, the comm system is intact, and we've been able to radio for aid."8A rescue train is departing from Grandview Station."IWe'll load up the passengers and crew, and get everyone home safely."8But until it arrives, we've nothing to do but wait."IFor better or worse, that likely holds true for the culprit as well."4They're trapped here just as much as any of us."�CONDUCTOR: My attention was squarely on the controls the entire time before the incident-- but I'm afraid I barely know what happened.";The entire car went dark, and I heard a strange noise."PIt sounded like a Pokémon's attack-- but not one I've ever heard before..."+Reflexively, I slammed on the brakes--">Or more like I hit them in a panic, but good thing I did!"^The train came to a stop just as the engine began to make all kinds of unpleasant noises."Fearing the worst, I took cover in the back landing just in time to see shards of metal and glass fly forward with a boom."{Once the train and the sounds both came to a stop, I was able to restore power quickly, and the room was as you saw it now."lI'll continue searching to see if I can find out any more about the cause of the engine failure though."CONDUCTOR: Just as well."Good luck out there."GCHIEF: Great galloping Golisopods... How could this have happened?"Oh, \PN!"3I swear, you scared the daylights out of me..."Tell me the orbs are safe!".". ."
