e this lying down!"(\PN, prepare for a counter-assault!"4Nooo! My freedom-- My freedom is slipping away!"JULIA: Water you doing?!"MYou have to check your bag quickly, or we're all shore to be in trouble!"?If you can't search yourself, I can do a pat-drown on you!"\But seriously, if it keeps overflowing, this investigation's going to be all washed up!"Dive into your bag now!"�The Blue Orb could not be found in the possession of any of the primary suspects, but it's possible it was hidden somewhere like the Red Orb!"!The Blue Orb... Could it be?"`The chief has ordered that no one here is to leave the car until the situation is resolved."CHIEF: Report!".CONDUCTOR: I have the Red Orb right here!"OI was trying to see what repairs I could make to the engine, and I just..."Found it, inside."'CHIEF: Inside the engine, you say?"CONDUCTOR: Yes, sir."}I have no idea how it could have gotten there-- the front end wasn't even accessible until I cleared away some of the debris."CHIEF: Give it here."CHIEF: Hrrrm..."%I see! There's not a mark on it!"�Even if it were sturdy enough to remain undamaged, if it were present at the time the engine exploded, we'd expect to see some kind of soot or grime on it!"ZThis must have been placed in the engine at some point after the initial destruction!"EUSTACE: Obviously."'Even a Basculin could deduce that."CHIEF: Silence, child."!You'll speak when spoken to.")EUSTACE: And whenever else I please."4CHIEF: Officer, did your search yield anything?"OFFICER: No, sir!"[We thoroughly searched all six primary suspects, and there is no sign of the Blue Orb!"MCRAUDBURRY: And you violated at least EIGHT privacy laws in the process!"QYoung man couldn't resist getting a pat and feel in on this lady, could you?"dCan't say I blame you, but I don't want your GRUBBY PAWS coming near me any time in the future!".OFFICER: I took no pleasure in it, ma'am."With all due respect, I would rather eat the entire Tourmaline Desert one spoonful of sand at a ti