d right into my doorstep!"it'll be fun!"Ci'll make sure to have enough refreshments for everyone, okay?"so bring the whole squad!")100% labradorra tier raid, let's go!"&i'm looking forward to the party!"definitely!!!"3The crystal gleams ineffectually in the light."AThe crystal flickers ineffectually in the unstable lighting.")SERRA: The... last mirror is broken."Of course it is."0It would've been too easy otherwise, right?"aBut there's no way we're going to be able to activate four crystals with only three mirrors.",What even was the point of all of this?"8Every time we try, it's just a let down in the end."'We shouldn't have wasted our time."Might as well go home."Stupid thing..."1Broken mirrors don't do anything for anyone."Why bother?"SERRA: Uh."Did that light just...""Did it just shoot through me?"7SERRA: ...\PN, this is going to be an odd request."*But I definitely felt that just then." Use me as your last mirror."CI... think I can redirect the light in any direction you want.""Maybe this is still solvable."'SERRA: Use me as your last mirror."*I'll stand anywhere you need in here.",Just turn the lights off and direct me." SERRA: That... did it then?"SERRA: Oh, yes it did!"The door is finally open!"1Perhaps I was giving up too early after all."It would be in-character."&You can take it from here, right?"/No doubt there's another Anomaly in there."qI'll take a moment, and then I'll go see if I can get those two in the back to put down the proverbial guns."6Sit it out and maybe talk like reasonable people."�With any luck, by the time you're one Legendary richer, maybe at least two of us will be on terms that could reasonably constitute a happy family."I wouldn't hold my breath,"But then, maybe I should."-SERRA: You can take it from here, right?"8No doubt there's another Anomaly through that door."BYou'll probably just need to activate the blue crystal again."1Don't worry, that door should stay open now."I hope."$The Key reacted to the Crystal!"LUNA: Ah, good day, \PN."Are you doing well?"iI trust you're enjoying the scenery, to whatever capacity it may be enjoyed under the circumstances."�This man has once again chosen to engage in his favorite past-time of appearing from out of nowhere and incessantly expressing all of his dearest opinions on how I should be living my life."UI suppose he is very much like a parent in that regard, but I do not accept him.">As such, I do hope you will forgive the mild disturbance."PIt does me no pleasure to cause any form of inconvenience to anyone at all,"Except him, I suppose."?I shall redouble my efforts and dispatch with him at once."uLUNA: If I were to relent in the face of trifling opposition such as this, I would not be the person I am today."3Let us turn out the lights, and put this rest."/LUNA: Let it be settled in darkness again."ELUNA: It is the rare adversary who acts with a truly evil heart."iIt is precisely for that reason that we must steel ourselves even against the noblest of intentions.",The road to hell shall not pave itself."/SERRA: Oh, thank god. The cavalry is here."
