..."/My Pokemon will show you a true challenge!"6You seem a decent Trainer. I hate to destroy you."Have you heard of me?" It's my duty to defeat you!"My party is ready to roll!"<No one in the Magma Gang's ever been able to defeat me!"Hey, you! Battle me!"&I am a single melancholy flame..."!Aren't these shoes adorable?"%This establishment has no class!"(Show me your passion for this role!")Haven't I seen you somewhere before?"%Would you like to hear a secret?"GI'm a Coordinator in my spare time. Show me your Pokemon's appeal!"*My brother couldn't beat me- can you?" What is that strange smell?"*Sometimes I wish I were a princess..."'Let me play you this song I wrote!"Hello, I love you!"3Hey, have you heard Hardy play? I'm a big fan!"+It's such a fine day, don't you think?"#Heh heh. This is gonna be fun."!Well, hello there, gorgeous!"Water you looking at?" Don't think ya can fool me!"'Do I look intimidating? Be honest."4My intuition's telling me you're pretty strong!"7Battling's just another kind of mountain to climb!"Hey- are you okay?"-Are you expecting an effortless victory?"IStatistically speaking, battling here is safer than 82.6% of places.":Hey, check out my new Pokenav! It's the latest model!"$No excuses! Prepare for battle!"#I'm faster than you'd believe!"What's that look for?"Now, watch carefully."Oh, hey! Long time no see!"!Here it is, my one big shot!"OMy sister bet me I couldn't win ten battles here... I've already won nine!"Give it your all!"'You're not with Interpol, are you?"Oh, I love your hair!""I prefer battling at night..."5There's not much I like more than a good battle!"DI'm training to be a lifeguard. Can I practice while we battle?"CHmm. Do you think this would be a good place for a field trip?"*Say... you don't recognize me, right?"*I'm so mad! I got fired this morning!"I'm bored. Entertain me!"<Just be careful with my Pokemon. They're very precious!"2I hope you will not be hurt when I crush you!",Have you seen my wife? Her name's Lucy!"#There's something about you..."(A quick victory, then I'll go home."Ugh, so much homework..." I'm Victoria's biggest fan!""Something smells around here."%Battling's good for your health!"KExcuse me, which way to the men's room? This hotel is a bit confusing!""I'll wipe the floor with you!"9Can we battle quietly? I'm waiting for a phone call."Battle mode: engaged."!I know you from somewhere..."My battling is remarkable."I can mimic any Pokemon!"1Have you ever met a real telekinetic before?"0My teacher has assured me I will win today.".This is a dangerous place. Leave at once."7You won't find a cuter Trainer anywhere in Reborn!"-My wit is stronger than even my Pokemon!"-You don't know our true purpose, here...".My Pokemon are all perfectly disciplined."#Our battle shall be legendary!"3I've borrowed my boyfriend's Pokemon for this!"/You're bound to be entertaining to battle."4I wish to see how youngsters battle these days."Can you dig my sound?"IWe need to talk. Your behaviour here has not been chivalrous at all!"3I'm thinking of quitting to become a musician."You're quite striking!" You don't know my secret..."!This place makes me nervous."1Can we hurry? I'm missing my favourite show."$Hey, what's the food like here?"!Have you ever been to Hoenn?"You look pretty tired."FYou really think you can beat me? Plumeria's my cousin, you know!"+Your secret can't be hidden forever...")Don't mind me, just here to clean..."8Hold still! I need to get a picture of this moment!"EWh- a battle? Why do you want to battle me? I'm just an orderly!"I'm done holding back!"<I'm not sure this was the right part-time job for me..."<Hey, have you read the latest issue of 'Blaziken Mask'?"2You want to know why I joined the Magma Gang?"$Brace yourself for a Heat Wave!"4I keep telling the boss we need new uniforms..." Don't take this personally.")Normally, I wouldn't do this, but..."&I'll show you my fighting spirit!"%This is my 17th match this week."Check out my new shoes!""I have my own place now! Yay!" Do you like Fossil Pokemon?"I am beauty! I am grace!"Ready? Okay!"=Hey, if you see my mom, don't tell her I was here, okay?"Not much to say, huh?"!I haven't slept in a week..."2There's no telling where this battle will go!"-My battle skills are no laughing matter!""Want to play ball after this?"jLet's see... I like long walks on Azurine Island, dancing... oh, a battle? Sure, I like battling too!"%This is the best day of my life!"Heh heh..."0What kind of riffraff did they let in here?"=It's been a long shift. Time to cool down with a battle!";Behold the Great Gunnar, Reborn's most gorgeous gamer!"5This battle... Will it finally be enough for me?";I came here with my friends! It's been a blast so far!"DIt's so cold! Does someone have the air conditioner cranked up?"Man, it's nice out today."Hehe, check this out."1You're lookin' at this year's valedictorian!"'Quiet, quiet... wait for the bite."8I'm normally a Gym Trainer, but today's my day off."En garde!":Scuse me, but I couldn't help noticing-- your outfit."Um-- Prepare for battle!"&Stop me if you've heard this one."EHey, kids! Welcome to a special episode of Hal's Preschool Hour!"'Fly on the wings of love, my dear."(I had a strange dream last night..."&This music- I just have to dance!"-Hey, kid. You taking care of this place?"+Sometimes you need a hard head to win!"Charge! Charge!".I've been working on my latest invention!"BI'm a bit stuck. Let's see if this battle gives me any ideas!"*I've always been a traveler at heart."2I'll show you the best Pokemon money can buy!" Fall's my favourite season."*Hmm... should I study, or take a nap?" Ohmigosh, are you for real?"<Which color scarf do you think I should buy my Pokemon?"3How much do you know about Grass-type Pokemon?"5Let me ingrain my battle style into your memory."Life is a carnival!"*So this is what a real battle's like!"4Hey! You ever been white-water swimming before?"@I'm more of a techie, but sometimes I like to take a break."=Can you come back later? I just want to relax right now."-I want to be a Primarina when I grow up!"%Why can't I find any good cafes?":This is nice. Just some good music and a few battles."}Hey guuuys, we're live from the Reborn region! Just about to have a battle in the famous Reborn Nightclub! Wish me luck!"It's my birthday today!""Ugh... Do we have to do this?"*Get ready. I ain't here to play ball."Oooh, you look tough!"TI make Pokemon keychains. If you win, I'll give you a free customized keychain!"GI don't care what those numbskulls say, I'm the best trainer here."Man, this is the life!"Let's crash this party!"MSo if Swift has 60 base power, and I factor in- wait, I'm not ready yet!"#I am a treasure of this world!"(Why are you looking at me that way?" Please don't shout at me..."EThe trainers here have been boring me. Are you more interesting?".Don't let your wins make you comfortable."4I hate cleaning, but the battling's not so bad."$All right, let's keep it going!"You think you're special?"!Have you ever been to Unova?"*Let's all sing a happy battling song!"JBy the time I'm finished with you, you'll never want to battle again!"REven now that the city's doin' better, it's hard to find strong Pokemon here."AHey! Have you heard about our Lord and Savior Groudon today?"This won't take long..."4Y'know what bothers me about being a Blackbelt?"+You're safe... Nothing can harm you..."%Man, this is a lot of battles..." Get out of the way, please." I am the Striking Pyroar..."6Ah, a youngster! Good to meet you, young Trainer!")Hey, buddy... You seen my Growlithe?"bDon't you look at me like that! I know you think I'm an old man! Well, I've got news for you!"JYou know Adrienn, right? Do you think you could get a message to xem?"/Let me find happiness through this battle!"$Hey, what's with the long face?"It is I, Roserade Mask!"Let me read your aura...";There is no such thing as luck! I win with pure skill!"'I have a feeling I'm about to win!"Please impress me."Are you ready to lose?"Hey there!">Hey, you know where a gal can get a Soda Pop around here?"$Take a look at my cute Pokemon!"ZJust act like everything's normal, okay? Now, have you run into a cultist named Marv?":Y-you haven't seen any coppers around here, have you?""I've always loved battling..."9Battles are best when you go in without expectation."I may appear frail..."5Now watch how a sweet ol' fella like me battles!"II'm up for a promotion. Would you mind sparring with me as practice?":I'm tall, right? D'you think I can pass for an adult?"-I don't think I'm in Pastoria anymore...")Have you any interest in stargazing?"9Let's just make this quick. I have a train to catch."8I'm at the top of my class in swimming and battles!"NSo you're the one they think can defeat me? All right, give me your best."'Ohmigosh! I'm your number one fan!"CWell, well, well. What d'you think my odds are of beating you?"#I keep perfect time, each day!"?I'm writing a book! Try and give me some good inspiration."SI'm training in Pokemon first aid. Let me take a look at your Pokemon for you."KPersonally, I don't think Flying-types should even be allowed in here!"&Say... You're not looking so hot."Care to cast your line?"!You ever been to Hoppy Town?",Before we battle, let us set the stage!"4Do you know where a man can find a Pokemon spa?"!How do you do, fellow youth?"\Have you ever noticed this place looks like a fire hazard? Pretty sure I smell smoke..."&Hey, d'you want to be in my band?"Prepare to be wowed."ASay... How about we go watch the sunset together after this?"<Okay, it's settled. If I win here, I'll ask Amaria out!"MHey, d'you mind testing these cookies? I think I messed up the recipe...">Hey, have you got the time? To listen to my little rhyme?"5I love hiking, but I can't stand all the bugs..."dI've been searching for the best trail in Reborn. You've been all over, right? Any suggestions?"Last battle before break!"<I may be just a builder, but I just know I can beat ya!"5