s not been chivalrous at all!"3I'm thinking of quitting to become a musician."You're quite striking!" You don't know my secret..."!This place makes me nervous."1Can we hurry? I'm missing my favourite show."$Hey, what's the food like here?"!Have you ever been to Hoenn?"You look pretty tired."FYou really think you can beat me? Plumeria's my cousin, you know!"+Your secret can't be hidden forever...")Don't mind me, just here to clean..."8Hold still! I need to get a picture of this moment!"EWh- a battle? Why do you want to battle me? I'm just an orderly!"I'm done holding back!"<I'm not sure this was the right part-time job for me..."<Hey, have you read the latest issue of 'Blaziken Mask'?"2You want to know why I joined the Magma Gang?"$Brace yourself for a Heat Wave!"4I keep telling the boss we need new uniforms..." Don't take this personally.")Normally, I wouldn't do this, but..."&I'll show you my fighting spirit!"%This is my 17th match this week."Check out my new shoes!""I have my own place now! Yay!" Do you like Fossil Pokemon?"I am beauty! I am grace!"Ready? Okay!"=Hey, if you see my mom, don't tell her I was here, okay?"Not much to say, huh?"!I haven't slept in a week..."2There's no telling where this battle will go!"-My battle skills are no laughing matter!""Want to play ball after this?"jLet's see... I like long walks on Azurine Island, dancing... oh, a battle? Sure, I like battling too!"%This is the best day of my life!"Heh heh..."0What kind of riffraff did they let in here?"=It's been a long shift. Time to cool down with a battle!";Behold the Great Gunnar, Reborn's most gorgeous gamer!"5This battle... Will it finally be enough for me?";I came here with my friends! It's been a blast so far!"DIt's so cold! Does someone have the air conditioner cranked up?"Man, it's nice out today."Hehe, check this out."1You're lookin' at this year's valedictorian!"'Quiet, quiet... wait for the bite."8I'm normally a Gym Trainer, but today's my day off."En garde!":Scuse m