."OWhen one chapter ends, another begins. Show me the story you have written!"Give it your best!"+It's me, the best Trainer and battler!"KI used these Pokémon in my final teams in every adventure I've taken!"*The colors of the world are changing!"KOooh, I'm up against the Champion huh? Guess I better bring my A game."9So I'm sitting there, barbeque sauce on my Skitty..."kPeople are capable of creating a path towards their goal. Are you ready to fight in order to reach it?"bMaybe this night club represents the futile and endless dance of those who vie for greatness?"_G'day. I've heard a lot about you. I'd love to see the bond between you and your Pokémon." Attack perfect, full combo!">Someone stole my fucking porch. I opened my door an fell."HI'm buzzing with excitement! The anticipation has me feeling antsy!"�Yeah, I have lived without all the fancy things that people use to get somewhere in life, but I got here through sheer force of will. Now bring it!Iu;␀.h[[^"I'm strong, right?"*See? I told you nobody could beat me!"We did it!"Yay! I'm a sugar star!"Victory is mine!"We destroyed you!"You should study more."$You were hopelessly outmatched."You have a long way to go!".This was the only way it could have gone!"My mother taught me well!"6You showed me your intent, but mine was stronger!"Hahaha! I'm lolling!"2Did I not tell you? They're simply wonderful!"3My battling skills have aged like a fine wine!"IHere you are! A Sweet Kiss from my Jynx- Wait, where are you going!?"+Next, I'll pick up the dry cleaning..."#This atmosphere is to die for!"(This is what real skill looks like!"/Don't worry, you'll toughen up eventually." No one can defeat the king!"@It's delightful when your imaginations come true, isn't it?",My team knows how much I care for them!"I'm on Cloud 9!"!Watch out for the big waves!"Our strategy was the best!"Hey, I won!"?Win or lose, battles are fun... But especially when I win!"This is paradise!"Wasn't that relaxing?"IIf you think y