a anyway."&Oh, your Pokemon are so adorable!"My nose itches..."You're the true artist!"+Hey! You're not supposed to laugh now!"%You seem strong as well as kind!"#I could do little to stop you!""We must battle agan sometime!"$I guess bugs don't scare you..."!I think I learned something!"Anyone have any water?"'Well, that's a loss to remember...",Your fighting spirit is no small thing!"Excellent."1Looks like I may need to meditate some more."#Well, it was kinda fun anyway!"Hey, that was great!"%I shouldn't have taken time out."You rose to the challenge!"4You are a decent Trainer! I still hate to lose."3I'm the great knight Franka! How could I lose?"<Actually, I'm not sure battling is part of my duties..."That battle was rockin'!"5Hey, you should think about joining up sometime."!You weren't supposed to win!"I burned out!"KI guess I'll go shopping some more to cheer myself up after that loss!"You no-good Rattata!" You were dazzling, darling!"*Your battling style is familiar, too!"7The secret is: I'm really just an amateur battler."3So impressive! You've got my support for sure!"$Well, I hope you beat him, too."Oh. Maybe it's me."+I'd be a very strange, enchanted girl!"I hope you'll remember me!"!Won't you tell me your name?"He's just so cool!")Even a loss can't sour this weather!"That wasn't fun at all!"My mirror! You scuffed it!",C'mon, you could have at least laughed!"I still don't trust ya!"KI wish people would stop mistaking me for that jerk in the Magma Gang!"You've gone too far!".The view from here's pretty good, though."Now I'm not okay..."3I suppose your expectation was well-founded...")Make sure you stay out of the mines!"!M-my hard drive! It crashed!"#I've still got a lot to learn."-You're still faster? How can that be...?"!Gloating's not cool, y'know!"W-what? That was fast!"Strong as ever, I see..." You saw right through me..."My sister's such a jerk..."<I bet my sister she'd lose here, so beat her too, okay?"Don't ask me why."You battle well, too!"*The light of day throws off my focus!".Battling's fun, but I'd rather have cake."No running!"/Maybe the trainers are a bit too strong..."5The truth is, I'm undercover. Don't tell anyone!"!Fired, then defeated... Ugh!"That was entertaining!"Precious and fragile!"Perhaps I spoke too soon."#I'll just go find her, then..." You're just so fascinating!"(Well, time to go find my husband..."/I shouldn't have taken time out to battle.")I wonder if she'd sign my uniform..."I guess it was me..." Even losing helps you grow!",I'll just check down this hallway then!"I guess I'm a scrub..."5That wasn't very quiet! I hope I didn't miss it."Defeat: registered.""Where have I seen you before?"/Your battling is more remarkable, however!"'See! I'm as furious as a Primeape!"1I didn't get a chance to show my true power!"My teacher was... wrong?"'Intimidating you didn't work, huh?",Was my cuteness not distracting enough?"How dare you silence me!?"PVery well. Our true purpose is simply to make money. Anticlimactic, I know."(We fought perfectly and still lost?"6They will sing of your victory for years to come!",I guess they're not quite used to me..."%This makes me very angry indeed!"How interesting."!It's like you're soundproof!"Haven't you won enough?"FIt's like I thought. From now on, I'm focusing on my first album.",You struck my Pokemon with all you had!"*Could you... possibly know the truth?"$Where are the trees? The water?"+At least I can get back to the TV now!".I thought something smelled good earlier."/I won a free trip there once. Great place."Did you use Yawn on me?",She better never find out about this..."+You can't safeguard your own secret..."Impressive, hmm."-I don't really want a picture of this..."RSneak in to steal somethin' and get trounced in battle... this is not my day!"You crossed a line!"ANope. Definitely should've applied at Sweet Kiss Candy Shop."It's mind-blowing!".It's because I just can't stand the cold."#I'm Fire Blasting off again.